 Interface and customer CUST-0012. @eid_9307fe85, could you handle this one as well?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261105-5-8da9a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261105-5-8da9a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-cca2c2\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_9307fe85\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-06T00:23:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, I'll dive into the chart rendering issues and see what's causing those artifacts. Let's get this sorted out for our users! 💪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261105-6-30aa7\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261105-6-30aa7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-cca2c2\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b67edbb4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-06T00:26:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone! If you need any more details or run into any roadblocks, feel free to reach out. Let's keep our customers happy! 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261105-7-992ae\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261105-7-992ae\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-cca2c2\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_67f8a879\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-06T00:30:00\", \"text\": \"Will do! Thanks for organizing everything. Let's get these issues fixed! 🔧\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261105-8-55d2a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261105-8-55d2a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-cca2c2\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_9307fe85\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-06T00:34:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, team! Let's make it happen! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261105-9-d80dd\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261105-9-d80dd\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid