x_product_requirements_document_final> and <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/latest_atf_aix_product_requirements_document|latest_atf_aix_product_requirements_document>. We need to make sure all requirements are still relevant.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260611-3-eefba\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260611-3-eefba\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_19f537cf\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-11T05:34:00\", \"text\": \"I'll handle the technical side. Reviewing the <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/tuneprox_technical_specifications_document_final|tuneprox_technical_specifications_document_final> and <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/latest_atf_aix_technical_specifications_document|latest_atf_aix_technical_specifications_document> now.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260611-4-0dc7b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260611-4-0dc7b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ea95d983\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-11T05:37:00\", \"text\": \"Great! I'll check out the <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/tuneprox_system_design_document_final|tuneprox_system_design_document_final> and <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/latest_atf_aix_system_design_document|latest_atf_aix_system_design_document> to understand the current system architecture.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260611-5-560a7\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260611-5-560a7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6f719d21\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-11T05:39:00\", \"text\": \"Once everyone has reviewed their documents, let's regroup and discuss any potential areas for improvement or updates.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260611-6-a55d6\"}, \"Reactio