: \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2490c02c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-18T17:06:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers have reported positive things about ATF_AIX. It's great to see such feedback!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260903-0-60416\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260903-0-60416\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b67edbb4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-18T17:09:00\", \"text\": \"That's awesome! What did they say, Bob?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260903-1-148ed\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260903-1-148ed\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2490c02c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-18T17:14:00\", \"text\": \"Customer CUST-0093 praised the platform for its robust performance on high-end systems, especially with large datasets. No significant lag reported!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260903-2-17541\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260903-2-17541\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6f719d21\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-18T17:17:00\", \"text\": \"Impressive! Handling large datasets efficiently is a big win. Kudos to the previous team!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260903-3-f4299\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260903-3-f4299\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_35e32fec\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-18T17:18:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_2490c02c Any other feedback?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260903-4-ec1eb\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260903-4-ec1eb\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2490c02c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-18T17:19:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, Ian. Customer CUST-0029 mentioned that the Einstein Auto-Tuning feature offers comprehensive analytics and insights. It helps users understand the impact of parameter changes on model performance.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260903-5-85799\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260903-5-85799\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ad0725a2\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-18T17:21:00\", \"text\": \"That's a great feature to highlight. Understanding parameter impacts is crucial for our users.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260903-6-9ac85\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260903-6-9ac85\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8c71a7a9\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-18T17:23:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, David. It's nice to see the product being appreciated. We should keep these strengths in mind for future updates.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260903-7-74bcb\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260903-7-74bcb\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b67edbb4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-18T17:25:00\", \"text\": \"Definitely. Let's make sure we maintain these strengths while adding our own improvements.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260903-8-dee1f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260903-8-dee1f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6f719d21\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-18T17:28:00\", \"text\": \"Sounds like a plan. Let's keep the momentum going!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260903-9-282bc\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260903-9-282bc\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ad0725a2\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-21T14:00:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, one of the common issues reported for ATF_AIX is from Customer ID: CUST-0046. They're experiencing reliability issues with the system failing to update model parameters in real-time under high data loads.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260709-0-8c21f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260709-0-8c21f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2490c02c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-21T14:01:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for bringing this up, David. Since the product was developed by a different team, we might need to dig into their documentation first.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260709-1-bb287\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260709-1-bb287\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b67edbb4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-21T14:04:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, Bob. It sounds like there might be a bottleneck when handling high data loads. Could be inefficient data processing.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260709-2-8e0c2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260709-2-8e0c2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6f719d21\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-21T14:05:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_b67edbb4 Good point, David. We should also consider if there's a lack of robust error handling or failover mechanisms in place.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260709-3-ea64d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260709-3-ea64d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8c71a7a9\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-21T14:09:00\", \"text\": \"Hannah here. Maybe the system wasn't tested enough under high-load scenarios. We should check the testing logs.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260709-4-24bc7\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260709-4-24bc7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_35e32fec\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-21T14:12:00\", \"text\": \"Ian T here. I think we should simulate high data loads in our test environment to see if we can replicate the issue.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260709-5-367c7\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260709-5-367c7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6bd20afa\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-21T14:13:42\", \"text\": \"@here Explore the Optuna library, a powerful tool for hyperparameter optimization that can complement the capabilities of ATF_AIX. https://github.com/optuna/optuna\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260621-64-c4772\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260621-64-c4772\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ad0725a2\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-21T14:14:00\", \"text\": \"Great ideas, everyone. Let's make sure these customer issues are documented in the planning documents for the next release of ATF_AIX.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260709-6-ed97a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260709-6-ed97a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-22T15:34:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_07ca0a78 joined planning-ATF_AIX.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260622-64-6ff93\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260622-64-6ff93\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b67edbb4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-22T17:03:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, one of the common issues reported for ATF_AIX is that the user interface is not intuitive for new users. This was reported by Customer ID: CUST-0046.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260727-0-d7aa0\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260727-0-d7aa0\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2490c02c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-22T17:08:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for bringing this up, David. Since the product was developed by a different team, we might need to dig into their design choices.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260727-1-67f27\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260727-1-67f27\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_07ca0a78\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-22T17:10:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, Bob. One possible cause could be a complex or cluttered interface design. Maybe they tried to pack too many features into one screen?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260727-2-9257b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260727-2-9257b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6f719d21\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-22T17:11:00\", \"text\": \"Good point, Fiona. Another angle could be the lack of user-friendly navigation or guidance features. New users might be getting lost.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260727-3-abe1f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260727-3-abe1f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_35e32fec\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-22T17:16:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_6f719d21, that's possible. We should also consider if there are insufficient user training or onboarding resources. Maybe users aren't getting the help they need to get started.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260727-4-9e87d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260727-4-9e87d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8c71a7a9\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-22T17:18:00\", \"text\": \"Hannah here. We should definitely look into creating more comprehensive onboarding materials if that's the case.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260727-5-417d4\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260727-5-417d4\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b67edbb4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-22T17:19:00\", \"text\": \"Great insights, everyone. Let's make sure these customer issues are documented in the planning documents for the next release of ATF_AIX.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260727-6-8a518\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260727-6-8a518\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-22T18:54:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_9c46088d joined planning-ATF_AIX.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260622-72-53bd3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260622-72-53bd3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8c71a7a9\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-24T03:14:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, QA team found some issues in the last release of ATF_AIX. The QA specialist, eid_8b14b999, reported that the auto-tuning process can be resource-intensive, leading to slower performance on less powerful systems.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260613-0-1c6f5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260613-0-1c6f5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_7f22371d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-24T03:15:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, Hannah. Since the product was developed and QA tested by a different team, we should dig into the possible causes. Could it be due to the high computational demands of the optimization algorithms?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260613-1-cb210\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260613-1-cb210\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_9c46088d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-24T03:20:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_7f22371d, that's a good point. The algorithms might be too complex for systems with limited resources. We should look into simplifying them or providing alternatives for low-power systems.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260613-2-5a871\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260613-2-5a871\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6f719d21\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-24T03:21:00\", \"text\": \"Another angle could be inefficient resource management. Maybe the current implementation isn't optimized for low-power systems. We should review the resource allocation strategies.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260613-3-86f61\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260613-3-86f61\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_061285c7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-24T03:22:35\", \"text\": \"@here This blog post explores the concept of model tuning and its importance in achieving high-performing AI systems, much like ATF_AIX. https://blog.keras.io/hyperparameter-tuning-with-keras-tuner.html\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260624-77-414de\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260624-77-414de\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_576f3f62\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-24T03:22:37\", \"text\": \"@here Read about the impact of automated machine learning (AutoML) on AI development, a field closely related to the innovations of ATF_AIX. https://www.forbes.com/sites/forbestechcouncil/2023/01/10/the-impact-of-automated-machine-learning-on-ai-development/\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260624-78-061ea\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260624-78-061ea\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_061285c7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-24T03:23:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, Ian. Also, do we have sufficient system requirements documentation? Users might not be aware of the compatibility issues if the documentation is lacking.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260613-4-60406\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260613-4-60406\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b67edbb4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-24T03:25:00\", \"text\": \"Good point, Julia. We should ensure that the documentation clearly outlines the system requirements. This could help users assess compatibility before running the auto-tuning process.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260613-5-a435f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260613-5-a435f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8c71a7a9\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-24T03:28:00\", \"text\": \"Let's make sure these issues are documented in the planning documents for the next release of ATF_AIX. We need to address both the technical and operational aspects.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260613-6-8061e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260613-6-8061e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_7d27f1fd\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-24T21:19:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, let's review the Market Research Report and update it based on the latest issues reported. 🚀 I've shared the document above. Let's dive into the specific areas that need changes.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260624-0-4c510\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260624-0-4c510\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8c71a7a9\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-24T21:24:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_7d27f1fd, I think we should start by addressing the resource-intensive nature of the auto-tuning process. We could add a section on optimizing the algorithms for low-power systems. This might involve simplifying some of the computational processes or offering a 'light' mode for less powerful systems.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260624-1-ea8e8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260624-1-ea8e8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_35e32fec\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-24T21:27:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, Hannah. We should also include a detailed system requirements section to help users assess compatibility. This could prevent operational issues down the line. 💡\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260624-2-4b531\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260624-2-4b531\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_84b3cc1f\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-24T21:28:03\", \"text\": \"@here Dive into the Scikit-Optimize library, which offers tools for optimizing hyperparameters, similar to the functionality provided by ATF_AIX. https://scikit-optimize.github.io/stable/\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260624-85-89793\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260624-85-89793\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_07ca0a78\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-24T21:30:00\", \"text\": \"On the documentation front, we need to expand the user guides and tutorials. @eid_2490c02c, Bob, do you think adding more visual aids or step-by-step videos would help with the parameter adjustment process?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260624-3-a2fc0\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260624-3-a2fc0\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2490c02c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-24T21:31:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, Fiona. Visual aids and interactive tutorials could significantly lower the learning curve. We should also consider a FAQ section addressing common user queries. 📚\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260624-4-06fc2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260624-4-06fc2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b67edbb4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-24T21:34:00\", \"text\": \"Regarding integration issues, we might need to expand our API support. Including more data formats and protocols could enhance compatibility with third-party data sources. This should be highlighted in the integration section.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260624-5-e78d9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260624-5-e78d9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6f719d21\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-24T21:37:00\", \"text\": \"Good point, David. We should also mention any new partnerships or collaborations with data providers that could improve our data source integration. 🤝\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260624-6-8680b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260624-6-8680b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_7d27f1fd\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-24T21:39:00\", \"text\": \"Great suggestions, everyone! To summarize: we'll add a section on optimizing for low-power systems, expand the documentation with visual aids, enhance API support, and mention new partnerships. Let's aim to have a draft of these changes by next week. I'll coordinate with each of you for your respective sections. Thanks for the input! 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260624-7-1c38b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260624-7-1c38b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-35b4b2\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6a0f49ba\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-18T04:01:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug about improper session management in the auto-tuning process has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/AutoTuneForce/pull/47.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261217-0-0a93f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261217-0-0a93f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-35b4b2\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_35e32fec\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-18T04:03:00\", \"text\": \"Great news, @eid_6a0f49ba! Can you explain what the root cause was?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261217-1-6e78d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261217-1-6e78d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-35b4b2\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6a0f49ba\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-18T04:06:00\", \"text\": \"Sure, Ian. The root cause was a failure to implement robust session management practices. Specifically, session tokens used during the auto-tuning process weren't being invalidated in a timely manner. This left them vulnerable to hijacking, allowing attackers to alter model parameters.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261217-2-7637c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261217-2-7637c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-35b4b2\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_35e32fec\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-18T04:07:00\", \"text\": \"Got it. How did you manage to fix it?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261217-3-4d32c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261217-3-4d32c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-35b4b2\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6a0f49ba\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-18T04:10:00\", \"text\": \"We addressed the issue by implementing a more secure session management protocol. Now, session tokens are automatically invalidated after each tuning session. Additionally, we've added checks to ensure tokens are only valid for a single use, reducing the risk of them being reused maliciously.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261217-4-44acb\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261217-4-44acb\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-35b4b2\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_35e32fec\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-18T04:13:00\", \"text\": \"That sounds like a solid fix, George. Thanks for taking care of this so quickly!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261217-5-276aa\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261217-5-276aa\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-35b4b2\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6a0f49ba\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-18T04:14:00\", \"text\": \"No problem, @eid_35e32fec. Let me know if you need any more details or if there's anything else I can help with.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261217-6-4bf32\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261217-6-4bf32\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-35b4b2\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6a0f49ba\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-26T12:59:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug titled 'Memory Leak in Parameter Storage' has been resolved. 🎉\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261226-0-994f5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261226-0-994f5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-35b4b2\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6a0f49ba\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-26T13:03:00\", \"text\": \"The issue was due to improper memory management in the parameter storage module, which caused a gradual memory leak. This led to the optimization engine losing track of parameter updates over time.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261226-1-6545e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261226-1-6545e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-35b4b2\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6a0f49ba\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-26T13:07:00\", \"text\": \"I've submitted a fix that ensures proper deallocation of memory after each parameter update cycle. This prevents memory exhaustion and maintains the integrity of parameter history. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/AutoTuneForce/pull/48\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261226-2-5e8ee\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261226-2-5e8ee\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-35b4b2\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_35e32fec\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-26T13:11:00\", \"text\": \"Great work, @eid_6a0f49ba! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. I'll review the PR shortly.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261226-3-08037\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261226-3-08037\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-35b4b2\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6a0f49ba\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-26T13:13:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Ian! Let me know if you have any questions or need further clarification on the changes.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261226-4-37962\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261226-4-37962\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-35b4b2\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_35e32fec\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-26T13:16:00\", \"text\": \"Will do, George. This fix should help improve the stability of our optimization engine significantly.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261226-5-69625\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261226-5-69625\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-35b4b2\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6a0f49ba\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-26T13:21:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, Ian. Looking forward to seeing the improvements in our next round of tests.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261226-6-1c133\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261226-6-1c133\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-35b4b2\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_35e32fec\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-24T01:40:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with AutoTuneForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270123-0-c7d2b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270123-0-c7d2b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-35b4b2\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_35e32fec\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-24T01:41:00\", \"text\": \"First up, we have a 'Cache Invalidation Bug Causes Stale Data Usage'. The caching mechanism in the Data Ingestion API isn't invalidating outdated data properly. This is causing slower model adaptation and outdated predictions for CUST-0093. @eid_6a0f49ba, this one's for you. Can you take a look? 🙏\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270123-1-cbf06\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270123-1-cbf06\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-35b4b2\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6a0f49ba\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-24T01:42:00\", \"text\": \"Got it! I'll dive into the caching mechanism and see what's causing the stale data issue. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270123-2-6d572\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270123-2-6d572\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-35b4b2\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_35e32fec\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-24T01:44:00\", \"text\": \"Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Data Parsing Error Leads to Incomplete Data Ingestion'. The Data Ingestion API is having trouble parsing certain data formats, leading to incomplete data for model optimization. This is affecting CUST-0065. @eid_04a698e5, can you handle this one? 🤔\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270123-3-5c113\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270123-3-5c113\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-35b4b2\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_04a698e5\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-24T01:48:00\", \"text\": \"Sure thing! I'll check the parsing logic and ensure we're handling all data formats correctly. Let's get this sorted for CUST-0065. 💪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270123-4-259a7\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270123-4-259a7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-35b4b2\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_35e32fec\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-24T01:52:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's a 'Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) in Parameter Adjustment Interface'. The web interface is vulnerable to XSS attacks, which could lead to unauthorized access and manipulation of model parameters. This is a security risk for CUST-0070. @eid_04a698e5, can you also tackle this one? 🔒\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270123-5-cbd08\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270123-5-cbd08\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-35b4b2\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_04a698e5\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-24T01:57:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, I'll prioritize this and patch the vulnerability ASAP. Security is key! 🔐\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270123-6-1475c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270123-6-1475c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-35b4b2\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_35e32fec\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-24T01:58:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone! Let's keep our customers happy and our models running smoothly. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or further details. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270123-7-1f0cc\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270123-7-1f0cc\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-35b4b2\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6a0f49ba\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-24T02:02:00\", \"text\": \"Will do! Thanks for coordinating, @eid_35e32fec. 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270123-8-3fb0b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270123-8-3fb0b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-35b4b2\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_04a698e5\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-24T02:07:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the updates, @eid_35