astAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_86044ae5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-02T23:15:00\", \"text\": \"Let's make sure these customer issues are documented in our planning documents for the next release of castAIX.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260419-7-7dd56\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260419-7-7dd56\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T00:30:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_d508e9fb joined planning-castAIX.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260403-75-e1180\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260403-75-e1180\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T12:07:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, one of the common issues reported for castAIX is occasional inaccuracies in predictions when dealing with highly volatile data. This was reported by Customer ID: CUST-0099.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260404-0-281d1\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260404-0-281d1\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d508e9fb\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T12:08:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for bringing this up, David. Since the product was developed by a different team, we might need to dig into their documentation to understand the forecasting algorithms used.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260404-1-7173f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260404-1-7173f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_12f75faa\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T12:12:00\", \"text\": \"Good point, Bob. It could be that the algorithms aren't handling data volatility well enough. We should check if they have any mechanisms for that.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260404-2-dace9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260404-2-dace9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f86a00ce\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T12:17:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed. Another angle could be the lack of advanced machine learning models that can adapt to rapid changes in data. We might need to consider integrating more adaptive models.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260404-3-f0205\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260404-3-f0205\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_86044ae5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T12:21:00\", \"text\": \"That's a valid point, Fiona. Also, we should look into the data preprocessing steps. Insufficient data quality checks might be contributing to these inaccuracies.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260404-4-3f16c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260404-4-3f16c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T12:22:00\", \"text\": \"Great insights, everyone. Let's make sure we document these potential causes in our planning documents for the next release of castAIX.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260404-5-e8e19\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260404-5-e8e19\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d508e9fb\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T12:24:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, David. I'll start drafting a section in the planning doc to capture these issues and our proposed solutions.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260404-6-42b23\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260404-6-42b23\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_12f75faa\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T12:27:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Bob. Let's also schedule a meeting to discuss this further and align on next steps.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260404-7-8f3bd\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260404-7-8f3bd\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f86a00ce\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T12:28:00\", \"text\": \"Sounds good. I'll coordinate with everyone to find a suitable time.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260404-8-6b022\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260404-8-6b022\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_86044ae5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T12:30:00\", \"text\": \"Looking forward to it. Let's make sure we address these issues thoroughly.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260404-9-06708\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260404-9-06708\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_3b36c220\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-22T06:14:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, I just wanted to kick off our discussion about the castAIX product. Let's start by reviewing the documents from the last release. Here are the <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/castprox_market_research_report_final|castprox_market_research_report_final> and <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/latest_castaix_market_research_report|latest_castaix_market_research_report>.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260322-0-4ab93\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260322-0-4ab93\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\"