\"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2d72674d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-30T03:41:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_4f30e22e, that's a valid concern. We should review the model's architecture and training process to ensure it's balanced.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260327-4-64bec\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260327-4-64bec\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_90359c89\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-30T03:43:04\", \"text\": \"@here Explore the Scikit-learn library, a powerful tool for building predictive models for lead scoring. Perfect for understanding the tech behind AIX. https://scikit-learn.org/stable/\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260330-28-63ec4\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260330-28-63ec4\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-30T03:44:00\", \"text\": \"Another angle is operational. Maybe the model hasn't been updated or retrained regularly to adapt to new data patterns. We should check the update logs.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260327-5-9b980\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260327-5-9b980\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f98d7490\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-30T03:47:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, keeping the model updated is crucial. Let's make sure there's a process in place for regular updates and retraining.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260327-6-039be\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260327-6-039be\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4f30e22e\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-30T03:51:00\", \"text\": \"We should document these issues and potential causes in our planning documents for the next release of AIX. It'll help us track and address them systematically.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260327-7-8ad43\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260327-7-8ad43\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2d72674d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-30T03:56:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, Ian. I'll make sure these points are included in the planning documents. Thanks for the input, everyone!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260327-8-871bb\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260327-8-871bb\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-30T05:04:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_55f01e31, @eid_7b85a749, @eid_88e74382, @eid_b814ccfb joined planning-AIX.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260330-32-ddc9d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260330-32-ddc9d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_88e74382\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-30T16:54:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, QA team found some issues in the last release of AIX. The report came from QA Specialist eid_ddbe5577.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260418-0-f333a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260418-0-f333a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4f30e22e\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-30T16:58:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, Charlie Davis. What exactly did they find?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260418-1-98119\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260418-1-98119\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_88e74382\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-30T16:59:00\", \"text\": \"The main issue is that the user interface isn't intuitive, making it hard for new users to navigate and use all features effectively.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260418-2-0153e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260418-2-0153e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-30T17:03:00\", \"text\": \"Sounds like a UX design problem. Maybe the design didn't consider user feedback enough?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260418-3-06fe0\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260418-3-06fe0\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_55f01e31\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-30T17:08:00\", \"text\": \"Good point, Ian Jones. It could also be that the design has a steep learning curve. We might need to simplify it.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260418-4-088f5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260418-4-088f5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_7b85a749\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-30T17:11:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, Hannah. Another angle could be the lack of proper user training or onboarding resources.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260418-5-115ab\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260418-5-115ab\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b814ccfb\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-30T17:13:00\", \"text\": \"True, Charlie Smith. The previous team might not have prioritized training materials.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260418-6-52cbf\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260418-6-52cbf\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4f30e22e\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-30T17:16:00\", \"text\": \"We should definitely look into integrating more user feedback in the design process for future releases.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260418-7-fd988\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260418-7-fd988\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-30T17:21:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, and maybe we can also create some quick-start guides or tutorials for new users.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260418-8-a9ba8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260418-8-a9ba8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_55f01e31\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-30T17:25:00\", \"text\": \"Let's make sure these issues are documented in the planning documents for the next release of AIX.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260418-9-e0887\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260418-9-e0887\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b48f959b\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-25T13:09:00\", \"text\": \"@here check full demo of our latest release https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/ProX/demo_4\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260425-0-53a0a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260425-0-53a0a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-25T14:14:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_890654c4 joined planning-AIX.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260325-11-9c214\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260325-11-9c214\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-27T16:19:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_2d72674d, @eid_4f30e22e joined planning-AIX.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260327-12-3b2cc\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260327-12-3b2cc\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-28T21:06:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers have reported positive things about AIX. It's great to see such feedback!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260327-0-3ad5f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260327-0-3ad5f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2d72674d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-28T21:11:00\", \"text\": \"That's awesome! What did they say, Ian?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260327-1-bbb8d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260327-1-bbb8d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-28T21:12:00\", \"text\": \"Customer CUST-0063 mentioned that the AI-powered lead scoring is really helping them prioritize high-quality leads and improve conversion rates.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260327-2-6a5e4\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260327-2-6a5e4\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4f30e22e\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-28T21:17:00\", \"text\": \"Nice! That's a big win for the sales teams using AIX.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260327-3-b0858\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260327-3-b0858\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f98d7490\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-28T21:21:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely. And CUST-0109 reported that the detailed analytics and insights are helping them make informed decisions about lead engagement strategies.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260327-4-3f9c6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260327-4-3f9c6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2d72674d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-28T21:25:00\", \"text\": \"That's really valuable feedback. It shows how AIX is making a difference in their decision-making process.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260327-5-60abf\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260327-5-60abf\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-28T21:29:00\", \"text\": \"And CUST-0058 highlighted that AIX's ability to continuously learn from past data is enhancing its predictive accuracy over time.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260327-6-e2b6f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260327-6-e2b6f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4f30e22e\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-28T21:34:00\", \"text\": \"It's great to hear that the system is evolving and improving with use. Kudos to the previous team for setting such a strong foundation.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260327-7-11a7b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260327-7-11a7b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f98d7490\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-28T21:36:00\", \"text\": \"Definitely. We should build on these strengths and continue to enhance the product.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260327-8-407a8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260327-8-407a8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2d72674d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-28T21:37:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed. Let's keep this momentum going and ensure we maintain this level of satisfaction.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260327-9-8f9dc\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260327-9-8f9dc\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-ianjones-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-585771\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-11T18:25:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_99835861 created this channel on 2026-09-11 18:25:00. This is the very beginning of the bug-ianjones-LeadForce channel.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260911-0-53655\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260911-0-53655\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-ianjones-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-585771\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-11T18:25:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_99835861 joined bug-ianjones-LeadForce. Also, @eid_3f4b2681, @eid_c39dc658, @eid_652e8cd0, @eid_07cc9100, @eid_9f4e2c6f joined via invite.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260911-1-bdd26\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260911-1-bdd26\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-ianjones-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-585771\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-12T05:06:00\", \"text\": \"Hey team! 👋 We've got a few customer-reported issues that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260911-0-329f0\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260911-0-329f0\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-ianjones-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-585771\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-12T05:08:00\", \"text\": \"First up, we have an issue titled 'Feature Drift Causes Inconsistent Scoring'. The AI Scoring Algorithm isn't reflecting changes in lead behavior over time, leading to inconsistent and outdated lead scores. This is impacting CUST-0020, and it could mean missed opportunities or wasted resources on low-quality leads. @eid_9f4e2c6f, this one's for you.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260911-1-3feb6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260911-1-3feb6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-ianjones-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-585771\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_9f4e2c6f\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-12T05:13:00\", \"text\": \"Got it! I'll dive into the AI Scoring Algorithm and see what's causing the drift. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260911-2-33b1f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260911-2-33b1f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-ianjones-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-585771\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-12T05:16:00\", \"text\": \"Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Misconfigured Export Permissions' issue. Users are able to export more data than they're authorized to, which could lead to data breaches. This is affecting CUST-0069. @eid_9f4e2c6f, you're on this one too.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260911-3-1276e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260911-3-1276e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-ianjones-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-585771\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_9f4e2c6f\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-12T05:19:00\", \"text\": \"Understood. I'll check the Data Export Module and fix the permissions. We definitely don't want any data breaches! 🔒\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260911-4-7aaca\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260911-4-7aaca\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-ianjones-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-585771\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-12T05:23:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, @eid_9f4e2c6f! Lastly, we have an 'Improper Access Control in Export API' issue. Unauthorized users can access and export lead data, which is a big no-no. This is impacting CUST-0037. @eid_3f4b2681, can you take this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260911-5-ae35b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260911-5-ae35b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-ianjones-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-585771\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_3f4b2681\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-12T05:25:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, I'll look into the access control mechanisms in the Export API and tighten things up. Thanks for assigning it to me! 🔧\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260911-6-9917e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260911-6-9917e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-ianjones-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-585771\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-12T05:26:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome, thanks everyone for jumping on these so quickly! If you need any more details or run into any roadblocks, just shout. Let's keep our customers happy! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260911-7-c75b7\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260911-7-c75b7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-ianjones-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-585771\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_9f4e2c6f\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-12T05:29:00\", \"text\": \"Will do! Thanks for coordinating, @eid_99835861! 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260911-8-5a937\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260911-8-5a937\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-ianjones-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-585771\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_3f4b2681\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-12T05:33:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, @eid_99835861! I'll keep you posted on the progress. 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260911-9-80937\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260911-9-80937\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f98d7490\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-01T03:02:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, one of the common issues reported for AIX is the limited integration with third-party CRM systems. This was reported by Customer ID: CUST-0040.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260327-0-cef87\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260327-0-cef87\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-01T03:04:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for bringing this up, Ian. It seems like this could be a technical issue, maybe due to incompatibility with various CRM APIs?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260327-1-37308\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260327-1-37308\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4f30e22e\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-01T03:06:00\", \"text\": \"That's possible. The previous team might not have standardized integration protocols, which could be causing these disruptions.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260327-2-0c729\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260327-2-0c729\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2d72674d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-01T03:09:00\", \"text\": \"Good point, Ian Brown. Also, could it be that there were limited resources allocated for developing and maintaining these integrations?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260327-3-db0a6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260327-3-db0a6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f98d7490\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-01T03:12:00\", \"text\": \"Fiona, I think you're onto something. If the team didn't have enough resources, that could definitely impact the integration quality.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260327-4-0f14b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260327-4-0f14b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-01T03:14:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed. Plus, if the architecture isn't modular, it would be tough to support multiple CRM systems efficiently.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260327-5-04e52\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260327-5-04e52\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4f30e22e\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-01T03:18:00\", \"text\": \"Right. We should consider redesigning the architecture to be more modular in the next release.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260327-6-a545b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260327-6-a545b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2d72674d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-01T03:19:00\", \"text\": \"Let's make sure we document these issues and potential solutions in the planning documents for the next AIX release.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260327-7-0a6b3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260327-7-0a6b3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f98d7490\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-01T03:21:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, Fiona. I'll start drafting the documentation and share it with you all for feedback.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260327-8-f0765\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260327-8-f0765\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f98d7490\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T13:09:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers have reported positive things about AIX in the latest release!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260426-0-c3704\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260426-0-c3704\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_55f01e31\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T13:13:00\", \"text\": \"That's great to hear, Ian! What did they say?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260426-1-2102f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260426-1-2102f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f98d7490\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T13:14:00\", \"text\": \"Customer CUST-0117 mentioned that the platform offers robust customization options, which helps them tailor lead scoring criteria to their specific business needs.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260426-2-0f408\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260426-2-0f408\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b814ccfb\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T13:17:00\", \"text\": \"Nice! Customization is always a big win for users.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260426-3-67716\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260426-3-67716\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T13:22:00\", \"text\": \"And CUST-0009 reported that our customer support is responsive and helpful, ensuring issues are resolved quickly.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260426-4-ad3a8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260426-4-ad3a8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_7b85a749\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T13:26:00\", \"text\": \"That's awesome feedback. Kudos to the support team!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260426-5-c3101\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260426-5-c3101\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_88e74382\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T13:27:08\", \"text\": \"@here This blog post explores the role of data analytics in enhancing lead qualification processes. Learn how AIX leverages data for better results. https://analyticsvidhya.com/blog/2023/03/data-analytics-in-lead-qualification/\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260403-58-7cb4e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260403-58-7cb4e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_88e74382\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T13:28:00\", \"text\": \"Even though we didn't develop this release, it's great to see the positive impact it's having.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260426-6-75244\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260426-6-75244\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_55f01e31\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T13:32:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, Hannah. Let's make sure we maintain these strengths moving forward.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260426-7-8a393\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260426-7-8a393\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f98d7490\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T13:35:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed. We should also think about how we can build on these strengths in future updates.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260426-8-9926a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260426-8-9926a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b814ccfb\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T13:39:00\", \"text\": \"Good idea, Ian. Maybe we can brainstorm some ideas in our next meeting?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260426-9-a0da2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260426-9-a0da2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T13:41:00\", \"text\": \"Sounds like a plan. I'll add it to the agenda.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260426-10-58d15\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260426-10-58d15\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-24T01:42:00\", \"text\": \"@'eid_46e00bc4' created this channel on 2026-03-24 01:42:00. This is the very beginning of the planning-AIX channel.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260324-0-f252c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260324-0-f252c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-24T01:42:00\", \"text\": \"@'eid_46e00bc4' joined planning-AIX. Also, @eid_207da0e7, @eid_b48f959b, @eid_8efef28a, @eid_f98d7490, @eid_cac9a0ac, @eid_46e00bc4, @eid_99835861, @eid_a43a4389, @eid_a23a73c4, @eid_90359c89 joined via invite.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260324-1-92d83\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260324-1-92d83\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_46e00bc4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-25T06:36:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, I just wanted to kick off our discussion about the AIX product. Let's start by reviewing the documents from the last release. Here are the <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/prox_market_research_report_final|prox_market_research_report_final> and <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/latest_aix_market_research_report|latest_aix_market_research_report>.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260325-0-1281f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260325-0-1281f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b48f959b\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-25T06:41:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Julia! I'll take a look at the market research reports. Also, here are the <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/prox_product_vision_document_final|prox_product_vision_document_final> and <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/latest_aix_product_vision_document|latest_aix_product_vision_document> for everyone to review.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260325-1-8fee6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260325-1-8fee6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-25T06:42:00\", \"text\": \"Great, thanks Hannah. I'll dive into the product vision documents. @eid_207da0e7, could you check out the product requirements?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260325-2-f81c2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260325-2-f81c2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_207da0e7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-25T06:47:00\", \"text\": \"Sure thing, Ian. Here are the <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/prox_product_requirements_document_final|prox_product_requirements_document_final> and <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/latest_aix_product_requirements_document|latest_aix_product_requirements_document>.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260325-3-13004\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260325-3-13004\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a43a4389\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-25T06:49:00\", \"text\": \"I'll review the technical specs. Sharing them here: <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/prox_technical_specifications_document_final|prox_technical_specifications_document_final> and <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/latest_aix_technical_specifications_document|latest_aix_technical_specifications_document>.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260325-4-53bf3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260325-4-53bf3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_cac9a0ac\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-25T06:50:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Fiona. I'll go through the system design documents. Here they are: <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/prox_system_design_document_final|prox_system_design_document_final> and <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/latest_aix_system_design_document|latest_aix_system_design_document>.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260325-5-9b93b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260325-5-9b93b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8efef28a\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-25T06:53:00\", \"text\": \"Looks like we have everything we need to get started. Let's make sure to note any feedback or issues reported by customers and QA specialists. I'll be looking into those.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260325-6-e3a82\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260325-6-e3a82\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_90359c89\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-25T06:55:00\", \"text\": \"Sounds good, Bob. Let's keep each other updated on any findings or concerns. Thanks, everyone!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260325-7-6c7de\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260325-7-6c7de\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4f30e22e\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-07T12:31:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, one of the common issues reported for AIX is slow performance during peak usage times. This was reported by Customer ID: CUST-0040.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260415-0-4cb69\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260415-0-4cb69\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f98d7490\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-07T12:32:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for bringing this up, Ian Brown. Since the product was developed by a different team, we should start by checking if there's insufficient server capacity.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260415-1-9e15a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260415-1-9e15a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-07T12:33:00\", \"text\": \"Good point, @eid_f98d7490. We should also look into whether there's inefficient resource allocation. That could be a big factor.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260415-2-9b61f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260415-2-9b61f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2d72674d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-07T12:38:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, Ian Jones. Another angle could be the lack of performance monitoring and scaling strategies. We need to ensure we're scaling properly during peak times.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260415-3-d0789\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260415-3-d0789\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4f30e22e\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-07T12:39:00\", \"text\": \"Right, Fiona. We should also consider if there are inefficient code or database queries causing bottlenecks. That might be slowing things down.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260415-4-4704b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260415-4-4704b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f98d7490\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-07T12:40:00\", \"text\": \"Let's make sure we document these potential causes in our planning documents for the next release of AIX. We need to address these issues systematically.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260415-5-5607e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260415-5-5607e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_890654c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-09T22:15:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, let's review the Market Research Report and update it based on the latest issues reported. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260408-0-a77f2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260408-0-a77f2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f98d7490\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-09T22:18:00\", \"text\": \"@Julia Smith, I think we should address the AI model misclassification issue in the 'Key Features' section. We need to mention the importance of using diverse and regularly updated datasets to improve model accuracy.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260408-1-37db3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260408-1-37db3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_890654c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-09T22:19:00\", \"text\": \"Great point, Ian Garcia! We should definitely emphasize the need for diverse datasets and regular updates. I'll add a note about retraining the model to adapt to new data patterns. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260408-2-d29d1\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260408-2-d29d1\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-09T22:22:00\", \"text\": \"For the 'System Architecture' section, we should highlight the need for a more modular design to support multiple CRM systems. This will address the integration limitations we've seen.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260408-3-e28f4\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260408-3-e28f4\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4f30e22e\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-09T22:26:00\", \"text\": \"I agree with Ian Jones. Also, in the 'Future Enhancements' section, let's include plans for expanding CRM integrations and improving the modular architecture. This will help with workflow consistency.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260408-4-879ef\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260408-4-879ef\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"'eid_46e00bc4'\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-09T22:27:23\", \"text\": \"@here Stay updated with this article on the latest trends in AI-driven lead qualification. It highlights key industry shifts and innovations. https://www.forbes.com/sites/forbestechcouncil/2023/01/15/the-future-of-ai-in-lead-qualification/\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260409-82-8959b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260409-82-8959b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2d72674d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-09T22:29:00\", \"text\": \"Regarding the user interface issues, we should add a section on 'User Experience Improvements' to discuss plans for integrating user feedback and enhancing onboarding resources. This will help new users navigate the system more effectively.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260408-5-5a47a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260408-5-5a47a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_890654c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-09T22:32:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Fiona! Adding a 'User Experience Improvements' section sounds like a solid plan. I'll make sure to include that. 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260408-6-65e1c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260408-6-65e1c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4f30e22e\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-09T22:36:39\", \"text\": \"@here Discover how machine learning models are trained for lead scoring in this comprehensive blog post. A must-read for understanding AIX's core technology. https://machinelearningmastery.com/machine-learning-for-lead-scoring/\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260409-84-e08f8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260409-84-e08f8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f98d7490\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-09T22:37:00\", \"text\": \"One more thing, we should address the performance issues in the 'Scalability and Industry Suitability' section. Mentioning strategies for performance monitoring and scaling could be beneficial.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260408-7-241bd\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260408-7-241bd\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_890654c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-09T22:41:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, Ian Garcia. I'll add details about performance monitoring and scaling strategies to ensure we tackle those slow performance issues. 💪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260408-8-f39ee\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260408-8-f39ee\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4f30e22e\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-09T22:42:00\", \"text\": \"Lastly, let's not forget to mention the reliability improvements in the 'Security and Compliance' section. We need to ensure robust system monitoring and alerting mechanisms are in place.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260408-9-c932a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260408-9-c932a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_890654c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-09T22:47:00\", \"text\": \"Great suggestion, Ian Brown. I'll include a note on enhancing system monitoring and alerting mechanisms. Thanks, everyone, for your input! I'll compile these changes and share the updated draft soon. 📄\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260408-10-70b6b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260408-10-70b6b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_890654c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-12T12:34:00\", \"text\": \"Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_aix_market_research_report|Market Research Report>, thank you everyone!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260412-0-c2dfc\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260412-0-c2dfc\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-12T15:38:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_f6ae6dd8 joined planning-AIX.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260412-88-a56cd\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260412-88-a56cd\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8efef28a\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-13T22:17:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, let's review the Product Vision Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We need to address the AI misclassification, UI challenges, CRM integration limitations, performance issues, and reliability concerns. Let's dive in! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260412-0-ba65c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260412-0-ba65c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-13T22:20:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_8efef28a, for the AI misclassification issue, I suggest we add a section on 'Data Quality and Model Training' under System Architecture. We should emphasize the need for diverse and regularly updated datasets to improve model accuracy. Thoughts, @Ian Brown?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260412-1-4a73a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260412-1-4a73a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4f30e22e\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-13T22:25:00\", \"text\": \"Great point, Ian! 👍 We should also include a 'User Feedback Loop' in the Future Enhancements section to ensure continuous improvement based on real-world usage. This could help with both AI accuracy and UI intuitiveness.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260412-2-03476\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260412-2-03476\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f6ae6dd8\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-13T22:29:00\", \"text\": \"I agree with @Ian Brown. Adding a feedback loop is crucial. Additionally, we should expand the 'Future Enhancements' to include 'Enhanced CRM Integration' with a focus on modular architecture to support more systems. This will address the integration limitations.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260412-3-29308\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260412-3-29308\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f98d7490\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-13T22:34:00\", \"text\": \"Regarding performance issues, we might need to update the 'Scalability and Industry Suitability' section to include 'Performance Monitoring and Optimization Strategies'. This could involve regular load testing and resource allocation adjustments.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260412-4-418ba\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260412-4-418ba\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8efef28a\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-13T22:38:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the input, everyone! To summarize: \\n1. Add 'Data Quality and Model Training' under System Architecture.\\n2. Introduce a 'User Feedback Loop' in Future Enhancements.\\n3. Expand 'Enhanced CRM Integration' with modular architecture.\\n4. Include 'Performance Monitoring and Optimization Strategies'.\\n\\nLet's make these changes and reconvene to finalize. Any objections or additional thoughts? 🤔\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260412-5-63e58\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260412-5-63e58\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-13T22:43:00\", \"text\": \"No objections here! Let's proceed with these updates. 💪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260412-6-8853a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260412-6-8853a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4f30e22e\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-13T22:44:00\", \"text\": \"All good from my side too. Looking forward to seeing the revised document! 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260412-7-870ad\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260412-7-870ad\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f6ae6dd8\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-13T22:49:00\", \"text\": \"Sounds like a solid plan, @Bob Garcia. Let's get these changes implemented and ensure AIX is on the right track. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260412-8-7df04\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260412-8-7df04\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b48f959b\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-16T11:19:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, let's review the Technical Specifications Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We've got several areas to address, including AI model performance, UI design, CRM integration, system performance, and reliability. Let's dive in! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260416-0-02ef2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260416-0-02ef2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f98d7490\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-16T11:23:00\", \"text\": \"Hey @eid_b48f959b, for the AI model misclassification issue, we should consider adding a section on regular model retraining and dataset updates. This could help mitigate the risk of using outdated or biased data. Thoughts? 🤔\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260416-1-c75cb\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260416-1-c75cb\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b814ccfb\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-16T11:27:00\", \"text\": \"I agree with Ian. Also, we should specify the need for diverse datasets to reduce bias. Maybe include a subsection under 'Future Enhancements' about expanding our data sources? 📈\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260416-2-358fc\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260416-2-358fc\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f98d7490\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-16T11:31:03\", \"text\": \"@here Check out this insightful blog on how AI is transforming lead scoring and qualification processes. It dives deep into the algorithms that power systems like AIX. https://towardsdatascience.com/ai-in-lead-scoring-1234567890ab\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260416-114-ac7e2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260416-114-ac7e2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_90359c89\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-16T11:31:06\", \"text\": \"@here Dive into TensorFlow, a key library for developing AI models like those used in AIX. It's essential for building scalable lead qualification systems. https://www.tensorflow.org/\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260416-111-ddea9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260416-111-ddea9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8efef28a\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-16T11:32:00\", \"text\": \"Good points, @eid_f98d7490 and @eid_b814ccfb. On the UI front, we need to emphasize user feedback integration. How about adding a user feedback loop in the 'Future Enhancements' section to ensure continuous improvement? 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260416-3-88751\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260416-3-88751\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_46e00bc4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-16T11:36:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, Julia here. We should also highlight the need for better onboarding resources in the 'Key Features' section. A more intuitive UI and comprehensive training materials could really help new users. 📚\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260416-4-d18d3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260416-4-d18d3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-16T11:41:00\", \"text\": \"Regarding CRM integration, we should mention the need for a more modular architecture to support various CRM systems. This could be added to the 'System Architecture' section. It would address the integration limitations we're facing. 🔄\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260416-5-e885c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260416-5-e885c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_7b85a749\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-16T11:42:00\", \"text\": \"For the performance issues, let's include a section on performance monitoring and scaling strategies. This could be part of the 'Scalability and Industry Suitability' section. We need to ensure the system can handle peak loads efficiently. 📊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260416-6-fd4e3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260416-6-fd4e3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_55f01e31\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-16T11:47:00\", \"text\": \"And for reliability, we should add a subsection on system monitoring and alerting mechanisms in the 'Security and Compliance' section. This will help us catch issues before they impact users. 🔍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260416-7-1ca18\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260416-7-1ca18\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b48f959b\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-16T11:50:00\", \"text\": \"Great suggestions, everyone! Here's a summary of the changes: \\n1. Add regular model retraining and diverse datasets to 'Future Enhancements'. \\n2. Include user feedback loops and onboarding resources in 'Key Features'. \\n3. Mention modular architecture for CRM integration in 'System Architecture'. \\n4. Add performance monitoring strategies in 'Scalability and Industry Suitability'. \\n5. Include system monitoring and alerting in 'Security and Compliance'. \\nI'll update the document accordingly and share the revised version for final review. Thanks for the collaboration! 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260416-8-69270\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260416-8-69270\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-20T08:39:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, let's review the System Design Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We've got some challenges with AI misclassification, UI intuitiveness, CRM integration, performance during peak times, and system reliability. Let's dive in! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260420-0-e8053\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260420-0-e8053\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b48f959b\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-20T08:41:00\", \"text\": \"Hey Ian, I think we should start by addressing the AI model issues. The document should include a section on regular model retraining and dataset updates to prevent misclassification. This could help with both overfitting and underfitting problems. Thoughts? 🤔\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260420-1-e91ad\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260420-1-e91ad\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a43a4389\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-20T08:42:13\", \"text\": \"@here Read about the impact of AI on sales and marketing in this article. It provides context on how systems like AIX are reshaping industries. https://www.techcrunch.com/2023/02/10/ai-impact-on-sales-and-marketing/\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260420-120-6c448\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260420-120-6c448\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-20T08:46:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_b48f959b Great point, Hannah! Adding a retraining schedule and dataset review process could really help. We should also specify the need for diverse datasets to reduce bias. Anyone else have thoughts on this?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260420-2-4e6f4\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260420-2-4e6f4\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b814ccfb\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-20T08:47:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, Ian. Also, we should enhance the 'Future Enhancements' section to explicitly mention expanding our dataset sources and implementing bias detection mechanisms. This will align with our commitment to improving AI accuracy.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260420-3-8cdcb\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260420-3-8cdcb\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_46e00bc4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-20T08:50:00\", \"text\": \"For the UI issues, we need to integrate user feedback loops into the design process. The document should outline a plan for regular UX testing and feedback sessions. This will help us create a more intuitive interface. What do you think, @eid_99835861?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260420-4-fd308\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260420-4-fd308\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-20T08:51:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, Julia. Let's add a section on UX improvements and user feedback integration. We should also consider adding a user onboarding guide to help new users navigate the system more effectively. @eid_88e74382, any thoughts from a QA perspective?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260420-5-90a60\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260420-5-90a60\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_88e74382\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-20T08:56:00\", \"text\": \"From QA's side, ensuring that user feedback is actionable and integrated into our testing processes will be key. We should document a feedback-to-implementation workflow in the design document. This will help us track and prioritize user suggestions.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260420-6-6ae66\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260420-6-6ae66\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8efef28a\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-20T08:58:00\", \"text\": \"Regarding CRM integration, we need to emphasize the importance of a modular architecture in the document. This will allow us to support multiple CRM systems more easily. We should also allocate more resources for maintaining these integrations.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260420-7-91dfd\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260420-7-91dfd\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-20T09:02:00\", \"text\": \"Great suggestions, Bob. Let's update the 'System Architecture' section to highlight modularity and resource allocation for CRM integrations. @eid_7b85a749, any input on performance and reliability issues?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260420-8-5a78a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260420-8-5a78a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_7b85a749\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-20T09:07:00\", \"text\": \"For performance, we should include a section on performance monitoring and scaling strategies. This will help us manage server capacity and resource allocation better. Also, adding a robust alerting system for reliability issues could prevent unexpected downtimes.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260420-9-926db\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260420-9-926db\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-20T09:08:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Charlie. Let's incorporate those suggestions into the 'Scalability and Industry Suitability' section. To summarize, we'll add sections on AI retraining, UX feedback, modular architecture for CRM, and performance monitoring. Next steps: I'll draft these changes and share them for review. Thanks, everyone! 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260420-10-e6fb8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260420-10-e6fb8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-21T11:41:00\", \"text\": \"Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_aix_system_design_document|System Design Document>, thank you everyone!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260421-0-f1d17\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260421-0-f1d17\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8efef28a\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-14T07:48:00\", \"text\": \"Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_aix_product_vision_document|Product Vision Document>, thank you everyone!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260414-0-f4e78\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260414-0-f4e78\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8efef28a\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-14T15:52:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, let's review the Product Requirements Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We've got some areas to address, especially around AI misclassification, UI intuitiveness, CRM integration, performance, and reliability. Let's dive in! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260414-0-620b1\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260414-0-620b1\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f98d7490\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-14T15:53:00\", \"text\": \"Hey @eid_8efef28a, for the AI misclassification issue, I think we should add a section on enhancing our training data strategy. We need more diverse datasets and regular retraining schedules to keep the model sharp. Thoughts? 🤔\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260414-1-c0b29\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260414-1-c0b29\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4f30e22e\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-14T15:58:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, Ian. Also, we should incorporate user feedback loops in the 'Future Enhancements' section to improve the UI. This will help address the steep learning curve new users face. Maybe a dedicated UX research phase? @eid_8efef28a\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260414-2-1bff4\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260414-2-1bff4\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-14T16:00:00\", \"text\": \"For the CRM integration issue, we should consider expanding the 'System Architecture' section to include a more modular approach. This will help us support a wider range of CRM systems more easily. @eid_8efef28a\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260414-3-372a2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260414-3-372a2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_88e74382\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-14T16:05:00\", \"text\": \"On the performance front, we need to add a section on performance monitoring and scaling strategies. This will help us manage peak usage times better. Maybe we can include some automated scaling solutions? 🤖\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260414-4-14d52\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260414-4-14d52\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_55f01e31\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-14T16:10:00\", \"text\": \"For reliability, let's ensure we have robust monitoring and alerting mechanisms in place. We should add this to the 'Security and Compliance' section to emphasize its importance. @eid_8efef28a\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260414-5-86af8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260414-5-86af8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8efef28a\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-14T16:14:00\", \"text\": \"Great suggestions, everyone! Here's a quick summary: \\n- Enhance training data strategy and regular retraining for AI.\\n- Incorporate user feedback and UX research for UI improvements.\\n- Expand modular architecture for CRM integrations.\\n- Add performance monitoring and scaling strategies.\\n- Strengthen monitoring and alerting for reliability.\\n\\nLet's update the document with these changes and schedule a follow-up meeting to finalize. Thanks, team! 🎉\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260414-6-09435\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260414-6-09435\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-g-aix-f0202d\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8efef28a\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-14T22:26:00\", \"text\": \"Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_aix_product_requirements_document|Product Requirements Document>, thank you everyone!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260414-0-222a7\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260414-0-222a7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-ianjones-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-585771\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c39dc658\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-16T06:46:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug about incorrect data types in lead attributes has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/55.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261115-0-814e7\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261115-0-814e7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-ianjones-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-585771\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_3f4b2681\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-16T06:48:00\", \"text\": \"Great news, Ian! Can you explain what caused the issue?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261115-1-292d2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261115-1-292d2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-ianjones-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-585771\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c39dc658\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-16T06:51:00\", \"text\": \"Sure, @eid_3f4b2681. The root cause was a schema mismatch between the application layer and the database. Some fields were being cast to incorrect types during data insertion, which led to errors in our lead scoring algorithms.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261115-2-c6531\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261115-2-c6531\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-ianjones-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-585771\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_652e8cd0\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-16T06:53:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the explanation, Ian. How did you manage to fix it?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261115-3-3c371\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261115-3-3c371\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-ianjones-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-585771\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c39dc658\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-16T06:56:00\", \"text\": \"To resolve the issue, I updated the data insertion logic to ensure that the fields are cast to the correct types. Additionally, I modified the database schema to enforce stricter type constraints, preventing similar issues in the future.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261115-4-2a505\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261115-4-2a505\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-ianjones-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-585771\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-16T06:59:00\", \"text\": \"Nice work, @eid_c39dc658! This should help improve the accuracy of our lead prioritization.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261115-5-ad831\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261115-5-ad831\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-ianjones-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-585771\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_3f4b2681\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-16T07:03:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the quick turnaround, Ian. Let’s keep an eye on the lead scoring results to ensure everything is working as expected.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261115-6-8f847\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261115-6-8f847\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-ianjones-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-585771\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c39dc658\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-16T07:05:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, Hannah. I'll monitor the results closely and report any anomalies. Thanks, everyone!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261115-7-59f1f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261115-7-59f1f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-ianjones-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-585771\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_652e8cd0\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-17T15:57:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug about incorrect data import process has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/56.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261117-0-319f5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261117-0-319f5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-ianjones-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-585771\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_652e8cd0\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-17T15:58:00\", \"text\": \"The root cause was a mapping error in our data import script. It was assigning external data fields to the wrong database columns, which led to erroneous data entries and flawed lead qualification.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261117-1-40c40\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261117-1-40c40\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-ianjones-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-585771\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_652e8cd0\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-17T16:02:00\", \"text\": \"To fix this, I updated the mapping logic in the script to correctly align the external data fields with the appropriate database columns. I also added some unit tests to ensure this doesn't happen again.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261117-2-c1176\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261117-2-c1176\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-ianjones-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-585771\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c39dc658\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-17T16:07:00\", \"text\": \"Great work, @eid_652e8cd0! Thanks for jumping on this so quickly.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261117-3-8500a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261117-3-8500a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-ianjones-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-585771\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_3f4b2681\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-17T16:08:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Bob! This should really help improve the accuracy of our lead data. I'll run some tests on my end to double-check everything.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261117-4-43cee\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261117-4-43cee\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-ianjones-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-585771\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_99835861\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-17T16:09:00\", \"text\": \"Nice job, Bob. Let me know if there's anything else you need from the QA side.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261117-5-a8ab3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261117-5-a8ab3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-ianjones-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-585771\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_652e8cd0\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-17T16:12:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Ian and Hannah. @eid_99835861, I'll keep you posted if anything comes up during further testing.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261117-6-b741f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261117-6-b741f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iangarcia-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-bd5140\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f98d7490\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-08T19:59:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with LeadForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261008-0-58285\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261008-0-58285\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iangarcia-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-bd5140\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f98d7490\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-08T20:04:00\", \"text\": \"First up, we have an issue titled 'Bias in Training Data Skews Lead Scores'. The AI model is trained on a dataset with inherent biases, leading to skewed lead scores. This affects the AI Scoring Algorithm and impacts Customer CUST-0006. @eid_207da0e7, this one's for you.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261008-1-64c2b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261008-1-64c2b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iangarcia-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-bd5140\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_207da0e7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-08T20:09:00\", \"text\": \"Got it, I'll dive into the training data and see how we can mitigate these biases. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261008-2-721dd\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261008-2-721dd\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iangarcia-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-bd5140\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f98d7490\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-08T20:12:00\", \"text\": \"Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Incorrect Lead Scoring Due to Data Mismatch'. The AI model assigns incorrect scores when there's a mismatch between the historical data schema and the current input data format. This also affects the AI Scoring Algorithm and impacts Customer CUST-0037. @eid_a43a4389, can you take this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261008-3-4a17d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261008-3-4a17d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iangarcia-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-bd5140\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a43a4389\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-08T20:14:00\", \"text\": \"Sure thing! I'll check the data schemas and ensure they align correctly. Let's get those scores back on track! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261008-4-8fa38\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261008-4-8fa38\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iangarcia-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-bd5140\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f98d7490\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-08T20:17:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome, thanks! Lastly, we have 'UI Freezes During Bulk Lead Import'. The UI becomes unresponsive during large imports, affecting the User Interface and impacting Customer CUST-0040. @eid_90359c89, can you handle this?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261008-5-83551\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261008-5-83551\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iangarcia-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-bd5140\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_90359c89\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-08T20:19:00\", \"text\": \"On it! I'll look into optimizing the import process to keep the UI responsive. Thanks for assigning this to me! 💪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261008-6-c1d0c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261008-6-c1d0c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iangarcia-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-bd5140\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f98d7490\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-08T20:23:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone! Let's keep our customers happy and resolve these issues ASAP. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or additional info. 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261008-7-9b71c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261008-7-9b71c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iangarcia-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-bd5140\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_207da0e7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-08T20:28:00\", \"text\": \"Will do! Let's get to work. 💼\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261008-8-e977c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261008-8-e977c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iangarcia-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-bd5140\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a43a4389\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-08T20:29:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, team! Let's make it happen. 💪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261008-9-25d1e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261008-9-25d1e\"}\n{\"Channel\":