ser\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b34186ad\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-30T21:45:00\", \"text\": \"What exactly changed in the product direction? Are we no longer focusing on context-aware AI search?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261030-3-ede04\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261030-3-ede04\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-davidwilliams-SearchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-shaix-a65760\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_12c203a5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-30T21:47:00\", \"text\": \"From what I understand, the focus has shifted towards real-time data processing rather than maintaining session context. This might make the session data structure redundant.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261030-4-eb06a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261030-4-eb06a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-davidwilliams-SearchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-shaix-a65760\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f944b0ee\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-30T21:52:00\", \"text\": \"If that's the case, it seems like merging this PR might not be beneficial. @eid_13786f09, do you agree?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261030-5-70cb8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261030-5-70cb8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-davidwilliams-SearchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-shaix-a65760\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_13786f09\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-30T21:55:00\", \"text\": \"I agree. If the focus has shifted, this PR might not be needed. Should I hold off on merging it?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261030-6-51a58\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261030-6-51a58\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-davidwilliams-SearchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-shaix-a65760\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4f731d34\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-30T21:58:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, I think it's best not to merge it given the new direction. We should focus on aligning with the current priorities.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261030-7-4895f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261030-7-4895f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-davidwilliams-SearchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-shaix-a65760\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5a940dab\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-30T22:03:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed. @eid_13786f09, could you please ensure the PR is not merged and revert any related changes if necessary?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261030-8-a2787\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261030-8-a2787\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-davidwilliams-SearchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-shaix-a65760\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_13786f09\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-30T22:04:00\", \"text\": \"Understood. I'll make sure not to merge it and will take the necessary steps soon. Thanks for the clarification, everyone.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261030-9-b0678\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261030-9-b0678\"}\n\nIntelligent Search Algorithms: At the core of Salesforce AI Search are intelligent search algorithms that leverage machine learning to understand user intent. These algorithms refine user queries to deliver precise and relevant results, improving search accuracy and user satisfaction. The system supports natural language processing, enabling users to perform searches in a conversational manner, further enhancing usability. Improvements in natural language understanding (NLU) capabilities have been made to better interpret user queries, and efforts are ongoing to incorporate more diverse training data to enhance algorithm performance. A new subsection on 'Context Awareness' addresses limitations in understanding the context of user queries, allowing for more accurate and relevant search results.\nData Privacy and Security: Data privacy and security are paramount in Salesforce AI Search. The system complies with GDPR and CCPA standards, ensuring that user data is handled with the utmost care. Advanced encryption techniques are employed to protect data in transit and at rest, and strict access controls are implemented to prevent unauthorized access. Regular security audits and updates are conducted to maintain a secure environment.\nScalability: Scalability is a key feature of Salesforce AI Search, supported by Kubernetes' dynamic scaling capabilities. The system can automatically adjust resources to meet increasing demands, ensuring consistent performance even during peak usage. This scalability is crucial for accommodating the growth of data and user base, maintaining high availability and reliability. Robust load balancing strategies are implemented to distribute traffic evenly across servers, and optimized query processing algorithms are used to enhance performance under heavy loads.\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-shAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-shaix-1539d5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5b61c55e\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-14T17:29:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, QA team found some issues in the last release of shAIX. The report came from QA Specialist eid_c7622c8e. Let's discuss.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260906-0-f4f60\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260906-0-f4f60\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-shAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-shaix-1539d5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5a940dab\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-14T17:31:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, Charlie. What exactly did they find?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260906-1-0a52b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260906-1-0a52b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-shAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-shaix-1539d5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5b61c55e\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-14T17:32:00\", \"text\": \"The AI is misinterpreting complex queries, leading to less relevant search results.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260906-2-b4a8c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260906-2-b4a8c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-shAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-shaix-1539d5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_aa99608e\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-14T17:35:00\", \"text\": \"Could it be due to insufficient NLU capabilities? Maybe the AI isn't processing the language nuances well.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260906-3-59a21\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260906-3-59a21\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-shAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-shaix-1539d5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6d14c4ec\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-14T17:40:00\", \"text\": \"That's possible, Julia. We might need to enhance the NLU module.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260906-4-f093e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260906-4-f093e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-shAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-shaix-1539d5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d0b6cb92\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-14T17:44:00\", \"text\": \"Or it could be a design issue. Maybe the training data doesn't cover enough complex query patterns.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260906-5-3111f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260906-5-3111f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-shAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-shaix-1539d5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b34186ad\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-14T17:46:00\", \"text\": \"Good point, Julia. We should review the training datasets to ensure they include diverse query types.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260906-6-6333f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260906-6-6333f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-shAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-shaix-1539d5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5a940dab\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-14T17:47:00\", \"text\": \"What about context awareness? Could limitations there be affecting the results?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260906-7-beadc\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260906-7-beadc\"}\n