: \"Good point, George. We might need to improve our error handling and monitoring.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260421-6-9c6ac\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260421-6-9c6ac\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2589c967\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-08T23:01:00\", \"text\": \"What about the third-party libraries we're using? They might not be optimized for real-time data processing.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260421-7-485ea\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260421-7-485ea\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_802e8eff\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-08T23:02:00\", \"text\": \"True, Charlie. We should review those dependencies and see if there are better alternatives.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260421-8-49597\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260421-8-49597\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ec3b5d65\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-08T23:06:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed. Let's make sure these issues are documented for the next release planning.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260421-9-a06e7\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260421-9-a06e7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d96fb219\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-08T23:09:00\", \"text\": \"I'll add these points to the planning documents for the next release of imentAIX.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260421-10-07f1e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260421-10-07f1e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_13fdff84\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-11T08:44:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, let's review the Market Research Report and update it based on the latest issues reported. 😊 I've noted some key issues like sarcasm misinterpretation, Slack integration inconsistencies, and UI challenges. Let's dive in and suggest some changes!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260411-0-68caa\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260411-0-68caa\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d96fb219\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-11T08:48:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_13fdff84, for the sarcasm issue, we should consider adding a section on enhancing the NLP engine with more diverse training data. We could also explore integrating a contextual analysis layer to better handle sarcasm and humor. Thoughts? 🤔\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260411-1-aafe4\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260411-1-aafe4\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2589c967\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-11T08:50:00\", \"text\": \"I agree with Emma. We should also mention the need for user feedback loops to continuously improve sarcasm detection. This could be added under the NLP Engine section. @eid_13fdff84, what do you think?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260411-2-25e71\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260411-2-25e71\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_13fdff84\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-11T08:53:00\", \"text\": \"Great points, Emma and Ian! Let's add a paragraph under the NLP Engine section about expanding training datasets and incorporating user feedback for sarcasm detection. 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260411-3-64a7c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260411-3-64a7c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_802e8eff\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-11T08:58:00\", \"text\": \"Regarding Slack integration, we should highlight the need for better error monitoring and handling. Maybe add a subsection under Slack Integration about optimizing API usage and improving connectivity checks. @eid_ec3b5d65, any thoughts on this?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260411-4-5c919\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260411-4-5c919\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ec3b5d65\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-11T08:59:00\", \"text\": \"Good call, Charlie. We should also mention exploring alternative libraries that are optimized for real-time processing. This could help with the integration consistency. Let's make sure this is clear in the report.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260411-5-29bfb\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260411-5-29bfb\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_13fdff84\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-11T09:04:00\", \"text\": \"Noted, George and Charlie. I'll add a subsection on API optimization and alternative libraries under Slack Integration. This should address the integration issues. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260411-6-83a4d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260411-6-83a4d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2589c967\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-11T09:05:00\", \"text\": \"For the UI challenges, we should emphasize user-centered design principles. Maybe add a section on redesigning the UI with a focus on simplicity and intuitive navigation. @eid_d96fb219, what do you think?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260411-7-ef737\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260411-7-ef737\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d96fb219\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-11T09:06:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, Ian. We could also include a plan for user training and onboarding resources to help new users. This should be part of the User Interface Dashboard section.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260411-8-d368c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260411-8-d368c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_13fdff84\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-11T09:08:00\", \"text\": \"Great suggestions, team! I'll update the User Interface Dashboard section to include user-centered design principles and onboarding resources. Let's also ensure we have a feedback loop for continuous improvement. 📈\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260411-9-082f2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260411-9-082f2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ec3b5d65\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-11T09:12:00\", \"text\": \"Lastly, for performance issues with large teams, we should discuss optimizing algorithms and resource allocation. Maybe add a section on performance testing and scalability improvements. @eid_802e8eff, any input?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260411-10-f84f3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260411-10-f84f3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_802e8eff\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-11T09:16:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, George. We should definitely include a plan for regular performance testing and optimization strategies. This will help us ensure the system scales effectively with larger teams.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260411-11-0c9a8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260411-11-0c9a8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ec3b5d65\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-11T09:19:02\", \"text\": \"@here Check out this insightful blog post on the latest advancements in sentiment analysis and its applications in workplace communication. Perfect for understanding the tech behind imentAIX! https://towardsdatascience.com/sentiment-analysis-in-the-workplace-123456789abc\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260411-101-518ce\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260411-101-518ce\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_13fdff84\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-11T09:21:00\", \"text\": \"Perfect! I'll add a section on performance testing and optimization under Scalability and Customization. Thanks for all the input, team! I'll make these changes and circulate the updated report for final review. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260411-12-0b99e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260411-12-0b99e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_802e8eff\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-25T21:06:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, let's review the System Design Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We need to address the sarcasm detection, Slack integration, UI intuitiveness, performance with large teams, and customization options. Let's dive in! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260425-0-092d1\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260425-0-092d1\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5890ce38\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-25T21:08:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_802e8eff Charlie, for the sarcasm detection issue, I suggest we enhance the NLP Engine section to include a subsection on 'Contextual Analysis'. We could explore incorporating sentiment analysis models that are specifically trained on datasets rich in sarcasm and humor. Thoughts?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260425-1-17d75\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260425-1-17d75\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2470307f\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-25T21:12:00\", \"text\": \"I agree with George. Also, we should mention the need for expanding our training datasets to include more diverse examples of sarcasm and humor. This could be added under the 'NLP Engine' section as well. 📈\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260425-2-add6e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260425-2-add6e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_47d43bc4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-25T21:16:00\", \"text\": \"For the Slack integration issue, we might need to add a section on 'Error Handling and Monitoring'. We should specify strategies for dealing with API rate limits and connectivity issues. This could help in reducing delays in real-time updates. 🤔\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260425-3-f12d5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260425-3-f12d5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_96000199\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-25T21:17:00\", \"text\": \"Good point, Charlie. We should also consider adding a subsection on 'Optimizing Third-Party Libraries' under the 'Slack Integration' section. This could help in addressing the dependency issues that might be affecting real-time processing.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260425-4-52c17\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260425-4-52c17\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fd8cecea\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-25T21:21:00\", \"text\": \"Regarding the UI, I think we need to emphasize 'User-Centered Design Principles' in the 'User Interface Dashboard' section. We should also consider adding a 'User Feedback Loop' mechanism to continuously improve the interface based on user input. 💡\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260425-5-73676\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260425-5-73676\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5346d7a5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-25T21:25:00\", \"text\": \"For performance issues with large teams, we should enhance the 'Scalability and Customization' section. Let's include a plan for 'Performance Testing and Optimization' to ensure the system can handle increased loads efficiently. 📊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260425-6-e4c01\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260425-6-e4c01\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f48dbe55\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-25T21:28:00\", \"text\": \"On customization, we should expand the 'Customization' part to include 'Modular Architecture'. This would allow users to tailor reports and insights to their specific needs more effectively. 🔧\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260425-7-f6d88\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260425-7-f6d88\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_802e8eff\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-25T21:32:00\", \"text\": \"Great suggestions, everyone! Here's a summary of the key changes: 1) Enhance NLP Engine with contextual analysis and expanded datasets, 2) Add error handling and optimization strategies for Slack integration, 3) Emphasize user-centered design and feedback loops for UI, 4) Include performance testing in scalability, 5) Expand customization with modular architecture. Next steps: I'll draft these changes and circulate for final review. Thanks for the input! 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260425-8-13650\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260425-8-13650\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_802e8eff\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-26T10:42:00\", \"text\": \"Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_imentaix_system_design_document|System Design Document>, thank you everyone!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260425-0-6f9cf\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260425-0-6f9cf\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fd8cecea\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-20T11:36:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, let's review the Product Requirements Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. 🚀 Here are the main issues: sarcasm detection, Slack integration inconsistencies, UI intuitiveness, performance with large teams, and limited customization options. Let's dive in! 💬\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260420-0-bfd45\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260420-0-bfd45\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d96fb219\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-20T11:37:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_fd8cecea For the sarcasm detection issue, I think we should enhance the NLP Engine section to include a focus on improving sarcasm and humor detection. We could mention exploring more advanced transformer models or incorporating additional training data specifically for sarcasm and humor. 🤔\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260420-1-434a9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260420-1-434a9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2589c967\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-20T11:38:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, Emma. We should also consider adding a section on contextual analysis in the NLP Engine part. This could help differentiate between literal and sarcastic statements by analyzing the context of conversations. 📚\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260420-2-110b0\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260420-2-110b0\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_802e8eff\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-20T11:41:00\", \"text\": \"On the Slack integration front, we should update the Slack Integration section to include strategies for handling API rate limits and connectivity issues. Maybe add a subsection on error monitoring and recovery mechanisms to ensure real-time updates are consistent. 🔄\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260420-3-30fa9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260420-3-30fa9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_47d43bc4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-20T11:44:00\", \"text\": \"For the UI issues, we need to emphasize user-centered design principles in the User Interface Dashboard section. Perhaps we can add a note about conducting regular UX testing and gathering user feedback to continuously improve the interface. 🖥️\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260420-4-7818c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260420-4-7818c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_96000199\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-20T11:47:07\", \"text\": \"@here Explore the TextBlob library, a simple yet powerful tool for processing textual data. It's a great resource for building sentiment analysis features like those in imentAIX. https://textblob.readthedocs.io/en/dev/\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260420-124-3cfe8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260420-124-3cfe8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5346d7a5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-20T11:48:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, and let's also include a plan for onboarding resources or tutorials in the Customer Support section to help new users get up to speed quickly. 📖\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260420-5-b416a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260420-5-b416a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f48dbe55\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-20T11:53:00\", \"text\": \"Regarding performance with large teams, we should enhance the Scalability and Customization section to include performance testing and optimization strategies. This could involve stress testing and resource allocation improvements. 📈\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260420-6-6927c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260420-6-6927c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2470307f\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-20T11:58:00\", \"text\": \"And for customization, let's expand on the configuration dashboard capabilities in the Customization section. We should highlight the potential for modular architecture to support more flexible reporting templates. 🛠️\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260420-7-9f504\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260420-7-9f504\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fd8cecea\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-20T12:00:00\", \"text\": \"Great suggestions, everyone! 🎉 To summarize, we'll update the NLP Engine for sarcasm detection, enhance Slack integration strategies, improve UI design and onboarding, optimize performance for large teams, and expand customization options. I'll draft these changes and share them for final review. Next steps: let's aim to finalize the document by the end of the week. Thanks, team! 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260420-8-5e011\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260420-8-5e011\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fd8cecea\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-20T19:39:00\", \"text\": \"Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_imentaix_product_requirements_document|Product Requirements Document>, thank you everyone!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260420-0-df31a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260420-0-df31a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5890ce38\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-23T02:56:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, let's review the Technical Specifications Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We need to address the sentiment analysis misinterpretation, Slack integration inconsistencies, UI challenges, performance issues with large teams, and limited customization options. Let's dive in! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260422-0-577e1\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260422-0-577e1\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d96fb219\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-23T02:59:00\", \"text\": \"Hey George, for the sentiment analysis misinterpretation, I think we should expand the NLP Engine section to include a focus on sarcasm and humor detection. We might need to incorporate additional datasets that include these elements. Thoughts, @eid_5890ce38?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260422-1-808a1\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260422-1-808a1\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2470307f\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-23T03:01:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, Emma. We should also mention the need for contextual analysis in the NLP Engine section. This could help differentiate between literal and sarcastic statements. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260422-2-f08a1\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260422-2-f08a1\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5890ce38\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-23T03:03:00\", \"text\": \"Great points, @eid_d96fb219 and @eid_2470307f. Let's add a subsection under NLP Engine for sarcasm and humor detection, and emphasize the need for contextual analysis. Next, about the Slack integration issues?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260422-3-7bd7a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260422-3-7bd7a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_802e8eff\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-23T03:04:00\", \"text\": \"For Slack integration, we should update the Slack Integration section to include strategies for handling API rate limits and connectivity issues. Perhaps we can suggest implementing a retry mechanism and better error monitoring. @eid_5890ce38, does that sound good?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260422-4-9c350\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260422-4-9c350\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5346d7a5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-23T03:09:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, and maybe we should also consider optimizing the third-party libraries we use for real-time data processing. This could be added to the Technical section. 🔧\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260422-5-139ea\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260422-5-139ea\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5890ce38\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-23T03:11:00\", \"text\": \"Perfect, @eid_802e8eff and @eid_5346d7a5. Let's make those updates. Now, regarding the UI, any suggestions?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260422-6-4d67c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260422-6-4d67c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fd8cecea\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-23T03:13:00\", \"text\": \"For the UI, we should revise the User Interface Dashboard section to emphasize user-centered design principles. Adding a user feedback loop could help us continuously improve the interface. What do you think, @Charlie Smith?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260422-7-d5ddf\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260422-7-d5ddf\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_47d43bc4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-23T03:15:00\", \"text\": \"I agree, Fiona. We should also simplify the layout and navigation structure. Maybe we can include a section on user training and onboarding resources to help new users. 📚\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260422-8-25ef2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260422-8-25ef2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5890ce38\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-23T03:18:00\", \"text\": \"Great suggestions, @eid_fd8cecea and @eid_47d43bc4. We'll update the UI section accordingly. Now, let's tackle the performance issues with large teams.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260422-9-266c3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260422-9-266c3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f48dbe55\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-23T03:22:00\", \"text\": \"We should enhance the Scalability and Customization section to include performance testing and optimization strategies for large-scale deployments. This could involve revisiting our algorithms and server resource allocation. 💡\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260422-10-5203a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260422-10-5203a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5890ce38\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-23T03:25:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Alice. Let's make sure to include those strategies. Lastly, on customization options?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260422-11-c60bc\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260422-11-c60bc\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_96000199\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-23T03:26:00\", \"text\": \"We should expand the Customization section to discuss a more modular architecture that supports customizable features. Also, let's establish a feedback loop from users to inform customization needs. @eid_5890ce38, does that cover it?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260422-12-a6a9f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260422-12-a6a9f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-imentAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-ntaix-141b6b\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5890ce38\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-23T03:31:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, @eid_96000199. Thanks, everyone, for your input. I'll summarize these changes and update the document. Next steps: I'll circulate the revised draft for final review before we implement these updates. 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260422-13-82e71\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260422-13-82e71\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8658e19c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-29T12:11:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug about incorrect OAuth token handling has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/47.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261129-0-8ac30\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261129-0-8ac30\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8658e19c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-29T12:12:00\", \"text\": \"To recap, the issue was that our API Integration Module wasn't refreshing expired OAuth tokens automatically. This led to unauthorized API requests and interruptions in data retrieval from Slack channels.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261129-1-40bc9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261129-1-40bc9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa6ec727\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-29T12:14:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, Ian! What was causing the token refresh mechanism to fail?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261129-2-121e7\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261129-2-121e7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8658e19c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-29T12:18:00\", \"text\": \"Good question, @eid_fa6ec727. The root cause was a missing trigger in our token management logic. The system wasn't set up to initiate a refresh when a token expired.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261129-3-561d3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261129-3-561d3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d96fb219\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-29T12:19:00\", \"text\": \"How did you manage to fix it, Ian?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261129-4-07641\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261129-4-07641\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8658e19c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-29T12:23:00\", \"text\": \"I added a check for token expiration before each API request. If a token is expired, the system now automatically triggers a refresh and retries the request with the new token. This ensures uninterrupted data retrieval.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261129-5-f54dc\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261129-5-f54dc\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa6ec727\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-29T12:28:00\", \"text\": \"That sounds like a solid fix. Thanks for handling this so quickly, Ian!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261129-6-8fc36\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261129-6-8fc36\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d96fb219\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-29T12:30:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, great work! I'll keep an eye on the logs to ensure everything runs smoothly.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261129-7-fc6d8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261129-7-fc6d8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8658e19c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-29T12:35:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, @eid_d96fb219 and Fiona. Let me know if you notice any issues. I'll be monitoring the system as well.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261129-8-5fb62\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261129-8-5fb62\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d96fb219\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-01T23:29:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with SentimentForce that we need to address ASAP. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261201-0-6fd9c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261201-0-6fd9c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d96fb219\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-01T23:30:00\", \"text\": \"First up, we have a 'Slack API Integration Failure'. The integration with Slack's API is intermittently failing, causing gaps in the sentiment data on the dashboard. This affects the Real-Time Dashboard & Backend Server, impacting customer CUST-0087. @eid_fa6ec727, this one's for you.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261201-1-dca04\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261201-1-dca04\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa6ec727\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-01T23:35:00\", \"text\": \"Got it! I'll start investigating the API integration issues right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261201-2-1486b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261201-2-1486b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d96fb219\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-01T23:38:00\", \"text\": \"Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Delayed Sentiment Updates in Real-Time Dashboard'. The dashboard is experiencing delays in updating sentiment scores, which affects the same areas as the previous issue. This impacts customer CUST-0105. @eid_8658e19c, can you take this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261201-3-36b87\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261201-3-36b87\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8658e19c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-01T23:41:00\", \"text\": \"Sure thing! I'll look into the delays and see what's causing the lag. Let's get this sorted for CUST-0105. 💪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261201-4-e115b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261201-4-e115b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d96fb219\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-01T23:46:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome, thanks! Lastly, we have a 'Language Model Bias' issue. The sentiment analysis engine is showing bias towards certain phrases, which is skewing sentiment scores. This affects the Sentiment Analysis Engine and impacts customer CUST-0005. @eid_4df5d4b7, can you handle this?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261201-5-e2aaf\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261201-5-e2aaf\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df5d4b7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-01T23:47:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, I'll dive into the sentiment analysis engine and address the bias issue. We need to ensure accurate sentiment reports for our users. 🔍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261201-6-baf95\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261201-6-baf95\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d96fb219\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-01T23:48:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone! Let's keep communication open and update each other on progress. Feel free to ask questions or share insights as you work through these. 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261201-7-bd055\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261201-7-bd055\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa6ec727\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-01T23:52:00\", \"text\": \"Will do! If anyone has insights on the API integration, let me know. 🤔\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261201-8-c31d5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261201-8-c31d5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8658e19c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-01T23:53:00\", \"text\": \"Same here, any tips on optimizing real-time updates are welcome! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261201-9-f759f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261201-9-f759f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df5d4b7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-01T23:56:00\", \"text\": \"I'll reach out if I find any patterns in the bias issue. Let's get these fixed! 💪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261201-10-d526f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261201-10-d526f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7aff5a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_31cb6db5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-29T03:11:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug about incorrect sentiment scores on the dashboard, titled 'Sentiment Model Drift', has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/42.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261028-0-a22e3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261028-0-a22e3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7aff5a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_31cb6db5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-29T03:12:00\", \"text\": \"The root cause was that our sentiment analysis model hadn't been retrained with recent data, which led to outdated or inaccurate sentiment scores being displayed.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261028-1-ae66c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261028-1-ae66c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7aff5a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_31cb6db5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-29T03:17:00\", \"text\": \"To fix this, I updated the model training pipeline to automatically incorporate new data every month. This ensures the model stays current and accurate. I've also added a monitoring system to alert us if the model's performance starts to degrade.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261028-2-a2cdb\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261028-2-a2cdb\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7aff5a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6cc1a0f6\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-29T03:18:00\", \"text\": \"Great work, Ian! Thanks for getting this sorted out so quickly. The monitoring system sounds like a solid addition.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261028-3-46138\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261028-3-46138\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7aff5a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_802e8eff\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-29T03:23:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_31cb6db5 Thanks, Ian! This should definitely improve the accuracy of our sentiment scores. Let me know if you need any help with the monitoring system.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261028-4-37214\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261028-4-37214\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7aff5a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_31cb6db5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-29T03:28:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, David and Charlie! I'll keep you posted if anything else comes up. For now, everything looks good on my end.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261028-5-7846b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261028-5-7846b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7aff5a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fc4619fa\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-30T09:07:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the time zone misalignment in data processing. After reviewing the bug, I've determined that it does not require a fix.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261030-0-05849\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261030-0-05849\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7aff5a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_802e8eff\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-30T09:08:00\", \"text\": \"Hey David, can you explain why it's not a bug? The misalignment seemed to cause some confusion on the dashboard.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261030-1-1655b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261030-1-1655b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7aff5a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fc4619fa\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-30T09:12:00\", \"text\": \"Sure, @eid_802e8eff. The backend server processes sentiment data using a default time zone setting. This is actually the expected behavior, as the system is designed to standardize data processing across different regions.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261030-2-ee25c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261030-2-ee25c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7aff5a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6cc1a0f6\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-30T09:15:00\", \"text\": \"So, the time zone setting is intentional to ensure consistency in data processing?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261030-3-8b0fa\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261030-3-8b0fa\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7aff5a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fc4619fa\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-30T09:16:00\", \"text\": \"Exactly, Charlie. The default time zone setting ensures that all sentiment data is processed uniformly, regardless of the user's local time zone. This prevents discrepancies when comparing data from different regions.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261030-4-30a75\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261030-4-30a75\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7aff5a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_802e8eff\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-30T09:19:00\", \"text\": \"Got it. So, it's more of a user misunderstanding rather than a bug. Did you take any steps to verify this?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261030-5-d1c6a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261030-5-d1c6a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7aff5a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fc4619fa\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-30T09:21:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, I reviewed the server configuration and confirmed that the time zone setting is as intended. I also checked with the product team to ensure this aligns with our design specifications.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261030-6-f8bd9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261030-6-f8bd9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7aff5a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6cc1a0f6\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-30T09:22:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for clarifying, David. Maybe we should update the user documentation to explain this behavior?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261030-7-02865\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261030-7-02865\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7aff5a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fc4619fa\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-30T09:23:00\", \"text\": \"Good idea, Charlie. I'll coordinate with the documentation team to add a note about the time zone settings and their purpose.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261030-8-30011\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261030-8-30011\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7aff5a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_802e8eff\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-30T09:26:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, David. That should help clear up any future confusion.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261030-9-8c61c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261030-9-8c61c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7aff5a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6cc1a0f6\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-02T22:19:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) vulnerability on the login page.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-0-711ef\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-0-711ef\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7aff5a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6cc1a0f6\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-02T22:20:00\", \"text\": \"After a thorough review, I've determined that this does not require a fix.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-1-c6d15\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-1-c6d15\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7aff5a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fc4619fa\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-02T22:23:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_6cc1a0f6 Could you explain why it's not a concern? XSS sounds pretty serious.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-2-07718\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-2-07718\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7aff5a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6cc1a0f6\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-02T22:24:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, David. The reported XSS vulnerability is actually a result of a misconfiguration in the testing environment.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-3-86c8e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-3-86c8e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7aff5a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6cc1a0f6\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-02T22:27:00\", \"text\": \"In our production environment, input sanitization and output encoding are correctly implemented, preventing any script injection.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-4-4e853\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-4-4e853\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7aff5a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_802e8eff\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-02T22:28:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for clarifying, David. So, it was just an issue with the test setup?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-5-f9dff\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-5-f9dff\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7aff5a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6cc1a0f6\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-02T22:33:00\", \"text\": \"Exactly, Charlie. I verified the configurations and confirmed that the production environment is secure.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-6-9ad16\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-6-9ad16\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7aff5a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6cc1a0f6\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-02T22:35:00\", \"text\": \"I also ran additional tests to ensure there are no vulnerabilities in the live system.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-7-8cf91\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-7-8cf91\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7aff5a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fc4619fa\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-02T22:37:00\", \"text\": \"Great to hear! Thanks for the detailed investigation, David.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-8-3423e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-8-3423e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7aff5a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_802e8eff\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-02T22:41:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, thanks for looking into this so quickly, @eid_6cc1a0f6.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-9-39942\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-9-39942\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7aff5a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6cc1a0f6\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-02T22:44:00\", \"text\": \"No problem, team. Let me know if there's anything else you need!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-10-6a22d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-10-6a22d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8658e19c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-13T00:44:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the weak password policy enforcement. The concern was that our system allows users to set weak passwords, potentially making it easier for brute force attacks.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260912-0-ed551\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260912-0-ed551\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8658e19c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-13T00:49:00\", \"text\": \"After reviewing the system configuration and policies, I found that this is actually expected behavior. Our current setup is designed to allow flexibility for users who prefer simpler passwords, as long as they are aware of the risks.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260912-1-6129b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260912-1-6129b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df5d4b7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-13T00:54:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, Ian. So, there's no need for a fix because it's a user choice issue?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260912-2-1ca49\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260912-2-1ca49\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8658e19c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-13T00:59:00\", \"text\": \"Exactly, Bob. We provide users with the option to set stronger passwords, and we also have additional security measures in place, like two-factor authentication, to mitigate potential risks.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260912-3-279e6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260912-3-279e6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_13cb0e90\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-13T01:01:00\", \"text\": \"That makes sense. Did you check if there were any misconfigurations that might have led to this report?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260912-4-20c25\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260912-4-20c25\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8658e19c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-13T01:03:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, Julia. I verified the configurations and everything is set up as intended. The report seems to stem from a misunderstanding of our policy flexibility rather than a technical issue.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260912-5-ae0da\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260912-5-ae0da\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d96fb219\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-13T01:08:00\", \"text\": \"Good to know, Ian. Should we consider updating our documentation to make this clearer to users?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260912-6-e2dfd\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260912-6-e2dfd\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8658e19c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-13T01:13:00\", \"text\": \"That's a great idea, Emma. I'll coordinate with the documentation team to ensure our password policy and security measures are clearly communicated to users.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260912-7-68edb\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260912-7-68edb\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df5d4b7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-13T01:18:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Ian. Appreciate the thorough review and follow-up on this.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260912-8-8dbb9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260912-8-8dbb9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8658e19c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-13T01:20:00\", \"text\": \"No problem, Bob. If anyone has further questions or concerns, feel free to reach out!\", \"utterranceID\": 