14:25:00\", \"text\": \"Alright, I've gone through the code and the test results. The integration with the edge nodes looks solid, and I see a clear 30% reduction in latency. Great job! 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260426-4-9b279\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260426-4-9b279\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-georgegarcia-WorkFlowGenie\", \"channelID\": \"ch-owaix-db5d92\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e214d622\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-25T14:29:00\", \"text\": \"I've reviewed the performance under increased load, and it handles the 50% volume increase without any issues. The end-to-end tests also confirm that notifications are accurate and timely. Well done, @eid_136119e9! 🎉\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260426-5-5752c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260426-5-5752c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-georgegarcia-WorkFlowGenie\", \"channelID\": \"ch-owaix-db5d92\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_55f29a0d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-25T14:34:00\", \"text\": \"LGTM, approved! Let's get this merged. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260426-6-5f8b0\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260426-6-5f8b0\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-georgegarcia-WorkFlowGenie\", \"channelID\": \"ch-owaix-db5d92\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e214d622\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-25T14:39:00\", \"text\": \"Approved from my side too! Great work, team! 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260426-7-27b20\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260426-7-27b20\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-georgegarcia-WorkFlowGenie\", \"channelID\": \"ch-owaix-db5d92\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_136119e9\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-25T14:44:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, @Charlie Davis and Alice! Appreciate the quick review. I'll merge it now. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260426-8-cd701\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260426-8-cd701\"