 handle this.\\nAlice Taylor: Fiona, if you need any help with the pre-trained models, feel free to reach out. I've worked with them before.\\nFiona Martinez: Thanks, Alice. I might take you up on that offer.\\nJulia Smith: Moving on, we have the task of improving the user onboarding process. Bob, you're assigned to integrate the feedback bot into Slack.\\nBob Garcia: Yes, I'll be implementing the core functionality of the feedback bot. I confirm, I’ll take care of this implementation.\\nDavid Brown: Bob, make sure the bot's interactions are seamless and don't disrupt the user workflow.\\nBob Garcia: Absolutely, David. I'll ensure it's smooth.\\nJulia Smith: Lastly, we have the performance optimization task through edge computing and data caching. Bob Miller, this one's for you.\\nBob Miller: Yes, I'll be implementing edge computing for Slack workflow processing. Got it, I’ll handle this.\\nAlice Taylor: Bob, if you need any architectural insights, feel free to loop me in.\\nBob Miller: Thanks, Alice. I'll definitely reach out if needed.\\nJulia Smith: Great, I think we're all set with the assignments. Let's make sure to keep the communication open and address any issues as they arise. Thanks, everyone!\\nIan Davis: Thanks, Julia. Looking forward to seeing the progress in our next meeting.\", \"date\": \"2026-03-21T08:59:00\", \"document_type\": \"product-planning\", \"participants\": [\"eid_95f6d01c\", \"eid_f4f58faa\", \"eid_71c0d545\", \"eid_1f678d18\", \"eid_827a0ea9\", \"eid_2543da6a\", \"eid_c92d3e03\", \"eid_55f29a0d\", \"eid_1e8695b6\", \"eid_d96bfd9b\", \"eid_136119e9\", \"eid_18571957\", \"eid_e214d622\", \"eid_e3c15ff5\", \"eid_515ae627\", \"eid_686130c8\", \"eid_4812cbd8\"], \"id\": \"product_dev_flowAIX_2\"}\n{\"transcript\": \"Attendees\\nGeorge Garcia, David Garcia, Ian Davis, David Brown, Julia Smith, Alice Taylor, Julia Brown, Charlie Davis, Charlie Martinez, Fiona Martinez, Bob Miller, Julia Garcia, Alice Taylor, Fiona Martinez, Bob Garcia, Charlie