. Now, are there any other tasks or PRs we need to discuss today?\\nJulia Williams: Not from my side. I think we've covered the main points for this session.\\nJulia Garcia: Alright, if there are no further updates, let's wrap up. Thanks, everyone, for your hard work. Let's keep the momentum going!\\nHannah Martinez: Thanks, team. Have a great day!\", \"date\": \"2026-10-06T22:56:00\", \"document_type\": \"product-planning\", \"participants\": [\"eid_8c71a7a9\", \"eid_35e32fec\", \"eid_b67edbb4\", \"eid_6f719d21\", \"eid_6bd20afa\", \"eid_e42b000f\", \"eid_5e3edafc\", \"eid_19f537cf\", \"eid_ea95d983\", \"eid_84b3cc1f\", \"eid_576f3f62\", \"eid_961f0487\", \"eid_36569bb7\", \"eid_65324b8a\", \"eid_04a698e5\", \"eid_6a0f49ba\", \"eid_e81cfe3f\", \"eid_67f8a879\", \"eid_15ac3a3b\", \"eid_9307fe85\", \"eid_1fd8457f\", \"eid_d5987f51\", \"eid_e9652ef0\", \"eid_e1bcb754\", \"eid_5780b68c\"], \"id\": \"product_dev_AutoTuneForce_9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_04a698e5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-21T02:18:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, please check my PR for implementing real-time data updates in the dashboard: https://github.com/salesforce/ATF_AIX/pull/20. This should ensure users receive the most current information without needing to refresh manually. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260921-0-02e25\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260921-0-02e25\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_36569bb7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-21T02:23:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_04a698e5 Thanks for sharing! I'll start reviewing it now. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260921-1-467c5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260921-1-467c5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\":