bb7. The implementation meets all the acceptance criteria. Great job, @eid_04a698e5! LGTM, approved! 🎉\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260921-6-46867\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260921-6-46867\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_04a698e5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-21T02:44:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone! Appreciate the quick reviews and feedback. Glad to hear everything's working smoothly. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260921-7-87241\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260921-7-87241\"}\n{\"transcript\": \"Attendees\\nHannah Martinez, Ian Taylor, David Miller, Ian Smith, Julia Garcia, Hannah Johnson, Julia Williams, George Davis, Emma Williams, George Johnson, Hannah Jones, Alice Brown, Julia Taylor, Bob Martinez, George Taylor, George Jones, David Martinez, Bob Williams, George Jones, Bob Davis, Fiona Williams, Alice Davis, George Smith, Ian Smith, Alice Davis\\nTranscript\\nHannah Martinez: Alright, everyone, let's get started with our sprint review. First, we'll go over the completed PRs. Julia, could you kick us off with the real-time data updates?\\nJulia Garcia: Sure, Hannah. The PR for implementing real-time data updates in the dashboard has been successfully merged. Users can now see the most current information without needing to refresh manually. Great job, everyone involved!\\nIan Taylor: That's fantastic news. It should really enhance the user experience. How about the security review of the blockchain implementation?\\nHannah Johnson: I can take that. We conducted a comprehensive security review, and I'm happy to report that we've addressed several potential vulnerabilities. The blockchain implementation is now much more robust.\\nDavid Miller: Great work, team. Now, let's move on to the pending tasks. First up, we have the task of improving the analytics dashboard. Bob, this one's assigned to you, right?\\nBob Martinez: Yes, that's correct. The PR titled 'Simplify Dashboard Design and Improve UI/UX' is on my plate. I'll be refining the design to simplify the interface and enhance the user experience.\\nHannah Martinez: Perfect. Do you have everything you need to get started on that?\\nBob Martinez: Yes, I do. Got it, I’ll handle this.\\nGeorge Davis: Great. Moving on, we have the task of enhancing security measures. Alice, you're assigned to the PR titled 'Implement Automated Security Monitoring for Blockchain'.\\nAlice Davis: That's right. I'll be setting up automated monitoring tools to continuously assess the security posture of our blockchain network.\\nJulia Williams: Alice, do you foresee any challenges with this implementation?\\nAlice Davis: Not at the moment. I have a clear plan in place. I confirm, I’ll take care of this implementation.\\nJulia Garcia: Excellent. If you need any support, feel free to reach out. Let's make sure we keep the momentum going.\\nHannah Martinez: Alright, team. That wraps up our sprint review. Keep up the great work, and let's aim to have these tasks completed by the next sprint. Thanks, everyone!\", \"date\": \"2026-09-29T22:45:00\", \"document_type\": \"product-planning\", \"participants\": [\"eid_8c71a7a9\", \"eid_35e32fec\", \"eid_b67edbb4\", \"eid_6f719d21\", \"eid_6bd20afa\", \"eid_e42b000f\", \"eid_5e3edafc\", \"eid_19f537cf\", \"eid_ea95d983\", \"eid_84b3cc1f\", \"eid_576f3f62\", \"eid_961f0487\", \"eid_36569bb7\", \"eid_65324b8a\", \"eid_04a698e5\", \"eid_6a0f49ba\", \"eid_e81cfe3f\", \"eid_67f8a879\", \"eid_15ac3a3b\", \"eid_9307fe85\", \"eid_1fd8457f\", \"eid_d5987f51\", \"eid_e9652ef0\", \"eid_e1bcb754\", \"eid_5780b68c\"], \"id\": \"product_dev_AutoTuneForce_8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_0719bc3e\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-08T19:38:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, I noticed that PR# 14 titled 'Enhance Dashboard Navigation Features' is approved but not merged yet. I heard there might be a change in product direction. Can someone clarify if we still need this PR?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260908-0-8444d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260908-0-8444d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_36569bb7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-08T19:42:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, I approved it last week. But I've also heard about the change in direction. @eid_04a698e5, could you provide some context on whether this enhancement aligns with our current goals?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260908-1-3d8c4\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260908-1-3d8c4\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_04a698e5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-08T19:46:00\", \"text\": \"Sure, the PR was initially created to improve user experience on the dashboard. However, I've been informed that we're shifting focus away from this feature set. So, it might not be necessary anymore.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260908-2-51322\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260908-2-51322\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_7f22371d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-08T19:51:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, @eid_04a698e5. Just to confirm, has the PR been merged yet, or is it still open?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260908-3-a2bc6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260908-3-a2bc6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_04a698e5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-08T19:55:00\", \"text\": \"It's still open and hasn't been merged yet.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260908-4-c97e3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260908-4-c97e3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_061285c7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-08T19:59:00\", \"text\": \"In that case, should we decide not to merge it to avoid unnecessary changes in the codebase?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260908-5-4f8cc\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260908-5-4f8cc\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6a0f49ba\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-08T20:04:00\", \"text\": \"I agree. If the product direction has changed, it makes sense not to merge it. @eid_04a698e5, could you hold off on merging this PR?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260908-6-1a336\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260908-6-1a336\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_961f0487\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-08T20:07:00\", \"text\": \"I concur with the team. Let's not merge it for now.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260908-7-c95fb\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260908-7-c95fb\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_9c46088d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-08T20:10:00\", \"text\": \"Sounds like a plan. @eid_04a698e5, please confirm that you'll keep this PR unmerged.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260908-8-1f988\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260908-8-1f988\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_04a698e5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-08T20:12:00\", \"text\": \"Got it, team. I'll ensure that PR# 14 remains unmerged. I'll take the necessary action soon. Thanks for the input, everyone.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260908-9-379a4\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260908-9-379a4\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_061285c7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-09T07:05:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, I've heard there's a discussion about potentially reverting PR# 15. Can someone provide more context on why this is being considered?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260909-0-e9918\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260909-0-e9918\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_36569bb7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-09T07:06:00\", \"text\": \"Sure, @eid_061285c7. The product direction has shifted, and the advanced data privacy measures introduced in this PR are no longer aligned with our current goals.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260909-1-952c8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260909-1-952c8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_7f22371d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-09T07:07:00\", \"text\": \"Does this mean the features in the PR are completely unnecessary, or is there a chance they might be useful in the future?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260909-2-ca588\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260909-2-ca588\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_04a698e5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-09T07:08:00\", \"text\": \"From what I understand, the features might still be useful, but not in the immediate roadmap. We might revisit them later, but for now, they don't fit with our priorities.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260909-3-c95f7\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260909-3-c95f7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_9c46088d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-09T07:12:00\", \"text\": \"Was there any feedback from stakeholders or users that prompted this change in direction?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260909-4-2cf5c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260909-4-2cf5c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5780b68c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-09T07:15:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, @eid_9c46088d. Recent stakeholder meetings highlighted a need to focus on scalability and performance enhancements over privacy measures at this stage.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260909-5-fa932\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260909-5-fa932\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_65324b8a\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-09T07:16:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the clarification, everyone. I authored the PR, so I can handle the revert if that's the decision.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260909-6-0a534\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260909-6-0a534\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_0719bc3e\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-09T07:20:00\", \"text\": \"Given the current priorities, I think reverting makes sense. @eid_65324b8a, could you please proceed with the revert?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260909-7-b6075\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260909-7-b6075\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_65324b8a\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-09T07:23:00\", \"text\": \"Understood, I'll take care of reverting the PR soon. Thanks for the input, everyone.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260909-8-76214\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260909-8-76214\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_65324b8a\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-09T14:21:00\", \"text\": \"https://github.com/salesforce/ATF_AIX/pull/17\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260909-0-a7c41\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260909-0-a7c41\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_36569bb7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-09T14:23:00\", \"text\": \"Approved\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260909-1-01673\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260909-1-01673\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_04a698e5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-09T14:25:00\", \"text\": \"Approved\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260909-2-520df\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260909-2-520df\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5780b68c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-09T14:28:00\", \"text\": \"Looks good\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260909-3-e7cbd\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260909-3-e7cbd\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_961f0487\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-13T08:00:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, please check my PR for implementing real-time data updates in the dashboard: https://github.com/salesforce/ATF_AIX/pull/18. 🚀 The goal is to ensure users receive the most current information without needing to refresh manually. Let me know your thoughts!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260913-0-5af34\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260913-0-5af34\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_36569bb7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-13T08:02:00\", \"text\": \"Hey @eid_961f0487, thanks for sharing! Just took a quick look at the PR. I see you've used WebSockets for the real-time updates, which is great. I'll dive deeper into the code now. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260913-1-dcfd9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260913-1-dcfd9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6a0f49ba\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-13T08:03:00\", \"text\": \"Hi @eid_961f0487, awesome work on getting this together! I'll review the performance aspects and see how it handles under load. Let's make sure it doesn't slow down the dashboard. 🔍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260913-2-1deaa\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260913-2-1deaa\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_36569bb7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-13T08:06:00\", \"text\": \"Okay, I've gone through the implementation. The WebSocket integration looks solid, but I noticed that when multiple updates come in quickly, there's a slight lag. @eid_961f0487, have you considered optimizing the update frequency or batching updates?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260913-3-2cb30\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260913-3-2cb30\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_961f0487\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-13T08:08:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the feedback, Julia! I did notice some lag during testing, but I thought it was within acceptable limits. I'll look into batching updates to see if that helps. 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260913-4-67056\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260913-4-67056\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6a0f49ba\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-13T08:11:00\", \"text\": \"From my side, the system seems stable under normal load, but when I simulated a high number of concurrent users, the performance dipped a bit. We might need to optimize the server-side handling of WebSocket connections. @eid_961f0487, any thoughts on this?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260913-5-01544\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260913-5-01544\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_961f0487\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-13T08:15:00\", \"text\": \"Good catch, George. I can work on optimizing the server-side logic to better handle concurrent connections. Maybe implementing a load balancer could help distribute the load more effectively. I'll experiment with that. 💡\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260913-6-0cd0d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260913-6-0cd0d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_36569bb7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-13T08:19:00\", \"text\": \"Sounds like a plan! Also, I noticed the user notifications for data updates are a bit too subtle. Maybe we could make them slightly more noticeable without being intrusive? Just a thought. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260913-7-77459\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260913-7-77459\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_961f0487\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-13T08:24:00\", \"text\": \"Got it, Julia. I'll tweak the notification design to make it more visible. Thanks for pointing that out! I'll push the changes once I've made these improvements. 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260913-8-7c888\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260913-8-7c888\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6a0f49ba\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-13T08:25:00\", \"text\": \"Looking forward to the updates, @eid_961f0487! Let us know when it's ready for another round of reviews. Great work so far! 👏\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260913-9-293aa\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260913-9-293aa\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6a0f49ba\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-08T21:30:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, please check my PR for the analytics dashboard frontend: https://github.com/salesforce/ATF_AIX/pull/6. I've set up the initial React structure, created basic components for the layout, and ensured it's responsive. Let me know your thoughts! 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260811-0-8a016\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260811-0-8a016\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_36569bb7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-08T21:33:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_6a0f49ba Thanks for sharing! I'll take a look at it now. Excited to see the new dashboard in action! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260811-1-ed0ad\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260811-1-ed0ad\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_04a698e5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-08T21:36:00\", \"text\": \"Hey @eid_6a0f49ba, I'll review it too. Looking forward to seeing how the responsive design works across different devices. 📱💻\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260811-2-eb39a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260811-2-eb39a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_65324b8a\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-08T21:37:00\", \"text\": \"Checking it out now, @eid_6a0f49ba. Let's make sure everything runs smoothly! 🔍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260811-3-df653\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260811-3-df653\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_36569bb7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-08T21:38:00\", \"text\": \"Just finished reviewing. The React app is set up perfectly and runs without any errors. The components are rendering as expected. Great job on the responsive design too, it looks good on both my phone and laptop. LGTM, approved! 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260811-4-bb3f9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260811-4-bb3f9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_04a698e5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-08T21:43:00\", \"text\": \"I agree with @eid_36569bb7. Everything looks solid, and the code is clean and easy to follow. The layout adapts well to different screen sizes. LGTM, approved! 🎉\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260811-5-63ff4\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260811-5-63ff4\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_65324b8a\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-08T21:47:00\", \"text\": \"Nice work, @eid_6a0f49ba! The setup is error-free, and the components are well-structured. Responsive design is spot on. LGTM, approved! 🥳\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260811-6-e8ed7\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260811-6-e8ed7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6a0f49ba\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-08T21:50:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone! Really appreciate the quick reviews and feedback. Glad to hear everything's working well. I'll go ahead and merge it. 🎊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260811-7-400fc\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260811-7-400fc\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_36569bb7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-08T21:54:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome, looking forward to the next steps! Thanks for the hard work, @eid_6a0f49ba! 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260811-8-5ea72\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260811-8-5ea72\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_04a698e5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-08T21:59:00\", \"text\": \"Great job, team! Let's keep up the momentum. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260811-9-5fcd2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260811-9-5fcd2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_65324b8a\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-08T22:02:00\", \"text\": \"Onward and upward! Thanks, @eid_6a0f49ba! 👏\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260811-10-e5171\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260811-10-e5171\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_04a698e5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-30T20:49:00\", \"text\": \"@here check some functionalities of our product here https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/AutoTuneForce/demo_1\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260730-0-35734\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260730-0-35734\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-02T17:44:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_0719bc3e, @eid_061285c7, @eid_9c46088d joined develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260802-43-08460\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260802-43-08460\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_0719bc3e\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-02T23:05:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, I noticed that PR# 3 titled 'Integrate Blockchain Security Enhancements' has been approved but not merged yet. I've heard there's been a change in product direction. Can someone clarify what this means for the PR?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260802-0-8ca70\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260802-0-8ca70\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_65324b8a\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-02T23:08:00\", \"text\": \"Hey @eid_0719bc3e, yes, the product team has decided to pivot away from blockchain enhancements for now. The focus is shifting towards other priorities, so this PR might not be necessary anymore.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260802-1-aea05\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260802-1-aea05\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_7f22371d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-02T23:09:00\", \"text\": \"Does this mean the security enhancements are no longer needed at all, or just not in the current scope?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260802-2-34ce7\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260802-2-34ce7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_04a698e5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-02T23:11:00\", \"text\": \"From what I understand, it's more about timing and current priorities. The enhancements could be useful in the future, but they're not aligned with the immediate goals.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260802-3-23fd3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260802-3-23fd3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_061285c7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-02T23:12:00\", \"text\": \"Got it. So, should we hold off on merging this PR then?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260802-4-78c67\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260802-4-78c67\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_9c46088d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-02T23:16:00\", \"text\": \"I think it makes sense to not merge it for now. We can revisit it if the product direction changes again.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260802-5-21cb1\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260802-5-21cb1\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5780b68c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-02T23:19:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, everyone. Just to confirm, the PR hasn't been merged yet. Should I go ahead and close it?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260802-6-40df7\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260802-6-40df7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_65324b8a\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-02T23:20:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, @eid_5780b68c, please don't merge it. Let's keep it on hold until further notice.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260802-7-58286\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260802-7-58286\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5780b68c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-02T23:24:00\", \"text\": \"Understood. I'll make sure not to merge it and will keep it on hold. Let me know if there's any change in direction.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260802-8-4102b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260802-8-4102b\"}\n{\"transcript\": \"Attendees\\nHannah Martinez, Ian Taylor, David Miller, Ian Smith, Julia Garcia, Hannah Johnson, Julia Williams, George Davis, Emma Williams, George Johnson, Hannah Jones, Alice Brown, Julia Taylor, Bob Martinez, George Taylor, George Jones, David Martinez, Bob Williams, George Jones, Bob Davis, Fiona Williams, Alice Davis, George Smith, Ian Smith, Alice Davis\\nTranscript\\nHannah Martinez: Alright team, let's get started with our sprint review. First, let's go over the status of our completed PRs. Does anyone have updates on those?\\nJulia Garcia: Actually, I think we should focus on the pending tasks first since we don't have any completed PRs to discuss today.\\nHannah Martinez: Good point, Julia. Let's dive into the pending tasks then. First up, we have the task of improving the analytics dashboard. Alice, you submitted a PR for this, right?\\nAlice Brown: Yes, I did. The PR is titled 'Implement Real-Time Data Updates in Dashboard'. It needs some additional revisions based on the feedback I received.\\nGeorge Taylor: I'll be taking over the revisions for this task. I'll submit a new PR once the changes are made.\\nHannah Martinez: Great, George. Can you confirm that you'll handle this?\\nGeorge Taylor: Got it, I’ll handle this.\\nJulia Garcia: Perfect. Now, moving on to enhancing security measures. Alice, you also submitted a PR for the security review, correct?\\nAlice Davis: That's right. The PR is titled 'Conduct Comprehensive Security Review of Blockchain Implementation'. It also needs some revisions.\\nBob Martinez: I'll be working on a new PR for this task. I'll make sure to address all the feedback and submit it soon.\\nHannah Martinez: Bob, can you confirm that you'll take care of this implementation?\\nBob Martinez: I confirm, I’ll take care of this implementation.\\nJulia Williams: Just a quick note, make sure to review the security guidelines we discussed last week. They should help with the revisions.\\nBob Martinez: Thanks, Julia. I'll definitely keep those in mind.\\nHannah Martinez: Alright, I think that covers our pending tasks for now. Does anyone have any questions or need further clarification on their assignments?\\nIan Taylor: No questions from me. Everything seems clear.\\nDavid Miller: Same here. I'm good to go.\\nIan Smith: All clear on my end as well.\\nHannah Martinez: Great! Let's aim to have these revisions completed by the end of the week. Thanks, everyone, for your hard work. Meeting adjourned.\", \"date\": \"2026-09-19T09:51:00\", \"document_type\": \"product-planning\", \"participants\": [\"eid_8c71a7a9\", \"eid_35e32fec\", \"eid_b67edbb4\", \"eid_6f719d21\", \"eid_6bd20afa\", \"eid_e42b000f\", \"eid_5e3edafc\", \"eid_19f537cf\", \"eid_ea95d983\", \"eid_84b3cc1f\", \"eid_576f3f62\", \"eid_961f0487\", \"eid_36569bb7\", \"eid_65324b8a\", \"eid_04a698e5\", \"eid_6a0f49ba\", \"eid_e81cfe3f\", \"eid_67f8a879\", \"eid_15ac3a3b\", \"eid_9307fe85\", \"eid_1fd8457f\", \"eid_d5987f51\", \"eid_e9652ef0\", \"eid_e1bcb754\", \"eid_5780b68c\"], \"id\": \"product_dev_AutoTuneForce_7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_36569bb7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-09T07:25:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, please check my PR for the dashboard redesign: https://github.com/salesforce/ATF_AIX/pull/25. I've simplified the UI elements, standardized the design, and improved the overall user experience. Let me know your thoughts! 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261013-0-c06ab\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261013-0-c06ab\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_04a698e5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-09T07:26:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_36569bb7 Thanks for sharing! I'll take a look at it now. Excited to see the improvements! 👀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261013-1-b37a9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261013-1-b37a9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6a0f49ba\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-09T07:28:00\", \"text\": \"Hey @eid_36569bb7, just started reviewing. The color scheme looks much more cohesive now. Great job on that! 🎨\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261013-2-be883\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261013-2-be883\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_65324b8a\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-09T07:29:00\", \"text\": \"Checking it out now, @eid_36569bb7. I appreciate the focus on user feedback and usability tests. That's crucial! 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261013-3-f7162\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261013-3-f7162\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_04a698e5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-09T07:34:00\", \"text\": \"Alright, I've gone through the changes. The UI elements are definitely more streamlined and consistent. The typography is spot on too. LGTM, approved! ✅\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261013-4-75772\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261013-4-75772\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6a0f49ba\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-09T07:35:00\", \"text\": \"Just finished my review. The design is much cleaner and user-friendly. I can see the user feedback really paid off. Approved from my side! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261013-5-0cc9b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261013-5-0cc9b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_65324b8a\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-09T07:40:00\", \"text\": \"Everything checks out for me as well. The usability tests clearly show the design meets user needs. Great work, @eid_36569bb7! Approved! 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261013-6-92757\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261013-6-92757\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_36569bb7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-09T07:42:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone! Really appreciate the feedback and approvals. Let's get this merged and make our dashboard even better! 🎉\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261013-7-f6597\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261013-7-f6597\"}\n{\"title\": \"Implement Fallback Mechanism for Non-Quantum Systems\", \"summary\": \"Develop a robust fallback mechanism that allows the parameter tuning engine to operate on systems that do not support quantum computing, ensuring consistent performance across all environments.\", \"link\": \"https://github.com/salesforce/ATF_AIX/pull/10\", \"mergeable\": \"True\", \"merged\": \"False\", \"number\": \"10\", \"state\": \"open\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_961f0487\"}, \"created_at\": \"2026-08-23T06:23:00\", \"reviews\": [{\"state\": \"APPROVED\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_576f3f62\"}, \"comment\": \"The fallback mechanism is well-implemented and switches seamlessly between environments. The performance tests show that the system maintains efficiency on non-quantum systems. LGTM, approved! 🎉\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-08-23T15:50:00\"}, {\"state\": \"PENDING\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_84b3cc1f\"}, \"comment\": \"The documentation is clear and provides good instructions on how the fallback mechanism operates. Everything looks solid to me. LGTM, approved as well! 🚀\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-08-23T15:51:00\"}], \"id\": \"github_com_salesforce_ATF_AIX_pull_10\"}\n{\"title\": \"Enhance Dashboard Navigation Features\", \"summary\": \"Improve the navigation features of the analytics dashboard to ensure a seamless and intuitive user experience.\", \"link\": \"https://github.com/salesforce/ATF_AIX/pull/11\", \"mergeable\": \"True\", \"merged\": \"False\", \"number\": \"11\", \"state\": \"open\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_961f0487\"}, \"created_at\": \"2026-08-23T21:46:00\", \"reviews\": [{\"state\": \"APPROVED\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_36569bb7\"}, \"comment\": \"The navigation bar looks great and covers all major sections. The labels and icons are clear and intuitive. Did we gather any user feedback on the new design? It would be great to incorporate any insights from actual users.\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-08-24T09:21:00\"}, {\"state\": \"CHANGES_REQUESTED\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_6a0f49ba\"}, \"comment\": \"The design is very user-friendly, but the performance could be optimized further. The navigation seems sluggish when switching between sections, especially in the 'Reports' section. Consider looking into lazy loading some components.\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-08-24T09:06:00\"}], \"id\": \"github_com_salesforce_ATF_AIX_pull_11\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6f719d21\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-17T08:30:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, QA team found some issues in the last release of ATF_AIX. The issue was reported by QA Specialist eid_dc8bf84e.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260705-0-c5811\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260705-0-c5811\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8c71a7a9\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-17T08:33:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, Ian. What exactly did they find?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260705-1-21738\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260705-1-21738\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6f719d21\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-17T08:38:00\", \"text\": \"Some users are having trouble understanding the parameter adjustment process due to a lack of detailed documentation.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260705-2-9e09b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260705-2-9e09b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_35e32fec\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-17T08:40:00\", \"text\": \"Wasn't the product developed and tested by a different team before we took over?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260705-3-9bb58\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260705-3-9bb58\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2490c02c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-17T08:45:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, it was. Maybe they didn't provide enough documentation with the product.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260705-4-5901f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260705-4-5901f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b67edbb4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-17T08:48:00\", \"text\": \"Could be. Also, do we have comprehensive user guides or tutorials available?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260705-5-89894\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260705-5-89894\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_84b3cc1f\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-17T08:52:32\", \"text\": \"@here Stay updated with this article on the latest advancements in AI model optimization. It highlights trends that align with the goals of ATF_AIX. https://venturebeat.com/ai/ai-model-optimization-trends/\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260617-27-ef5f1\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260617-27-ef5f1\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ad0725a2\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-17T08:53:00\", \"text\": \"Good point, David. If the guides are lacking, that could definitely be a factor.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260705-6-f4f8c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260705-6-f4f8c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8c71a7a9\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-17T08:57:00\", \"text\": \"What about the design? Is the parameter adjustment process too complex to explain easily?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260705-7-1aa09\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260705-7-1aa09\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6f719d21\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-17T08:58:00\", \"text\": \"That's possible. We might need to simplify the process or at least make the explanation clearer