03-0-60416\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260903-0-60416\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b67edbb4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-18T17:09:00\", \"text\": \"That's awesome! What did they say, Bob?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260903-1-148ed\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260903-1-148ed\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2490c02c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-18T17:14:00\", \"text\": \"Customer CUST-0093 praised the platform for its robust performance on high-end systems, especially with large datasets. No significant lag reported!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260903-2-17541\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260903-2-17541\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6f719d21\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-18T17:17:00\", \"text\": \"Impressive! Handling large datasets efficiently is a big win. Kudos to the previous team!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260903-3-f4299\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260903-3-f4299\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_35e32fec\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-18T17:18:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_2490c02c Any other feedback?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260903-4-ec1eb\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260903-4-ec1eb\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-ATF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-3a5e7c\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2490c02c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-18T17:19:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, Ian. Customer CUST-0029 mentioned that the Einstein Auto-Tuning feature offers comprehensive analytics and insights. It helps users understand the impact of parameter