com/salesforce/ATF_AIX/pull/21\", \"mergeable\": \"True\", \"merged\": \"False\", \"number\": \"21\", \"state\": \"open\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_65324b8a\"}, \"created_at\": \"2026-09-25T12:21:00\", \"reviews\": [{\"state\": \"APPROVED\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_36569bb7\"}, \"comment\": \"I've gone through the report and the code changes. The identified vulnerabilities are well addressed, and the mitigation strategies are spot on. The documentation will definitely be useful for future reference. LGTM, approved! ✅\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-09-26T03:38:00\"}, {\"state\": \"PENDING\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_6a0f49ba\"}, \"comment\": \"Just finished my review. Everything aligns perfectly with the acceptance criteria. The security review is thorough, and the documentation is clear. Nice job, @eid_65324b8a! Approved! 🚀\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-09-26T03:43:00\"}, {\"state\": \"COMMENTED\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_5780b68c\"}, \"comment\": \"All done with my review too. The PR meets all the criteria, and the security measures are well implemented. Great work, @eid_65324b8a! LGTM, approved! 🎉\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-09-26T03:45:00\"}], \"id\": \"github_com_salesforce_ATF_AIX_pull_21\"}\n{\"title\": \"Revert PR# 20: Address Potential Security Risks in Real-Time Updates\", \"summary\": \"This revert PR addresses the potential security risks identified in PR# 20, which introduced real-time updates using WebSockets. Concerns were raised about data exposure and unauthorized access due to insufficient access control measures. To ensure the security of our system, we are reverting these changes until a thorough security audit can be conducted and necessary safeguards are implemented.\", \"link\": \"https://github.com/salesforce/ATF_AIX/pull/22\", \"mergeable\": \"True\", \"merged\": \"True\", \"number\": \"22\", \"state\": \"closed\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_04a698e5\"}, \"created_at\": \"2026-09-25T12:21:00\", \"reviews\": [{\"state\": \"APPROVED\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_36569bb7\"}, \"comment\": \"Approved\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-09-26T21:50:00\"}, {\"state\": \"COMMENTED\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_6a0f49ba\"}, \"comment\": \"LGTM\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-09-26T21:51:00\"}, {\"state\": \"PENDING\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_961f0487\"}, \"comment\": \"Approved\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-09-26T21:55:00\"}], \"id\": \"github_com_salesforce_ATF_AIX_pull_22\"}\n{\"title\": \"Simplify Dashboard Design and Improve UI/UX\", \"summary\": \"Refine the design of the analytics dashboard to simplify the interface and enhance overall user experience.\", \"link\": \"https://github.com/salesforce/ATF_AIX/pull/23\", \"mergeable\": \"True\", \"merged\": \"False\", \"number\": \"23\", \"state\": \"open\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_65324b8a\"}, \"created_at\": \"2026-10-01T01:53:00\", \"reviews\": [{\"state\": \"CHANGES_REQUESTED\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_04a698e5\"}, \"comment\": \"The UI elements are more streamlined, but the typography needs improvement for better readability across devices. Please address this before proceeding.\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-10-01T17:01:00\"}, {\"state\": \"COMMENTED\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_6a0f49ba\"}, \"comment\": \"The screenshots look promising. However, I agree on the need for typography improvements and suggest adding documentation on user feedback. Have usability tests been conducted?\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-10-01T16:59:00\"}], \"id\": \"github_com_salesforce_ATF_AIX_pull_23\"}\n\nAnalytics Dashboard: The analytics dashboard provides users with customizable visualizations for performance monitoring. It allows stakeholders to gain insights into system performance and operational efficiency through intuitive and interactive interfaces. The dashboard supports real-time updates, ensuring that users have access to the most current data and analytics.\nSecurity: Security is a paramount concern in the design of Einstein Auto-Tuning. The system employs blockchain technology to encrypt data transactions and enforce strict access controls. This ensures that data integrity and confidentiality are maintained at all times, protecting sensitive information from unauthorized access.\nScalability: Einstein Auto-Tuning is designed for scalability, supporting horizontal scaling to accommodate growing data volumes and processing demands. The use of quantum computing further enhances its ability to process data in real-time, making it suitable for large-scale industrial applications.\nIntegration: Integration with existing systems is facilitated through a wide range of APIs and data connectors. This minimizes implementation disruption and allows for seamless adoption across various industries. The system is designed to be flexible, adapting to the specific needs and configurations of different operational environments.\nFuture Plans: Future developments for Einstein Auto-Tuning include the integration of advanced machine learning models to further enhance its optimization capabilities. Additionally, the exploration of new industry applications will expand its impact, allowing it to address a broader range of operational challenges and opportunities.\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_35e32fec\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-09T18:08:00\", \"text\": \"As part of our updated priorities, we’ve decided to move forward with merging PRs 24. @here\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261009-0-fc66b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261009-0-fc66b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5780b68c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-10T21:39:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, please check my PR for implementing Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) for our blockchain network: https://github.com/salesforce/ATF_AIX/pull/7. This update integrates the RBAC system, defines roles and permissions, and ensures access logs are generated for compliance. Let me know your thoughts! 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260812-0-ca1ac\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260812-0-ca1ac\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_65324b8a\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-10T21:43:00\", \"text\": \"Hey @eid_5780b68c, thanks for sharing! I'll take a look at it now. Excited to see how you've tackled the RBAC integration. 🔍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260812-1-3d8b3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260812-1-3d8b3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_36569bb7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-10T21:46:00\", \"text\": \"Hi @eid_5780b68c, I'll review it as well. The documentation on roles and permissions will be crucial for us. Let's dive in! 📚\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260812-2-a882e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260812-2-a882e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_65324b8a\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-10T21:51:00\", \"text\": \"Alright, I've gone through the PR. The RBAC system is well integrated with the blockchain network. The roles and permissions are clearly defined and documented, which is great. Also, I see that the access logs are being generated as expected. Everything looks solid to me. 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260812-3-7fea2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260812-3-7fea2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_36569bb7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-10T21:52:00\", \"text\": \"I've reviewed it too, and I agree with Bob