eries of checks before granting access. Can you point out where you see the vulnerabilities?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260816-4-26cc5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260816-4-26cc5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_061285c7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-16T14:34:00\", \"text\": \"I think the issue might be with the validation checks. If they're not comprehensive, it could lead to unauthorized access. @eid_9c46088d, did you find any specific gaps?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260816-5-82085\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260816-5-82085\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_9c46088d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-16T14:37:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, the checks don't seem to cover all edge cases, especially when dealing with nested permissions. This could be exploited by a malicious actor.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260816-6-35d8f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260816-6-35d8f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-66a156\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_36569bb7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-16T14:42:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for pointing that out. It sounds like we need to address these issues before proceeding. @eid_5780b68c, can you work on reverting the PR for now?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260816-7-41a72\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\"",
