hat might be affected?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260811-6-bd765\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260811-6-bd765\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_97d7392d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-12T06:38:00\", \"text\": \"I don't think there are any dependencies yet since it was just set up. But we should double-check with the dev team to be sure.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260811-7-dc0d9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260811-7-dc0d9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_86f94a48\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-12T06:43:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the input, everyone. I'll check with the dev team about any dependencies. If there are none, I'll proceed with reverting the PR.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260811-8-f023f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260811-8-f023f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_839e5084\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-12T06:44:00\", \"text\": \"Sounds good, @eid_86f94a48. Please keep us updated on what you find out and when you plan to revert it.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260811-9-fadb4\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260811-9-fadb4\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_86f94a48\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-12T06:48:00\", \"text\": \"Will do. I'll confirm with the dev team and aim to take action soon. Thanks, everyone!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260811-10-60896\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260811-10-60896\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9c