\"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_01e37306\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-29T13:11:00\", \"text\": \"@here take a look at our product demo, available here https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/CollaborateForce/demo_2\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260729-0-20c7a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260729-0-20c7a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-11T19:26:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_e3612e4a, @eid_9c876927, @eid_3f3ea10f, @eid_bc469a8f, @eid_839e5084, @eid_73a50f06, @eid_0dd1bf2e, @eid_f6c32cc2 joined develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260811-82-db14b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260811-82-db14b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_839e5084\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-12T06:20:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, I noticed that PR# 8 was approved and merged, but I've heard that the product direction has changed. Should we consider reverting this PR?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260811-0-6e1c1\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260811-0-6e1c1\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_01e37306\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-12T06:22:00\", \"text\": \"Hey @eid_839e5084, yes, the product team decided to pivot away from using GraphQL for now. We might need to discuss if reverting is the best course of action.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260811-1-4c37a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260811-1-4c37a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_86f94a48\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-12T06:27:00\", \"text\": \"Hi everyone, I authored the PR. Can someone clarify the new direction and why the GraphQL server is no longer needed?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260811-2-c4d67\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260811-2-c4d67\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_724e1180\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-12T06:28:00\", \"text\": \"Sure, @eid_86f94a48. The product team decided to stick with REST APIs for simplicity and to align with our existing infrastructure. GraphQL was seen as an unnecessary complexity at this stage.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260811-3-52ba7\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260811-3-52ba7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_3f3ea10f\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-12T06:29:00\", \"text\": \"From a QA perspective, reverting the PR would prevent us from having to test and maintain a feature that's not aligned with our current goals.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260811-4-13b85\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260811-4-13b85\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_446bc3ee\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-12T06:34:00\", \"text\": \"I agree with @eid_3f3ea10f. If the GraphQL server isn't going to be used, it makes sense to revert it to avoid confusion and maintenance overhead.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260811-5-805f1\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260811-5-805f1\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_9c876927\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-12T06:37:00\", \"text\": \"Does anyone see any potential issues with reverting the PR? Any dependencies or integrations that might be affected?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260811-6-bd765\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260811-6-bd765\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_97d7392d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-12T06:38:00\", \"text\": \"I don't think there are any dependencies yet since it was just set up. But we should double-check with the dev team to be sure.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260811-7-dc0d9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260811-7-dc0d9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_86f94a48\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-12T06:43:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the input, everyone. I'll check with the dev team about any dependencies. If there are none, I'll proceed with reverting the PR.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260811-8-f023f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260811-8-f023f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_839e5084\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-12T06:44:00\", \"text\": \"Sounds good, @eid_86f94a48. Please keep us updated on what you find out and when you plan to revert it.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260811-9-fadb4\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260811-9-fadb4\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_86f94a48\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-12T06:48:00\", \"text\": \"Will do. I'll confirm with the dev team and aim to take action soon. Thanks, everyone!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260811-10-60896\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260811-10-60896\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f6c32cc2\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-03T05:06:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, I wanted to bring up PR# 36. It was approved and merged, but there's been a change in product direction, and I'm wondering if we should consider reverting it.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-0-cd4b4\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-0-cd4b4\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8cbee5b3\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-03T05:10:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for raising this, @eid_f6c32cc2. Can someone clarify what the new product direction is and why the GraphQL integration is no longer necessary?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-1-50114\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-1-50114\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_839e5084\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-03T05:13:00\", \"text\": \"From what I understand, the focus has shifted towards enhancing our REST API instead of moving forward with GraphQL. The integration might not align with our current goals.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-2-0b032\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-2-0b032\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_86f94a48\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-03T05:15:00\", \"text\": \"I see. @eid_724e1180, could you provide more context on how this integration was supposed to work with our existing systems?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-3-9a6d9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-3-9a6d9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_724e1180\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-03T05:18:00\", \"text\": \"Sure, the integration was designed to allow seamless data flow between our systems using GraphQL, which would have improved data fetching efficiency. But if we're not moving forward with GraphQL, I understand the need to reconsider.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-4-4d9f0\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-4-4d9f0\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_3f3ea10f\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-03T05:23:00\", \"text\": \"Given the shift in focus, does anyone see any immediate issues if we revert the PR? Any dependencies that might break?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-5-9bf68\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-5-9bf68\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_446bc3ee\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-03T05:28:00\", \"text\": \"I don't think there are any dependencies that would be affected. The integration was quite isolated, so reverting should be straightforward.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-6-7fcc6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-6-7fcc6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_9c876927\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-03T05:33:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed. I haven't seen any issues that would arise from reverting. It seems like the best course of action given the circumstances.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-7-6d2c9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-7-6d2c9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7a6e7f9\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-03T05:36:00\", \"text\": \"Alright, it sounds like reverting is the consensus. @eid_724e1180, could you handle the revert for PR# 36?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-8-ff721\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-8-ff721\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_724e1180\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-03T05:37:00\", \"text\": \"Got it, I'll take care of reverting the PR soon. Thanks for the input, everyone.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-9-86f0e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-9-86f0e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_724e1180\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-03T21:16:00\", \"text\": \"https://github.com/salesforce/CollaborateForce/pull/40\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261103-0-0e868\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261103-0-0e868\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8cbee5b3\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-03T21:21:00\", \"text\": \"LGTM\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261103-1-76d63\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261103-1-76d63\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_86f94a48\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-03T21:26:00\", \"text\": \"LGTM\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261103-2-340e3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261103-2-340e3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_446bc3ee\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-03T21:27:00\", \"text\": \"Approved\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261103-3-5f81c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261103-3-5f81c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_accab4fc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-02T14:54:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, I wanted to bring up PR# 35 regarding the Feedback Loop Monitoring and Reporting Tools. I've heard there's been a change in product direction, and we might need to reconsider merging this PR. Thoughts?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-0-05879\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-0-05879\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_724e1180\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-02T14:59:00\", \"text\": \"Hey everyone, yes, I approved the PR, but if the product direction has shifted, we should discuss whether it's still relevant.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-1-0c3b8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-1-0c3b8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_01e37306\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-02T15:02:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed. Can someone clarify what the new product direction is and why this PR might not fit anymore?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-2-3b874\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-2-3b874\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_839e5084\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-02T15:03:00\", \"text\": \"From what I understand, the focus has shifted towards enhancing user interface features rather than backend monitoring tools. This PR might not align with our current priorities.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-3-1c0e7\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-3-1c0e7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_3f3ea10f\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-02T15:06:00\", \"text\": \"That makes sense. If the tools aren't going to be used, it might be best to hold off on merging.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-4-48f53\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-4-48f53\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_9c876927\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-02T15:07:00\", \"text\": \"I agree. We should avoid adding unnecessary features that won't be utilized. @eid_a7dd9c52, can you confirm if the PR is still open or if it has been merged?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-5-b5946\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-5-b5946\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a7dd9c52\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-02T15:12:00\", \"text\": \"Hi all, the PR is still open and hasn't been merged yet.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-6-fe0b3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-6-fe0b3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e3612e4a\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-02T15:13:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for confirming, @eid_a7dd9c52. Given the change in direction, I think it's best not to merge it at this time.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-7-aa01c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-7-aa01c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7a6e7f9\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-02T15:16:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed. Let's hold off on merging until we have a clearer need for these tools.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-8-3b7d6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-8-3b7d6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a7dd9c52\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-02T15:18:00\", \"text\": \"Got it, I'll hold off on merging the PR. If there's any change or further discussion needed, just let me know.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-9-fde95\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-9-fde95\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_73a50f06\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-02T15:23:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, @eid_a7dd9c52. Let's keep communication open in case priorities shift again.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261102-10-b7e5f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261102-10-b7e5f\"}\n{\"transcript\": \"Attendees\\nGeorge Garcia, Fiona Miller, Fiona Brown, Fiona Davis, Hannah Smith, Bob Brown, David Miller, George Smith, Fiona Miller, Emma Brown, Hannah Brown, Emma Taylor, Alice Taylor, Hannah Smith, Hannah Garcia, Emma Jones, David Williams, George Jones, David Miller, David Martinez, Emma Smith, Ian Garcia, Hannah Williams, Bob Garcia, Julia Davis, David Jones, Hannah Johnson, Ian Davis, Fiona Davis, Hannah Garcia, Alice Smith, George Brown, Hannah Garcia, Emma Williams, George Johnson, Alice Jones, David Taylor, Bob Davis, David Miller, David Smith, Julia Miller, Hannah Miller, Fiona Taylor, Julia Davis, Bob Martinez, Fiona Davis, Julia Miller\\nTranscript\\nGeorge Garcia: Alright team, let's kick off this sprint review. First, let's go over the completed PRs. Fiona Miller, could you start with the GraphQL API optimization?\\nFiona Miller: Sure, George. The 'Optimize GraphQL API for Performance' PR has been successfully merged. We've implemented several optimizations that significantly reduce load times and improve data retrieval efficiency. The feedback from the initial tests has been positive.\\nGeorge Garcia: Great work, Fiona. This should really enhance the user experience. Next, Bob Brown, could you update us on the network quality monitoring integration?\\nBob Brown: Absolutely. The 'Integrate Network Quality Monitoring' PR is complete. We've added tools that provide real-time feedback on connection quality. This should help users troubleshoot network issues more effectively during collaboration sessions.\\nGeorge Garcia: Excellent. This feature will be a game-changer for our users. Lastly, Fiona Brown, can you tell us about the API client libraries?\\nFiona Brown: Yes, the 'Develop API Client Libraries for Popular Languages' PR is done. We've created libraries for Python, Java, and JavaScript, making it easier for developers to integrate CollaborateForce into their applications.\\nGeorge Garcia: Fantastic. This will definitely broaden our reach. Now, let's move on to the pending tasks. Emma Jones, you're up for the API design with GraphQL. Can you update us on the documentation task?\\nEmma Jones: Sure thing, George. The task is to add comprehensive documentation for the GraphQL API. This includes usage examples, schema details, and integration guidelines. I'll be handling the implementation.\\nGeorge Garcia: Great, Emma. Just to confirm, you'll be taking care of the 'Add Documentation for GraphQL API Usage' PR?\\nEmma Jones: Yes, I confirm. I'll take care of this implementation.\\nGeorge Garcia: Perfect. Does anyone have any questions or need further clarification on any of the tasks?\\nHannah Smith: I just wanted to clarify the timeline for the documentation task. Emma, do you have an estimated completion date?\\nEmma Jones: I'm aiming to have it completed by the end of next week. I'll keep everyone updated on my progress.\\nGeorge Garcia: Sounds good. If there are no more questions, let's wrap up. Thanks, everyone, for your hard work and dedication. Let's keep up the momentum!\", \"date\": \"2026-11-16T21:45:00\", \"document_type\": \"product-planning\", \"participants\": [\"eid_0c373165\", \"eid_1330d187\", \"eid_ab6f41bc\", \"eid_131494b8\", \"eid_16935c12\", \"eid_d3a4fc8f\", \"eid_2d14387c\", \"eid_9f1ff493\", \"eid_54b986cf\", \"eid_4988ee2a\", \"eid_0e2e8d07\", \"eid_3516c527\", \"eid_ec5cb5c2\", \"eid_1e7c8290\", \"eid_a7dd9c52\", \"eid_446bc3ee\", \"eid_a8040636\", \"eid_13df35ed\", \"eid_76d9cb07\", \"eid_df7ae03e\", \"eid_b3fcc490\", \"eid_0aa9f1f7\", \"eid_a88ee967\", \"eid_abbf3651\", \"eid_737797e3\", \"eid_ec70ac57\", \"eid_619c8be2\", \"eid_7dfbbca2\", \"eid_7fba1318\", \"eid_9e9883de\", \"eid_67036b20\", \"eid_f0c7a505\", \"eid_63ea0ec4\", \"eid_2594f98a\", \"eid_69130545\", \"eid_8986ddc3\", \"eid_70223d0a\", \"eid_67416adf\", \"eid_987771ee\", \"eid_c2a92a40\", \"eid_4d18a84c\", \"eid_a1fab288\", \"eid_8cbee5b3\", \"eid_c42e5095\", \"eid_86f94a48\", \"eid_01e37306\", \"eid_724e1180\"], \"id\": \"product_dev_CollaborateForce_9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_446bc3ee\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-16T12:52:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, please check my PR for implementing resolvers for GraphQL queries and mutations: https://github.com/salesforce/CollaborateForce/pull/23. I've developed resolvers to handle the logic for all defined queries and mutations, optimized data fetching, and ensured everything is tested. Let me know your thoughts! 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260920-0-3e41c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260920-0-3e41c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8cbee5b3\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-16T12:55:00\", \"text\": \"Hey @eid_446bc3ee, thanks for sharing! I'll take a look at it now. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260920-1-06dd0\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260920-1-06dd0\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_724e1180\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-16T12:58:00\", \"text\": \"Checking it out too! Thanks for the heads-up, @eid_446bc3ee. 👀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260920-2-ea0d2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260920-2-ea0d2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8cbee5b3\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-16T13:02:00\", \"text\": \"Alright, I've gone through the PR. The resolvers are implemented for all the queries and mutations as defined. The data fetching logic looks solid and optimized. Great job on the tests too; they return the expected results. 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260920-3-da54d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260920-3-da54d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_724e1180\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-16T13:05:00\", \"text\": \"I agree with Fiona. Everything seems to be in place and working as expected. The performance improvements are noticeable, and the tests are comprehensive. Well done, @eid_446bc3ee! 🎉\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260920-4-cc269\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260920-4-cc269\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8cbee5b3\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-16T13:06:00\", \"text\": \"LGTM, approved! 🚢\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260920-5-754f6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260920-5-754f6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_724e1180\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-16T13:08:00\", \"text\": \"Same here, approved! Great work, @eid_446bc3ee! 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260920-6-9773b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260920-6-9773b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_446bc3ee\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-16T13:13:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, @Fiona and Julia! Appreciate the quick review and feedback. I'll go ahead and merge it. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260920-7-714a8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260920-7-714a8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7a6e7f9\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-30T17:47:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, I noticed that PR# 23 is approved but not merged yet. Given the change in product direction, should we consider not merging it?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260930-0-5649a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260930-0-5649a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8cbee5b3\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-30T17:52:00\", \"text\": \"Good point. Can someone clarify what the new product direction is and why this PR might be unnecessary now?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260930-1-a8e26\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260930-1-a8e26\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_97d7392d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-30T17:55:00\", \"text\": \"From what I understand, we're moving away from GraphQL for now and focusing on REST APIs due to some integration requirements.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260930-2-4ec3d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260930-2-4ec3d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_724e1180\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-30T18:00:00\", \"text\": \"That makes sense. If we're not using GraphQL, the resolvers in this PR won't be needed.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260930-3-45a3a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260930-3-45a3a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_3f3ea10f\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-30T18:05:00\", \"text\": \"Just to confirm, has this PR been merged yet? If not, we should probably hold off on merging it.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260930-4-8f344\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260930-4-8f344\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_446bc3ee\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-30T18:06:00\", \"text\": \"Hey everyone, the PR hasn't been merged yet. I can hold off on merging it if that's the consensus.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260930-5-72c36\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260930-5-72c36\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_9c876927\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-30T18:10:00\", \"text\": \"I agree with not merging it. It seems like the logical step given the new direction.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260930-6-52e27\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260930-6-52e27\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f6c32cc2\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-30T18:15:00\", \"text\": \"Same here. Let's avoid unnecessary work by not merging it.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260930-7-6cbec\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260930-7-6cbec\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_839e5084\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-30T18:20:00\", \"text\": \"Sounds like we have a consensus. @eid_446bc3ee, could you please ensure the PR is not merged?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260930-8-6a3d6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260930-8-6a3d6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_446bc3ee\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-30T18:24:00\", \"text\": \"Sure, I'll make sure it stays unmerged. Thanks for the input, everyone!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260930-9-5a51d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260930-9-5a51d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_446bc3ee\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-25T08:04:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, please check my PR for defining the GraphQL schema for data points and visualizations: https://github.com/salesforce/CollaborateForce/pull/16. It includes types, queries, and mutations for accessing and managing these elements. Let me know your thoughts! 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260825-0-5f805\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260825-0-5f805\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_01e37306\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-25T08:05:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_446bc3ee Thanks for sharing! I'll take a look at it now. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260825-1-c83fc\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260825-1-c83fc\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c42e5095\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-25T08:10:00\", \"text\": \"Hey @eid_446bc3ee, I'll review it too. Excited to see how you've structured the schema! 🔍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260825-2-cafca\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260825-2-cafca\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_01e37306\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-25T08:14:00\", \"text\": \"Alright, I've gone through the PR. The types for data points and visualizations look solid. The queries are well-defined and cover all necessary data retrieval scenarios. Great job on that! 👏\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260825-3-305e3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260825-3-305e3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c42e5095\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-25T08:18:00\", \"text\": \"Just finished my review. The mutations for updating and managing data points and visualizations are comprehensive and align perfectly with our requirements. Nice work, @eid_446bc3ee! 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260825-4-d9617\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260825-4-d9617\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_01e37306\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-25T08:20:00\", \"text\": \"LGTM, approved! Everything meets the acceptance criteria. Thanks for the detailed work, @eid_446bc3ee! 🎉\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260825-5-a42f7\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260825-5-a42f7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c42e5095\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-25T08:23:00\", \"text\": \"Same here, approved! The schema is well-structured and ready to go. Thanks for the effort, @eid_446bc3ee! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260825-6-f80b6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260825-6-f80b6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_446bc3ee\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-25T08:25:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, @Fiona Davis and @Julia Davis! Appreciate the quick reviews and feedback. Glad everything looks good! 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260825-7-093ac\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260825-7-093ac\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_01e37306\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-26T15:47:00\", \"text\": \"@here try out our product with this live demo https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/CollaborateForce/demo_4\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260826-0-81c13\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260826-0-81c13\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_9c876927\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-06T00:27:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, I noticed that PR# 15 is approved but not merged yet. I heard there's been a change in product direction. Can someone clarify if this PR is still needed?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-0-eeaa1\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-0-eeaa1\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8cbee5b3\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-06T00:28:00\", \"text\": \"Hey @eid_9c876927, yes, the product direction has shifted. We're no longer focusing on capturing user corrections for AI suggestions. This PR might not align with our current goals.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-1-a7694\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-1-a7694\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_3f3ea10f\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-06T00:30:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, @eid_8cbee5b3. @eid_a7dd9c52, could you provide more details on what this PR entails? Just want to ensure we're not missing any critical functionality.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-2-7c130\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-2-7c130\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a7dd9c52\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-06T00:35:00\", \"text\": \"Sure, @eid_3f3ea10f. This PR was designed to log user corrections to AI suggestions, which would then be used to improve the AI's future outputs. It was part of our previous strategy to enhance AI accuracy.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-3-c0139\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-3-c0139\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_839e5084\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-06T00:39:00\", \"text\": \"Given the new direction, do we have any alternative plans for improving AI suggestions, or is this on hold for now?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-4-9ee07\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-4-9ee07\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_724e1180\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-06T00:41:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_839e5084, for now, we're pausing this approach. The focus is shifting towards other priorities, so this specific functionality isn't needed at the moment.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-5-6a439\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-5-6a439\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_73a50f06\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-06T00:45:00\", \"text\": \"If the PR isn't aligned with our current goals, should we just not merge it, or is there a reason to revert it if it was already merged?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-6-68f67\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-6-68f67\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bc469a8f\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-06T00:50:00\", \"text\": \"Since it hasn't been merged yet, I think we should just not merge it. No need to revert anything.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-7-359d2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-7-359d2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_97d7392d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-06T00:52:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed. @eid_a7dd9c52, could you hold off on merging PR# 15? We might revisit this in the future, but it's not needed right now.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-8-a5d51\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-8-a5d51\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a7dd9c52\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-06T00:55:00\", \"text\": \"Got it, @eid_97d7392d. I won't merge the PR. I'll keep it on hold in case we decide to revisit this functionality later. Thanks for the heads-up, everyone!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-9-6db2b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-9-6db2b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c42e5095\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-22T18:43:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, please check my PR for adding documen