 Julia, could you give us a quick update?\\nJulia Taylor: Sure, Ian. As of now, we don't have any completed PRs to discuss. So, let's move on to the pending tasks and their corresponding PRs.\\nJulia Davis: Sounds good. Let's start with the database optimization task. Alice, you submitted a PR for the database caching. Can you give us a brief on the current status?\\nAlice Brown: Yes, I submitted the PR, but it needs some additional revisions. I realized there are some edge cases we need to handle better.\\nEmma Brown: Thanks, Alice. Bob, you'll be working on a new PR for this task, right?\\nBob Martinez: Yes, I confirm. I'll take care of this implementation and submit a new PR.\\nIan Martinez: Great. Moving on to the predictive analytics task. Charlie, you’re up next. Can you update us on the automated model retraining pipeline?\\nCharlie Davis: Sure, Ian. Julia submitted a PR, but it needs some revisions. I'll be working on a new PR to address those issues.\\nEmma Brown: Thanks, Charlie. Just to confirm, you'll handle the new PR for the predictive analytics task?\\nCharlie Davis: Got it, I’ll handle this.\\nIan Martinez: Perfect. Now, let's discuss the UI/UX enhancements. Julia, you submitted a PR for the user feedback mechanism. Can you tell us where we stand?\\nCharlie Taylor: Yes, I submitted it, but it needs some additional revisions. Emma, you'll be working on a new PR for this, right?\\nJulia Taylor: Yes, I confirm. I’ll take care of this implementation and submit a new PR.\\nEmma Brown: Great teamwork, everyone. Let's make sure we address all the feedback and get these PRs ready for the next sprint. Any questions or concerns before we wrap up?\\nGeorge Jones: No questions from me. Everything seems clear.\\nDavid Taylor: Same here. Looking forward to seeing these improvements in action.\\nIan Smith: Alright, thanks everyone. Let's keep up the good work and push these tasks forward. Meeting adjourned.\", \"date\": \"2026-12-02T12:51:00\", \"document_type\": \"product-planning\", \"participants\": [\"eid_82e9fcef\", \"eid_fa16fefb\", \"eid_36319f22\", \"eid_3f2087c9\", \"eid_792330e0\", \"eid_5782059f\", \"eid_01942cf0\", \"eid_92c62291\", \"eid_b4d260c1\", \"eid_0f6b0aea\", \"eid_ecaa9084\", \"eid_8d6fe78d\", \"eid_14a5889d\", \"eid_2542cff3\", \"eid_88c661bc\"], \"id\": \"product_dev_ContextForce_8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa16fefb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-25T20:29:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ContextForce that need our immediate attention. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270225-0-902cf\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270225-0-902cf\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa16fefb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-25T20:34:00\", \"text\": \"First up, we have a 'Rate Limiting Misconfiguration' issue. Third-party applications are experiencing unexpected rate limiting, which is disrupting their access to contextual insights. This is affecting the API Authentication Module and impacting Customer ID: CUST-0025. @eid_ecaa9084, this one's for you. Can you take a look? 🙏\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270225-1-bafcb\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270225-1-bafcb\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ecaa9084\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-25T20:39:00\", \"text\": \"Got it, I'll dive into the API Authentication Module and see what's causing the rate limiting issue. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270225-2-0aaf9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270225-2-0aaf9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa16fefb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-25T20:42:00\", \"text\": \"Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Weak Encryption Algorithm Usage' issue. The data transmitted between the client and server is using an outdated encryption algorithm, which poses a risk of interception. This affects the Data Transmission & Security Layer and impacts Customer ID: CUST-0058. @eid_14a5889d, can you handle this one? 🔐\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270225-3-7e950\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270225-3-7e950\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_14a5889d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-25T20:44:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, I'll start working on updating the encryption algorithm to ensure data security. Thanks for assigning this to me! 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270225-4-ac825\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270225-4-ac825\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa16fefb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-25T20:45:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's a 'Man-in-the-Middle Attack Susceptibility' issue. Data packets are vulnerable during transmission due to a lack of secure channel establishment. This also affects the Data Transmission & Security Layer and impacts Customer ID: CUST-0006. @eid_2542cff3, can you take this on? 🔒\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270225-5-4ec21\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270225-5-4ec21\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2542cff3\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-25T20:50:00\", \"text\": \"On it! I'll work on establishing a secure channel to prevent any interception. Thanks for the update! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270225-6-3ac52\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270225-6-3ac52\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa16fefb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-25T20:53:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone! Let's keep the communication open and update each other on progress. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or have questions. Let's get these issues resolved for our customers! 💪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270225-7-12634\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270225-7-12634\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_14a5889d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-25T20:55:00\", \"text\": \"Will do! Let's make sure our customers are happy. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270225-8-f8c10\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270225-8-f8c10\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ecaa9084\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-25T20:56:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, let's keep the momentum going! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270225-9-390d7\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270225-9-390d7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2542cff3\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-25T20:58:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, team effort! 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270225-10-574cd\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270225-10-574cd\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8d6fe78d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-09T02:17:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about 'Temporal Data Misinterpretation' where reports were showing misleading trends due to incorrect time-series data analysis.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270308-0-790f8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270308-0-790f8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8d6fe78d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-09T02:19:00\", \"text\": \"After a thorough review, I've determined that this does not require a fix. The behavior is actually expected due to a misconfiguration in the user settings.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270308-1-cc048\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270308-1-cc048\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8d6fe78d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-09T02:24:00\", \"text\": \"The timestamps were being misinterpreted because the time zone settings were not correctly configured in the user profile. This led to the incorrect trend calculations.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270308-2-17a0d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270308-2-17a0d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa16fefb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-09T02:27:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, George. So, it's a user-side issue rather than a bug in our module?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270308-3-3796a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270308-3-3796a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8d6fe78d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-09T02:32:00\", \"text\": \"Exactly, @eid_fa16fefb. I verified the module's functionality with the correct settings, and it works as intended.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270308-4-78452\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270308-4-78452\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_88c661bc\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-09T02:34:00\", \"text\": \"Good to know, George. Should we inform the users about the correct configuration to avoid future confusion?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270308-5-e5f3a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270308-5-e5f3a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8d6fe78d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-09T02:37:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, Emma. I'll draft a quick guide on setting up the time zone correctly and share it with the support team to pass on to the users.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270308-6-316b8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270308-6-316b8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa16fefb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-09T02:40:00\", \"text\": \"Sounds like a plan. Thanks for clarifying this, George!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270308-7-fca79\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270308-7-fca79\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8d6fe78d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-09T02:43:00\", \"text\": \"No problem, happy to help! I'll keep you all posted once the guide is ready.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270308-8-776ba\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270308-8-776ba\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa16fefb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-10T12:59:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the 'Temporal Data Misinterpretation' bug has been reopened by CUST-0043. 🚨\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270310-0-0492f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270310-0-0492f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8d6fe78d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-10T13:04:00\", \"text\": \"Oh, that's unexpected! 😮 I thought we concluded it was due to a user settings misconfiguration. @eid_fa16fefb, do we have more details on why it was reopened?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270310-1-4984a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270310-1-4984a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa16fefb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-10T13:09:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, @George. The customer insists the issue persists even after adjusting the settings as we recommended. They provided some new data samples that might help us see what's going wrong. 📊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270310-2-2d9cd\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270310-2-2d9cd\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_88c661bc\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-10T13:10:00\", \"text\": \"Hmm, interesting. Maybe there's an edge case we missed? 🤔\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270310-3-5f015\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270310-3-5f015\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8d6fe78d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-10T13:15:00\", \"text\": \"Could be, Emma. I'll take another look at it with the new data. @eid_fa16fefb, can you assign it back to me? I'll prioritize it and see if there's something we overlooked.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270310-4-93bbe\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270310-4-93bbe\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa16fefb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-10T13:20:00\", \"text\": \"Sure thing, George. Reassigning it to you now. Let us know if you need any help or additional info. 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270310-5-119c6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270310-5-119c6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8d6fe78d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-10T13:23:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Julia. I'll keep you all posted on what I find. Let's get this sorted for the customer! 💪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270310-6-769c0\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270310-6-769c0\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_88c661bc\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-10T13:28:00\", \"text\": \"Sounds good, George! Let me know if you need another pair of eyes on the data. 👀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270310-7-86ad9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270310-7-86ad9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa16fefb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-10T19:49:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ContextForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270310-0-88dff\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270310-0-88dff\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa16fefb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-10T19:51:00\", \"text\": \"First up, we have a 'Slow Response Time in Dashboard Loading'. The dashboard is taking too long to load, especially with large datasets. This affects the Database Querying & Dashboard UI and is impacting Customer CUST-0043. @eid_8d6fe78d, can you take this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270310-1-52b76\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270310-1-52b76\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8d6fe78d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-10T19:53:00\", \"text\": \"Got it! I'll look into the database queries and see what's causing the delay. Thanks for the heads-up! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270310-2-3e2e3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270310-2-3e2e3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa16fefb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-10T19:54:00\", \"text\": \"Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Incorrect User Preference Insights'. The AI is generating insights that don't match user preferences, affecting the AI Analysis Engine. This is impacting Customer CUST-0095. @eid_ecaa9084, can you handle this?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270310-3-9df7c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270310-3-9df7c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ecaa9084\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-10T19:55:00\", \"text\": \"Sure thing! I'll dive into the AI models and see why the preferences aren't aligning. Let's get this sorted! 🤖\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270310-4-b7906\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270310-4-b7906\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa16fefb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-10T20:00:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's 'Preference Misalignment in Contextual Insights'. Reports aren't aligning with user preferences, impacting Report Generation & Data Processing. Customer CUST-0101 is affected. @eid_14a5889d, can you take care of this?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270310-5-19d4b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270310-5-19d4b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_14a5889d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-10T20:05:00\", \"text\": \"On it! I'll check the report generation process and data handling to fix the misalignment. Let's make sure our insights are spot on! 📊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270310-6-c0123\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270310-6-c0123\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa16fefb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-10T20:08:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone! Let's keep the communication open. If you need any help or have questions, just shout! 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270310-7-dc359\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270310-7-dc359\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8d6fe78d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-10T20:11:00\", \"text\": \"Will do! Thanks for coordinating, @eid_fa16fefb! 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270310-8-a40fd\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270310-8-a40fd\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ecaa9084\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-10T20:15:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, team! Let's get these issues resolved quickly. 💪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270310-9-b77b2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270310-9-b77b2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_14a5889d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-10T20:19:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, all! Looking forward to getting these sorted. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270310-10-b8fe5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270310-10-b8fe5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b4d260c1\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-23T16:07:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the Anomaly Detection Failure. The reports were said to fail in highlighting significant anomalies, which could lead to overlooked critical insights.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270123-0-ef794\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270123-0-ef794\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b4d260c1\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-23T16:09:00\", \"text\": \"After a thorough review, I've determined that this is not a bug and does not require a fix.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270123-1-8bb9c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270123-1-8bb9c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-23T16:11:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_b4d260c1 Could you elaborate on why it's not considered a bug?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270123-2-4fa4c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270123-2-4fa4c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b4d260c1\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-23T16:16:00\", \"text\": \"Certainly, Ian. The anomaly detection algorithm is functioning as designed. The issue stems from a misconfiguration in the threshold settings, which were set too high, causing the system to overlook certain deviations.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270123-3-99c3c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270123-3-99c3c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5782059f\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-23T16:17:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the clarification, George Brown. So, it's more of a configuration issue rather than a malfunction?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270123-4-ba3dd\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270123-4-ba3dd\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b4d260c1\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-23T16:19:00\", \"text\": \"Exactly, George Jones. I reviewed the configuration logs and confirmed that the threshold values were not aligned with the expected parameters for detecting smaller anomalies.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270123-5-46678\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270123-5-46678\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-23T16:24:00\", \"text\": \"Got it. So, should we adjust the configuration settings to prevent this from happening again?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270123-6-6a656\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270123-6-6a656\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b4d260c1\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-23T16:28:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, Ian. I've already updated the documentation to include recommended threshold settings. I'll also coordinate with the team responsible for monitoring to ensure they adjust their configurations accordingly.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270123-7-6ae38\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270123-7-6ae38\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5782059f\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-23T16:31:00\", \"text\": \"Great work, George Brown. Thanks for the update and for clarifying the situation.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270123-8-8be82\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270123-8-8be82\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b4d260c1\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-23T16:32:00\", \"text\": \"No problem, happy to help. Let me know if there's anything else you need.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270123-9-77687\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270123-9-77687\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-25T05:57:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the 'Anomaly Detection Failure' bug has been reopened by CUST-0031. They reported that the reports are still missing some critical anomalies. 😕\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270124-0-0abec\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270124-0-0abec\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b4d260c1\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-25T05:58:00\", \"text\": \"Hey @eid_82e9fcef, that's surprising. I thought we had resolved this by adjusting the threshold settings. 🤔\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270124-1-0d6c9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270124-1-0d6c9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5782059f\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-25T06:03:00\", \"text\": \"Yeah, I remember @George Brown mentioned it was a configuration issue. Maybe there's something else at play here?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270124-2-646e3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270124-2-646e3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-25T06:05:00\", \"text\": \"Exactly, George Jones. The customer insists that the anomalies are still not being detected as expected. @eid_b4d260c1, could you take another look at it? Maybe there's an underlying issue we missed.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270124-3-09bc4\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270124-3-09bc4\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b4d260c1\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-25T06:06:00\", \"text\": \"Sure thing, Ian. I'll dive back into the anomaly detection logic and see if there's anything else affecting the results. Let's get this sorted for CUST-0031. 🔍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270124-4-e4dcc\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270124-4-e4dcc\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5782059f\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-25T06:11:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, George Brown! Let us know if you need any help or if there's anything we can do to assist. 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270124-5-6016b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270124-5-6016b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b4d260c1\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-25T06:14:00\", \"text\": \"Will do, George Jones. I'll keep you all posted on what I find. Let's aim to resolve this quickly. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270124-6-e81f9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270124-6-e81f9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5782059f\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-25T21:55:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug about incorrect context interpretation titled 'Contextual Misinterpretation' has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ContextForce/pull/36.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270125-0-62476\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270125-0-62476\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-25T21:56:00\", \"text\": \"Great news, @eid_5782059f! Can you explain what was causing the issue?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270125-1-72862\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270125-1-72862\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5782059f\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-25T21:59:00\", \"text\": \"Sure, Ian. The root cause was a flaw in the context recognition algorithm. It was misinterpreting the situational context of user actions, which led to irrelevant or misleading insights.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270125-2-a9bce\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270125-2-a9bce\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b4d260c1\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-25T22:02:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, George Jones. How did you manage to fix it?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270125-3-89543\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270125-3-89543\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5782059f\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-25T22:05:00\", \"text\": \"To resolve the issue, I updated the algorithm to include a more robust context validation step. This ensures that the context is accurately identified before generating insights. Additionally, I added a fallback mechanism to handle ambiguous contexts more gracefully.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270125-4-acd92\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270125-4-acd92\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-25T22:07:00\", \"text\": \"Sounds like a solid fix, George. Thanks for addressing this so quickly!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270125-5-00cb3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270125-5-00cb3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b4d260c1\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-25T22:08:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, @eid_5782059f. Thanks for the hard work. I'll test it out and let you know if I spot anything else.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270125-6-fb6ac\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270125-6-fb6ac\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5782059f\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-25T22:09:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, George Brown and Ian. Let me know if you encounter any further issues. I'm here to help!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270125-7-9ed40\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270125-7-9ed40\"}\n{\"title\": \"Integrate Feedback Loop into Analytics Models\", \"summary\": \"Implement a feedback loop mechanism that collects user interactions and feeds them back into the analytics models to refine predictions. This will allow the models to learn from user behavior and improve over time.\", \"link\": \"https://github.com/salesforce/extAIX/pull/5\", \"mergeable\": \"True\", \"merged\": \"True\", \"number\": \"5\", \"state\": \"closed\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_01942cf0\"}, \"created_at\": \"2026-10-20T03:06:00\", \"reviews\": [{\"state\": \"APPROVED\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_b4d260c1\"}, \"comment\": \"LGTM, approved! Great work, @eid_01942cf0. This will be a fantastic addition to our analytics capabilities. 🚀\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-10-20T14:27:00\"}, {\"state\": \"COMMENTED\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_5782059f\"}, \"comment\": \"I agree with George Brown. The system's prediction accuracy seems to improve over time with the feedback loop. Everything looks solid to me. LGTM, approved! ✅\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-10-20T14:23:00\"}, {\"state\": \"PENDING\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_ecaa9084\"}, \"comment\": \"Same here! The implementation is clean, and the criteria are all met. The models are definitely learning from user interactions. Well done, @eid_01942cf0! LGTM, approved! 🎉\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-10-20T14:26:00\"}], \"id\": \"github_com_salesforce_extAIX_pull_5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ecaa9084\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-28T12:09:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug about incorrect user preference insights has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ContextForce/pull/45.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270328-0-e10b0\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270328-0-e10b0\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ecaa9084\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-28T12:12:00\", \"text\": \"The root cause was an outdated or incomplete user behavior dataset being used for analysis. This led to the AI generating insights that didn't align with the user's actual preferences.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270328-1-5af5d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270328-1-5af5d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ecaa9084\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-28T12:14:00\", \"text\": \"To fix this, we updated the data pipeline to ensure it pulls the latest user behavior data. Additionally, we implemented a validation step to check data completeness before analysis.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270328-2-ace2a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270328-2-ace2a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8d6fe78d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-28T12:19:00\", \"text\": \"Great work, @eid_ecaa9084! Ensuring the data is up-to-date and complete should definitely improve the accuracy of the insights.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270328-3-985da\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270328-3-985da\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_14a5889d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-28T12:20:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Julia! This should help reduce the irrelevant recommendations we've been seeing. I'll monitor the insights over the next few days to confirm improvements.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270328-4-393cd\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270328-4-393cd\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa16fefb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-28T12:22:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone! Let me know if you notice any other issues. I'll be around to help.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270328-5-0707b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270328-5-0707b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_14a5889d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-29T21:40:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug about incorrect preference alignment in Contextual Insights has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ContextForce/pull/46.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270329-0-6a064\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270329-0-6a064\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8d6fe78d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-29T21:42:00\", \"text\": \"Great news, Charlie! Can you explain what caused the issue?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270329-1-aee5b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270329-1-aee5b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_14a5889d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-29T21:44:00\", \"text\": \"Sure, George. The root cause was a bug in the preference mapping algorithm. It was incorrectly associating user preferences with data points, which led to irrelevant or misleading insights being generated.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270329-2-15157\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270329-2-15157\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa16fefb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-29T21:49:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, Charlie. How did you manage to fix it?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270329-3-d798b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270329-3-d798b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_14a5889d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-29T21:54:00\", \"text\": \"I updated the mapping logic to ensure that user preferences are correctly matched with the relevant data points. This involved refining the algorithm to better interpret the preference data and adding additional checks to prevent mismatches.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270329-4-22eae\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270329-4-22eae\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ecaa9084\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-29T21:59:00\", \"text\": \"Nice work, Charlie! This should improve the accuracy of our insights significantly.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270329-5-83281\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270329-5-83281\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_14a5889d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-29T22:01:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Julia! Please let me know if you encounter any more issues or if further adjustments are needed.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270329-6-340bc\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270329-6-340bc\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8d6fe78d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-29T22:03:00\", \"text\": \"Will do, Charlie. Thanks for the quick turnaround on this!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270329-7-6558c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270329-7-6558c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8d6fe78d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-31T06:02:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the slow response time in dashboard loading, especially when displaying contextual insights with large datasets.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270331-0-edc70\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270331-0-edc70\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8d6fe78d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-31T06:07:00\", \"text\": \"After reviewing the details, I've concluded that this is not a bug that requires fixing.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270331-1-7f938\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270331-1-7f938\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8d6fe78d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-31T06:09:00\", \"text\": \"The slow loading is actually due to the expected behavior when handling very large datasets. Our current system design prioritizes accuracy and completeness of insights over speed in such cases.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270331-2-1d707\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270331-2-1d707\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8d6fe78d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-31T06:14:00\", \"text\": \"I ran several tests and confirmed that the system is performing within the expected parameters. The querying and data retrieval processes are optimized for typical use cases, but naturally take longer with extensive data.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270331-3-9a076\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270331-3-9a076\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_14a5889d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-31T06:17:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, George. So, it's more about understanding the system's limitations with large datasets?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270331-4-47b3e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270331-4-47b3e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8d6fe78d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-31T06:21:00\", \"text\": \"Exactly, @eid_14a5889d. It's important for users to be aware that performance can vary with dataset size. We might consider adding a note in the documentation to clarify this.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270331-5-c5958\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270331-5-c5958\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa16fefb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-31T06:22:00\", \"text\": \"Good call, George. A documentation update sounds like a great idea to manage user expectations.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270331-6-2f5c0\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270331-6-2f5c0\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ecaa9084\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-31T06:25:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed. Thanks for looking into this, George. Let me know if you need help with the documentation update.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270331-7-c4df6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270331-7-c4df6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliataylor-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3aa08e\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8d6fe78d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-31T06:26:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Julia. I'll draft something and share it with you for review. Appreciate the support!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270331-8-51fee\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270331-8-51fee\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b4d260c1\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-22T14:00:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug titled 'Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) in Data Insights' has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ContextForce/pull/35.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270122-0-c2067\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270122-0-c2067\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5782059f\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-22T14:05:00\", \"text\": \"Great news, @eid_b4d260c1! Can you explain what caused the issue?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270122-1-58764\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270122-1-58764\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b4d260c1\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-22T14:06:00\", \"text\": \"Sure, George. The root cause was a lack of proper input validation and sanitization in the data processing layer. This oversight allowed malicious scripts to be executed in the user's browser.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270122-2-93a88\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270122-2-93a88\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-22T14:08:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, George Brown. How did you manage to fix it?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270122-3-b9522\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270122-3-b9522\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b4d260c1\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-22T14:12:00\", \"text\": \"To resolve the issue, I implemented a strict input validation and sanitization process. This ensures that any data processed by the system is cleaned and validated before being rendered in the user's browser. Additionally, I added unit tests to cover these scenarios to prevent future occurrences.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270122-4-634b9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270122-4-634b9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5782059f\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-22T14:16:00\", \"text\": \"Sounds like a solid fix. Thanks for handling this so quickly, George Brown!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270122-5-3ec95\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270122-5-3ec95\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-22T14:21:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, thanks for the quick turnaround, @eid_b4d260c1. I'll review the PR shortly.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270122-6-a7fa5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270122-6-a7fa5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b4d260c1\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-22T14:24:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Ian. Let me know if you have any questions during the review.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270122-7-cf445\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270122-7-cf445\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-05T11:53:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ContextForce that we need to address ASAP. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270305-0-2dd51\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270305-0-2dd51\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-05T11:56:00\", \"text\": \"First up, we have an issue titled 'Incorrect User Behavior Analysis'. The reports generated are showing inaccurate insights due to incorrect analysis of user behavior patterns. This affects the Report Generation & Data Processing area and impacts Customer ID: CUST-0043. @eid_92c62291, this one's for you.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270305-1-d039e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270305-1-d039e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_92c62291\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-05T11:59:00\", \"text\": \"Got it! I'll dive into the Report Generation & Data Processing to see what's causing the inaccuracies. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270305-2-0f743\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270305-2-0f743\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-05T12:04:00\", \"text\": \"Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Signature Verification Error'. Third-party applications are failing to authenticate due to signature verification errors, which is disrupting API Authentication Module. This is impacting Customer ID: CUST-0017. @eid_01942cf0, can you take this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270305-3-33461\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270305-3-33461\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_01942cf0\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-05T12:09:00\", \"text\": \"Sure thing! I'll check the API Authentication Module and see why the signature verification is failing. Let's get those third-party apps back on track! 🔍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270305-4-40139\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270305-4-40139\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-05T12:10:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's an 'API Authentication Failure'. Similar to the previous issue, third-party applications are unable to authenticate with the ContextForce API, affecting Customer ID: CUST-0009. @eid_5782059f, this one's yours.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270305-5-f1323\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270305-5-f1323\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5782059f\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-05T12:13:00\", \"text\": \"On it! I'll investigate the API Authentication Module to resolve the authentication failure. Let's make sure our integrations are seamless. 💪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270305-6-fefba\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270305-6-fefba\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-05T12:18:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone! Let's keep communication open and update each other on progress. Feel free to ask questions or share insights as you work through these. 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270305-7-ad349\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270305-7-ad349\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_01942cf0\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-05T12:22:00\", \"text\": \"Will do! If anyone needs help or has insights on the API issues, let's collaborate. 🤝\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270305-8-65383\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270305-8-65383\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_92c62291\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-05T12:24:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, let's keep the momentum going. Thanks for coordinating, @eid_82e9fcef! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270305-9-b7f5e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270305-9-b7f5e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5782059f\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-03-05T12:26:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed! Let's get these resolved quickly for our customers. Thanks, team! 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270305-10-502a3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270305-10-502a3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-06T21:35:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ContextForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270206-0-7d8d7\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270206-0-7d8d7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-06T21:37:00\", \"text\": \"First up, we have a 'Data Synchronization Lag' issue. The AI Analysis Engine is processing outdated user behavior data due to delays in data synchronization. This is impacting CUST-0055, as users are receiving insights that aren't personalized, which could lead to frustration. @eid_0f6b0aea, this one's for you.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270206-1-495e5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270206-1-495e5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_0f6b0aea\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-06T21:40:00\", \"text\": \"Got it! I'll start looking into the data synchronization lag issue right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270206-2-480e1\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270206-2-480e1\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-06T21:43:00\", \"text\": \"Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Preference Model Drift' issue. The AI model has drifted from its original training parameters, causing misinterpretation of user preferences. This is affecting CUST-0016. @eid_92c62291, can you take this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270206-3-5faf2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270206-3-5faf2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_92c62291\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-06T21:47:00\", \"text\": \"Sure thing! I'll dive into the model drift issue and see what's causing the misinterpretation. Let's get those insights back on track! 🔍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270206-4-469fd\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270206-4-469fd\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-06T21:49:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's a 'Memory Leak in Data Processing Module'. It's causing the system to slow down, affecting the speed of insights generation and display. This is impacting CUST-0074. @eid_01942cf0, can you handle this?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270206-5-c8368\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270206-5-c8368\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_01942cf0\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-06T21:54:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, I'll investigate the memory leak in the data processing module. We need to ensure users can access insights quickly. 🛠️\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270206-6-de0b8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270206-6-de0b8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-06T21:58:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone! Let's keep communication open as you work through these issues. Feel free to reach out if you need any additional context or support. 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270206-7-68869\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270206-7-68869\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_0f6b0aea\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-06T22:00:00\", \"text\": \"Will do! I'll update you all once I have more info on the synchronization issue. 📊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270206-8-4636f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270206-8-4636f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_92c62291\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-06T22:05:00\", \"text\": \"Same here, I'll keep you posted on the model drift findings. 🧠\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270206-9-5f66a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270206-9-5f66a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_01942cf0\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-06T22:10:00\", \"text\": \"I'll share my progress on the memory leak soon. Let's get these resolved! 💪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270206-10-e406a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270206-10-e406a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5782059f\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-12T01:13:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug titled 'Behavioral Data Overfitting' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ContextForce/pull/34.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270111-0-9bc0c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270111-0-9bc0c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_92c62291\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-12T01:18:00\", \"text\": \"Great news, George! Can you remind us what the root cause was?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270111-1-1220f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270111-1-1220f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5782059f\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-12T01:23:00\", \"text\": \"Sure, @eid_92c62291. The root cause was that our training dataset was too narrow and lacked diversity. This caused the AI model to overfit to a limited set of user behaviors, which meant it couldn't generalize insights across a broader range of actions.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270111-2-d6b85\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270111-2-d6b85\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-12T01:25:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, George. How did you manage to fix it?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270111-3-3506b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270111-3-3506b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5782059f\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-12T01:29:00\", \"text\": \"To resolve the issue, I expanded the training dataset by incorporating a more diverse set of user behavior data. Additionally, I implemented data augmentation techniques to artificially increase the diversity of the training data. This helped the model to better generalize insights across different user actions.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270111-4-5722f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270111-4-5722f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_92c62291\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-12T01:32:00\", \"text\": \"That sounds like a solid approach. Thanks for handling this so efficiently, George!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270111-5-a3c7b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270111-5-a3c7b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-12T01:35:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, nice work! This should improve the model's performance significantly.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270111-6-3bb0b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270111-6-3bb0b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5782059f\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-12T01:36:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Alice and Ian! Let me know if you notice any further issues or have additional feedback.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270111-7-9b8c0\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270111-7-9b8c0\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-14T09:57:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ContextForce that we need to address ASAP. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270114-0-70100\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270114-0-70100\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-14T10:00:00\", \"text\": \"First up, we have a 'Contextual Misinterpretation' issue. The AI is misinterpreting user actions, leading to irrelevant insights. This affects the AI Analysis Engine and is impactin