e integration with HubSpot is seamless.\\nHannah Taylor: Thanks, Fiona. It's crucial we get this integration right. If there are no further questions, let's wrap up.\\nIan Garcia: No questions from me. Thanks, everyone.\\nDavid Smith: All clear here. Looking forward to the next sprint.\\nCharlie Taylor: Same here. Let's keep up the good work.\", \"date\": \"2026-07-14T14:02:00\", \"document_type\": \"product-planning\", \"participants\": [\"eid_f98d7490\", \"eid_99835861\", \"eid_46e00bc4\", \"eid_8efef28a\", \"eid_b48f959b\", \"eid_207da0e7\", \"eid_a43a4389\", \"eid_a23a73c4\", \"eid_cac9a0ac\", \"eid_90359c89\", \"eid_c39dc658\", \"eid_9f4e2c6f\", \"eid_3f4b2681\", \"eid_07cc9100\", \"eid_652e8cd0\"], \"id\": \"product_dev_LeadForce_7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iangarcia-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-a-aix-2eecee\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_207da0e7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-30T04:56:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, please check my PR for the Salesforce API Integration: https://github.com/salesforce/AIX/pull/8. This includes setting up authentication, defining endpoints, and handling data requests and responses. Let me know your thoughts! 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260602-0-748c8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260602-0-748c8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iangarcia-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-a-aix-2eecee\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_90359c89\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-30T04:57:00\", \"text\": \"Hey @eid_207da0e7, thanks for sharing! I'll start reviewing it now. 🔍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260602-1-45969\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260602-1-45969\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iangarcia-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-a-aix-2eecee\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a43a4389\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-30T04:58:00\", \"text\": \"On it, @eid_207da0e7! Looking forward to seeing how you've tackled the Salesforce integration. 🚀\"