ight?\\nHannah Taylor: Yes, that's correct. I'll ensure the consumer updates lead scores in real-time based on the events.\\nBob Garcia: Great, Hannah. This will be a key feature for our product.\\nHannah Taylor: Moving on to the predictive analytics AI model retraining. Ian Brown, your PR needs some revisions. Fiona, can you take over and submit a new PR?\\nFiona Miller: I confirm, I'll take care of this implementation. I'll focus on enhancing the model evaluation metrics.\\nIan Brown: Thanks, Fiona. I'll be available if you need any insights from the previous work.\\nJulia Jones: Lastly, we have the CRM platform integration task. Bob Brown, you're assigned to develop the data mapping strategy for HubSpot. Can you confirm?\\nBob Brown: Yes, I confirm. I'll ensure the data fields between AIX and HubSpot are correctly aligned and transformed.\\nBob Garcia: Thanks, Bob. This integration is crucial for expanding our CRM capabilities.\\nHannah Taylor: Alright, team. That wraps up our sprint review. Let's keep the momentum going and reach out if you need any support. Have a productive sprint!\", \"date\": \"2026-07-04T12:26:00\", \"document_type\": \"product-planning\", \"participants\": [\"eid_f98d7490\", \"eid_99835861\", \"eid_46e00bc4\", \"eid_8efef28a\", \"eid_b48f959b\", \"eid_207da0e7\", \"eid_a43a4389\", \"eid_a23a73c4\", \"eid_cac9a0ac\", \"eid_90359c89\", \"eid_c39dc658\", \"eid_9f4e2c6f\", \"eid_3f4b2681\", \"eid_07cc9100\", \"eid_652e8cd0\"], \"id\": \"product_dev_LeadForce_6\"}\n{\"transcript\": \"Attendees\\nIan Garcia, Ian Jones, Julia Jones, Bob Garcia, Hannah Taylor, Ian Garcia, Fiona Miller, Bob Brown, David Smith, Charlie Taylor, Ian Miller, Ian Brown, Hannah Taylor, George Garcia, Bob Smith\\nTranscript\\nIan Garcia: Alright, everyone, let's get started with our sprint review. First, let's go over the completed PRs. Hannah, could you give us a quick update on the Kafka event processing monitoring and logging?\\nHannah Taylor: Sure, Ian. We successfull