ned bug-juliadavis-PitchForce. Also, @eid_2c74343d, @eid_c5bce3e8, @eid_8b67a68f, @eid_7b2a9f4a, @eid_8a2cd06b, @eid_f66c3942, @eid_9e0ce30d joined via invite.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-1-1d9c8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-1-1d9c8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliadavis-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3431e6\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_85a4de81\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T19:02:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with PitchForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-0-8baed\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-0-8baed\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliadavis-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3431e6\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_85a4de81\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T19:07:00\", \"text\": \"First up, we have a concurrency handling flaw. Simultaneous requests for pitch generation are causing race conditions, leading to delays and inconsistent results. This is impacting our backend infrastructure and performance, and it's affecting customer CUST-0067. @eid_f66c3942, can you take this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-1-fd12e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-1-fd12e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliadavis-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3431e6\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f66c3942\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T19:12:00\", \"text\": \"Got it! I'll dive into the backend infrastructure and see what's causing these race conditions. Thanks for the heads-up! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-2-a2178\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-2-a2178\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliadavis-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3431e6\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_85a4de81\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T19:15:00\", \"text\": \"Great, thanks! Next, we have an issue with incorrect sentiment analysis. The module is misinterpreting customer feedback, which is leading to inappropriate tone and content in the generated pitches. This affects our AI model and personalization engine, impacting customer CUST-0050. @eid_8b67a68f, can you handle this?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-3-8b7e6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-3-8b7e6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliadavis-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3431e6\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8b67a68f\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T19:19:00\", \"text\": \"Sure thing! I'll review the sentiment analysis module and make sure it aligns better with customer feedback. Let's get those pitches resonating again! 💪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-4-18404\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-4-18404\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliadavis-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3431e6\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_85a4de81\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T19:20:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's a font scaling issue on high-DPI screens. Text appears too small or too large on mobile, affecting the user interface and mobile compatibility. This is impacting customer CUST-0016. @eid_8b67a68f, can you also take a look at this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-5-94630\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-5-94630\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliadavis-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3431e6\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8b67a68f\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T19:25:00\", \"text\": \"No problem, I'll tackle the font scaling issue as well. Let's make sure our mobile users have a smooth experience! 📱\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-6-3571a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-6-3571a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliadavis-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3431e6\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_85a4de81\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T19:29:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone! Let me know if you need any more details or support. Let's get these issues resolved and keep our customers happy! 🎉\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-7-44c0e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-7-44c0e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliadavis-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3431e6\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f66c3942\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T19:32:00\", \"text\": \"Will do! If I find anything unusual, I'll reach out. 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-8-25009\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-8-25009\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliadavis-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-3431e6\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8b67a68f\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T19:37:00\", \"text\": \"Same here, I'll keep you posted on my progress. Thanks for coordinating, @eid_85a4de81!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-9-b4876\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-9-b4876\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-hannahmiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-42e4a3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-09T03:18:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_50da4819 created this channel on 2027-01-09 03:18:00. This is the very beginning of the bug-hannahmiller-PitchForce channel.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270109-0-1e0d6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270109-0-1e0d6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-hannahmiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-42e4a3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-09T03:18:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_50da4819 joined bug-hannahmiller-PitchForce. Also, @eid_48e149b5, @eid_73ca2844, @eid_932ce89c, @eid_a8a4fdcb, @eid_da6c2317, @eid_17e55125 joined via invite.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270109-1-358f8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270109-1-358f8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-hannahmiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-42e4a3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_50da4819\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-09T07:43:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with PitchForce that we need to address ASAP. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270109-0-16423\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270109-0-16423\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-hannahmiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-42e4a3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_50da4819\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-09T07:44:00\", \"text\": \"First up, we have a 'Data Ingestion Error'. The system isn't processing customer data correctly, which means users are getting pitches that don't resonate with their target audience. This is affecting our AI Model & Personalization Engine. Impacted customer: CUST-0102. @eid_932ce89c, can you take this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270109-1-a0cf7\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270109-1-a0cf7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-hannahmiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-42e4a3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_932ce89c\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-09T07:45:00\", \"text\": \"Got it, I'll look into the Data Ingestion Error right away. Ensuring our AI Model & Personalization Engine is top-notch is crucial. 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270109-2-0a6aa\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270109-2-0a6aa\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-hannahmiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-42e4a3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_50da4819\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-09T07:49:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, @eid_932ce89c! Next, we have an issue with 'Incorrect Personalization in Generated Pitches'. The AI is generating pitches that don't accurately reflect customer profiles, leading to generic content. This is also impacting our AI Model & Personalization Engine. Impacted customer: CUST-0067. @eid_932ce89c, can you handle this one too?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270109-3-0cf22\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270109-3-0cf22\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-hannahmiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-42e4a3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_932ce89c\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-09T07:52:00\", \"text\": \"Sure thing! I'll dive into the personalization issue as well. We need to make sure our pitches are spot-on for each customer. 🔍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270109-4-0209f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270109-4-0209f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-hannahmiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-42e4a3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_50da4819\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-09T07:55:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's an 'Improper OAuth Token Validation' issue. The API isn't validating OAuth tokens properly, which could expose sensitive customer data. This affects our API Security & Access Control. Impacted customer: CUST-0026. @eid_932ce89c, can you take this one as well?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270109-5-09784\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270109-5-09784\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-hannahmiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-42e4a3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_932ce89c\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-09T07:56:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, I'll prioritize the OAuth token validation issue. Security is a top priority for us. 🔐\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270109-6-c64b9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270109-6-c64b9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-hannahmiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-42e4a3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_50da4819\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-09T07:57:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, @eid_932ce89c! Appreciate you taking on these issues. Let's keep our customers happy and secure. If anyone has questions or needs more info, feel free to ask! 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270109-7-402ba\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270109-7-402ba\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-hannahmiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-42e4a3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_932ce89c\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-09T07:58:00\", \"text\": \"Will do! If I need any additional info, I'll reach out. Let's get these sorted out. 💪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270109-8-a4098\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270109-8-a4098\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_0deececb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-07T02:19:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug titled 'Database Query Bottleneck' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/PitchForce/pull/45.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270107-0-81e1c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270107-0-81e1c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_0deececb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-07T02:22:00\", \"text\": \"The root cause was poorly optimized SQL queries that weren't effectively using indexing, which led to slow data retrieval times, especially with large customer profiles.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270107-1-7a99d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270107-1-7a99d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_0deececb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-07T02:24:00\", \"text\": \"To fix this, I restructured the SQL queries to make better use of existing indexes and added a few new indexes where necessary. This has significantly improved the query execution time.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270107-2-ce8e2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270107-2-ce8e2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e6d2ec9d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-07T02:28:00\", \"text\": \"Great work, @eid_0deececb! This should really help with the sales pitch generation delays we've been experiencing.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270107-3-f5997\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270107-3-f5997\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ee9ca887\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-07T02:29:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, George Garcia! I was just about to start on a workaround, but it looks like I won't need to now.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270107-4-f3d78\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270107-4-f3d78\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_81582c30\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-07T02:34:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome! Thanks for the quick turnaround, George. I'll test it out with some large profiles and let you know if I encounter any issues.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270107-5-e1a69\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270107-5-e1a69\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_0deececb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-07T02:39:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone! Let me know if you run into any more issues. Happy to help!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270107-6-e6595\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270107-6-e6595\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ee9ca887\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-09T23:58:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with PitchForce that we need to address ASAP. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270209-0-728bd\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270209-0-728bd\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ee9ca887\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-09T23:59:00\", \"text\": \"First up, we have a UI Rendering Issue on Mobile Devices. The interface isn't rendering correctly, causing elements to overlap or get cut off. This affects the User Interface & Mobile Compatibility, impacting customer CUST-0094. @eid_dd1ff0ca, can you take this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270209-1-beb99\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270209-1-beb99\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_dd1ff0ca\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-10T00:04:00\", \"text\": \"Got it! I'll dive into the UI rendering issue on mobile. Thanks for the heads-up. 📱\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270209-2-d9b61\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270209-2-d9b61\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ee9ca887\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-10T00:08:00\", \"text\": \"Great, thanks! Next, we have a Feature Extraction Failure. The system isn't extracting key features from customer profiles, leading to generic pitches. This affects the AI Model & Personalization Engine, impacting customer CUST-0057. @eid_38700e5f, can you handle this?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270209-3-25f30\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270209-3-25f30\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_38700e5f\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-10T00:13:00\", \"text\": \"Sure thing! I'll look into the feature extraction issue and see what's causing the hiccup. 🤖\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270209-4-9b57c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270209-4-9b57c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ee9ca887\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-10T00:14:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's a Model Drift issue due to Unsupervised Learning. The AI model is becoming less effective as it adapts to outdated patterns. This also affects the AI Model & Personalization Engine, impacting customer CUST-0007. @eid_e6d2ec9d, can you take this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270209-5-c00ca\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270209-5-c00ca\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e6d2ec9d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-10T00:15:00\", \"text\": \"On it! I'll check out the model drift issue and work on getting it back on track. 🧠\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270209-6-2fd1a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270209-6-2fd1a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ee9ca887\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-10T00:16:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone! Let's keep the communication open. If you need any more details or run into roadblocks, just shout. 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270209-7-e8c42\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270209-7-e8c42\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_dd1ff0ca\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-10T00:17:00\", \"text\": \"Will do! I'll update once I have more info on the UI issue. 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270209-8-6f2cb\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270209-8-6f2cb\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_38700e5f\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-10T00:19:00\", \"text\": \"Same here, I'll keep you posted on the feature extraction progress. 🔍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270209-9-255b4\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270209-9-255b4\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e6d2ec9d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-10T00:21:00\", \"text\": \"I'll make sure to share updates on the model drift as well. Thanks for coordinating, @eid_ee9ca887! 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270209-10-ffa87\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270209-10-ffa87\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_59bbe6f6\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-06T07:02:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, one of the common issues reported for pAIX is that the user interface can be overwhelming for new users. This was reported by Customer ID: CUST-0114.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260716-0-73ffc\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260716-0-73ffc\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_85a4de81\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-06T07:07:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for bringing this up, Charlie. Since the product was developed by a different team, we should start by understanding their design choices.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260716-1-d53f0\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260716-1-d53f0\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8df92d08\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-06T07:10:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, Julia. One possible cause could be a complex or cluttered UI layout that's not intuitive for beginners.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260716-2-34837\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260716-2-34837\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_888411ab\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-06T07:13:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_8df92d08, that's a good point. We should also consider if there's a lack of user-friendly onboarding or tutorial features.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260716-3-819ff\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260716-3-819ff\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ee9ca887\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-06T07:14:00\", \"text\": \"Right, Hannah. Onboarding is crucial. Maybe the previous team didn't incorporate enough user feedback during the UI design phase?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260716-4-eae91\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260716-4-eae91\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_50da4819\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-06T07:18:00\", \"text\": \"George, that's possible. We should look into how much user feedback was actually considered.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260716-5-ea884\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260716-5-ea884\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_59bbe6f6\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-06T07:19:00\", \"text\": \"Let's make sure we document these issues and potential causes in our planning documents for the next release of pAIX.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260716-6-71d9f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260716-6-71d9f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"pla