nsightful for our database management system. I'll dive into their solution and see how we can apply it. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261109-2-92f42\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261109-2-92f42\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d96fb219\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T11:25:00\", \"text\": \"Great, Julia! Next, there's a Kubernetes issue titled 'API Rate Limiting Misconfiguration'. It describes excessive rate limiting on the API server, causing delays in pod scaling operations. Here's the PR: https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/176. Ian, this sounds a lot like our API rate limiting problem. What do you think?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261109-3-f74c0\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261109-3-f74c0\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8658e19c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T11:29:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, Emma! The Kubernetes team's approach to adjusting rate limits could help us refine our own settings. I'll review their changes and see how we can adapt them for our backend server. 💪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261109-4-48c0f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261109-4-48c0f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d96fb219\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T11:33:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome, Ian! Lastly, there's an OAuth2 Proxy issue titled 'OAuth Token Validation Flaw'. It involves a misconfiguration in token validation that allows unauthorized access to protected resources. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/oauth2-proxy/oauth2-proxy/pull/177. Fiona, this seems directly related to our OAuth misimplementation. Any insights?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261109-5-91ea1\"}