rcia-SummarizeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-9223c9\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f4f58faa\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-04-20T03:30:00\", \"text\": \"Great, thanks everyone for jumping on these is",
