ext\": \"@here try out our product with this live demo https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/CollaborateForce/demo_4\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260826-0-81c13\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260826-0-81c13\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_9c876927\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-06T00:27:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, I noticed that PR# 15 is approved but not merged yet. I heard there's been a change in product direction. Can someone clarify if this PR is still needed?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-0-eeaa1\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-0-eeaa1\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8cbee5b3\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-06T00:28:00\", \"text\": \"Hey @eid_9c876927, yes, the product direction has shifted. We're no longer focusing on capturing user corrections for AI suggestions. This PR might not align with our current goals.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-1-a7694\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-1-a7694\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_3f3ea10f\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-06T00:30:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, @eid_8cbee5b3. @eid_a7dd9c52, could you provide more details on what this PR entails? Just want to ensure we're not missing any critical functionality.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-2-7c130\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-2-7c130\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a7dd9c52\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-06T00:35:00\", \"text\": \"Sure, @eid_3f3ea10f. This PR was designed to log user corrections to AI suggestions, which would then be used to improve the AI's future outputs. It was part of our previous strategy to enhance AI accuracy.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-3-c0139\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-3-c0139\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_839e5084\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-06T00:39:00\", \"text\": \"Given the new direction, do we have any alternative plans for improving AI suggestions, or is this on hold for now?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-4-9ee07\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-4-9ee07\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_724e1180\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-06T00:41:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_839e5084, for now, we're pausing this approach. The focus is shifting towards other priorities, so this specific functionality isn't needed at the moment.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-5-6a439\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-5-6a439\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_73a50f06\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-06T00:45:00\", \"text\": \"If the PR isn't aligned with our current goals, should we just not merge it, or is there a reason to revert it if it was already merged?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-6-68f67\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-6-68f67\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bc469a8f\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-06T00:50:00\", \"text\": \"Since it hasn't been merged yet, I think we should just not merge it. No need to revert anything.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-7-359d2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-7-359d2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_97d7392d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-06T00:52:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed. @eid_a7dd9c52, could you hold off on merging PR# 15? We might revisit this in the future, but it's not needed right now.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-8-a5d51\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-8-a5d51\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a7dd9c52\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-06T00:55:00\", \"text\": \"Got it, @eid_97d7392d. I won't merge the PR. I'll keep it on hold in case we decide to revisit this functionality later. Thanks for the heads-up, everyone!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-9-6db2b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-9-6db2b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_724e1180\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-26T13:06:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, please check my PR for integrating the GraphQL API with our existing systems: https://github.com/salesforce/CollaborateForce/pull/36. The main changes include ensuring seamless data flow and compatibility. Let me know your thoughts! 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261026-0-ffdf9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261026-0-ffdf9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8cbee5b3\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-26T13:11:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_724e1180 Thanks for sharing, I'll take a look now! 🔍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261026-1-0005a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261026-1-0005a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_86f94a48\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-26T13:13:00\", \"text\": \"Hey @eid_724e1180, just started reviewing your PR. Excited to see how the GraphQL integration is shaping up! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261026-2-1198b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261026-2-1198b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_446bc3ee\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-26T13:14:00\", \"text\": \"Checking it out now, @eid_724e1180! Let's see how it plays with our existing systems. 🤞\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261026-3-5b7c8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261026-3-5b7c8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8cbee5b3\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-26T13:18:00\", \"text\": \"Alright, I've gone through the changes. The GraphQL API is well integrated with our existing data sources. Everything looks solid from my end. LGTM, approved! 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261026-4-5bc4b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261026-4-5bc4b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_86f94a48\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-26T13:23:00\", \"text\": \"Just finished my review. The compatibility with our existing systems is spot on, and I didn't notice any data consistency issues. Great job, @eid_724e1180! Approved! ✅\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261026-5-767ee\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261026-5-767ee\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_446bc3ee\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-26T13:24:00\", \"text\": \"I agree with Fiona and Bob. The integration is seamless, and data consistency is maintained across the board. Well done, @eid_724e1180! LGTM, approved! 🎉\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261026-6-edc72\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261026-6-edc72\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_724e1180\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-26T13:28:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone! Really appreciate the quick reviews and feedback. Glad to hear everything's in order. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261026-7-0763f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261026-7-0763f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_446bc3ee\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T01:20:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, please check my PR for optimizing the GraphQL API for performance: https://github.com/salesforce/CollaborateForce/pull/41. I've implemented some optimizations to reduce load times and improve data retrieval efficiency. Let me know your thoughts! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261109-0-b13cf\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261109-0-b13cf\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8cbee5b3\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T01:24:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for sharing, @eid_446bc3ee! I'll take a look at it now. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261109-1-de54a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261109-1-de54a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_01e37306\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T01:27:00\", \"text\": \"Great, I'll review it too. Looking forward to seeing those performance improvements!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261109-2-5f992\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261109-2-5f992\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8cbee5b3\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T01:31:00\", \"text\": \"Just finished reviewing. The API response times are definitely within acceptable limits, and I can see you've minimized unnecessary data retrieval. Nice work on the optimizations! 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261109-3-31fc9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261109-3-31fc9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_01e37306\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T01:32:00\", \"text\": \"I agree with Fiona Taylor. The performance benchmarks are well-documented and meet our predefined standards. Everything looks solid to me. 👏\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261109-4-2bf25\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261109-4-2bf25\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8cbee5b3\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T01:36:00\", \"text\": \"LGTM, approved! 🎉\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261109-5-77553\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261109-5-77553\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_01e37306\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T01:40:00\", \"text\": \"Same here, approved! Great job, @eid_446bc3ee! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261109-6-dfe2f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261109-6-dfe2f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_446bc3ee\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T01:43:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, @Fiona Taylor and Fiona Davis! Appreciate the quick review and feedback. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261109-7-5aec4\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261109-7-5aec4\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7a6e7f9\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-07T15:30:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, I was reading about InsightCollab, one of our competitors, and thought I'd share some insights. While it's a decent product, it has a couple of notable weaknesses. Firstly, it requires a stable internet connection for optimal performance, which can be a significant drawback for users with unreliable connectivity. Secondly, it offers limited customization options for advanced users, which might not meet the needs of those looking for more tailored solutions.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-0-0613c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-0-0613c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_97d7392d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-07T15:33:00\", \"text\": \"Interesting points, Julia! 🤔 How does the internet dependency affect its usability in real-world scenarios?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-1-d17d6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-1-d17d6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7a6e7f9\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-07T15:38:00\", \"text\": \"Great question, Charlie! Essentially, if the internet connection is unstable, users might experience lag or even lose access to some features. This can be particularly problematic in remote areas or during peak usage times when bandwidth is limited.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-2-d83c0\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-2-d83c0\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_1e7c8290\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-07T15:41:00\", \"text\": \"That sounds like a major issue. @eid_b7a6e7f9, do they offer any offline capabilities to mitigate this?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-3-b98dd\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-3-b98dd\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7a6e7f9\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-07T15:46:00\", \"text\": \"Unfortunately, not really, Hannah. InsightCollab is heavily reliant on cloud-based operations, so offline functionality is quite limited. This could be a deal-breaker for some users.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-4-54d28\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-4-54d28\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_0e2e8d07\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-07T15:50:00\", \"text\": \"Regarding customization, do you think their limited options could deter advanced users from choosing their product?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-5-fa591\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-5-fa591\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7a6e7f9\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-07T15:51:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, Hannah. Advanced users often look for flexibility to tailor the product to their specific needs. InsightCollab's lack of customization could push these users to seek alternatives that offer more robust personalization features.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-6-ccf79\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-6-ccf79\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_294dc39d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-07T15:56:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the insights, Julia. 😊 From a strategic standpoint, these weaknesses could be opportunities for us to highlight our strengths in these areas.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-7-f2772\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-7-f2772\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_97d7392d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-07T15:57:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, Charlie! Maybe we can brainstorm ways to emphasize our offline capabilities and customization options in our marketing materials. 💡\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-8-ac165\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-8-ac165\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_1e7c8290\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-07T15:58:00\", \"text\": \"I think that's a solid plan. We should also consider how we can further enhance these features to stay ahead of the competition.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-9-caba9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-9-caba9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_0e2e8d07\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-07T16:00:00\", \"text\": \"Let's schedule a meeting to discuss this further. I'll set up a time for us to dive deeper into these opportunities. 📅\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-10-1f493\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-10-1f493\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7a6e7f9\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-07T16:03:00\"