D\": \"20261109-2-5f992\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261109-2-5f992\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8cbee5b3\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T01:31:00\", \"text\": \"Just finished reviewing. The API response times are definitely within acceptable limits, and I can see you've minimized unnecessary data retrieval. Nice work on the optimizations! 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261109-3-31fc9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261109-3-31fc9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_01e37306\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T01:32:00\", \"text\": \"I agree with Fiona Taylor. The performance benchmarks are well-documented and meet our predefined standards. Everything looks solid to me. 👏\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261109-4-2bf25\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261109-4-2bf25\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8cbee5b3\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T01:36:00\", \"text\": \"LGTM, approved! 🎉\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261109-5-77553\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261109-5-77553\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_01e37306\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T01:40:00\", \"text\": \"Same here, approved! Great job, @eid_446bc3ee! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261109-6-dfe2f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261109-6-dfe2f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_446bc3ee\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T01:43:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, @Fiona Taylor and Fiona Davis! Appreciate the quick review and feedback. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261109-7-5aec4\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261109-7-5aec4\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7a6e7f9\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-07T15:30:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, I was reading about InsightCollab, one of our competitors, and thought I'd share some insights. While it's a decent product, it has a couple of notable weaknesses. Firstly, it requires a stable internet connection for optimal performance, which can be a significant drawback for users with unreliable connectivity. Secondly, it offers limited customization options for advanced users, which might not meet the needs of those looking for more tailored solutions.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-0-0613c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-0-0613c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_97d7392d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-07T15:33:00\", \"text\": \"Interesting points, Julia! 🤔 How does the internet dependency affect its usability in real-world scenarios?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-1-d17d6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-1-d17d6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7a6e7f9\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-07T15:38:00\", \"text\": \"Great question, Charlie! Essentially, if the internet connection is unstable, users might experience lag or even lose access to some features. This can be particularly problematic in remote areas or during peak usage times when bandwidth is limited.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-2-d83c0\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-2-d83c0\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_1e7c8290\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-07T15:41:00\", \"text\": \"That sounds like a major issue. @eid_b7a6e7f9, do they offer any offline capabilities to mitigate this?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-3-b98dd\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-3-b98dd\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7a6e7f9\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-07T15:46:00\", \"text\": \"Unfortunately, not really, Hannah. InsightCollab is heavily reliant on cloud-based operations, so offline functionality is quite limited. This could be a deal-breaker for some users.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-4-54d28\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-4-54d28\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_0e2e8d07\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-07T15:50:00\", \"text\": \"Regarding customization, do you think their limited options could deter advanced users from choosing their product?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-5-fa591\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-5-fa591\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7a6e7f9\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-07T15:51:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, Hannah. Advanced users often look for flexibility to tailor the product to their specific needs. InsightCollab's lack of customization could push these users to seek alternatives that offer more robust personalization features.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-6-ccf79\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-6-ccf79\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_294dc39d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-07T15:56:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the insights, Julia. 😊 From a strategic standpoint, these weaknesses could be opportunities for us to highlight our strengths in these areas.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-7-f2772\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-7-f2772\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_97d7392d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-07T15:57:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, Charlie! Maybe we can brainstorm ways to emphasize our offline capabilities and customization options in our marketing materials. 💡\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-8-ac165\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-8-ac165\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_1e7c8290\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-07T15:58:00\", \"text\": \"I think that's a solid plan. We should also consider how we can further enhance these features to stay ahead of the competition.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-9-caba9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-9-caba9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_0e2e8d07\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-07T16:00:00\", \"text\": \"Let's schedule a meeting to discuss this further. I'll set up a time for us to dive deeper into these opportunities. 📅\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-10-1f493\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-10-1f493\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7a6e7f9\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-07T16:03:00\", \"text\": \"Sounds good! Looking forward to it. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-11-27fe0\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-11-27fe0\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-08T20:02:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_446bc3ee joined develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260708-28-969b2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260708-28-969b2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_446bc3ee\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-09T06:52:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, please check my PR for setting up the GraphQL server for CollaborateForce: https://github.com/salesforce/CollaborateForce/pull/2. 🚀 This PR initializes the server to handle API requests, supporting basic queries and mutations. Let me know your thoughts!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260708-0-1ef21\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260708-0-1ef21\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_01e37306\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-09T06:56:00\", \"text\": \"Hey @eid_446bc3ee, thanks for sharing! I'll take a look at it now. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260708-1-e0857\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260708-1-e0857\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-de9cfb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_724e1180\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-09T07:01:00\", \"text\": \"Checking it out too! Excited to see how the GraphQL setup is coming along. 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260708-2-c2475\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260708-2-c2475\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-bobbrown-Collaborat