solutely, and if anyone needs help or has questions, feel free to reach out. We're all here to support each other.\\nJulia Martinez: Great teamwork, everyone. Let's aim to have these new PRs submitted by the end of the week. Thanks for your hard work!\", \"date\": \"2026-10-05T06:53:00\", \"document_type\": \"product-planning\", \"participants\": [\"eid_91523bad\", \"eid_b6a30126\", \"eid_caa2e58d\", \"eid_2d8eff4d\", \"eid_a253c65a\", \"eid_4b38019b\", \"eid_2347b567\", \"eid_bac7c6c4\", \"eid_edf6a3fc\", \"eid_4df3bcc2\", \"eid_54905dcb\", \"eid_4555ba9c\", \"eid_3e076e53\", \"eid_5058fefc\", \"eid_a0fe567d\"], \"id\": \"product_dev_EdgeForce_3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_54905dcb\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-29T08:18:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, please check my PR for initializing the RESTful API framework: https://github.com/salesforce/EF_AIX/pull/2. 🚀 I've set up the foundational structure, installed essential libraries, and completed the basic server setup. Let me know your thoughts!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261002-0-e33b4\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261002-0-e33b4\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_edf6a3fc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-29T08:20:00\", \"text\": \"Hey @eid_54905dcb, thanks for sharing! I'll take a look at it now. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261002-1-e4a4b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261002-1-e4a4b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df3bcc2\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-29T08:23:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the heads up, @eid_54905dcb! I'll review it shortly. 🕵️‍♀️\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261002-2-6d1fb\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\"