ow you've tackled the data mapping! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260713-2-2e1df\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260713-2-2e1df\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iangarcia-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-a-aix-2eecee\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_cac9a0ac\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-11T19:23:00\", \"text\": \"Alright, I've gone through the PR. The data fields between AIX and HubSpot seem to be correctly mapped, which is great. However, I noticed that the transformation logic for some fields isn't fully documented. Could you add more details on that? 📄\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260713-3-60943\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260713-3-60943\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iangarcia-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-a-aix-2eecee\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_90359c89\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-11T19:25:00\", \"text\": \"I agree with David. Also, while the unit tests are comprehensive, one of them is failing for the edge case where the data field is null. Could you take a look at that, @eid_a23a73c4? 🛠️\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260713-4-24b37\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260713-4-24b37\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iangarcia-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-a-aix-2eecee\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a23a73c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-11T19:30:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the feedback, @David Smith and @Charlie Taylor! I'll add more documentation on the transformation logic and fix the failing test. Appreciate the thorough review! 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260713-5-db052\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260713-5-db052\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-iangarcia-LeadForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-a-aix-2eecee\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_cac9a0ac\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-11T19:32:00\", \"text\": \"No worries, @eid_a23a73c4! Once those changes are in, I think we'll be in 