ting customer CUST-0068. @eid_d417c166, can you handle this?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260822-3-4e448\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260822-3-4e448\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-bobmiller-MonitorForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-c6eeee\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d417c166\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-22T07:28:00\", \"text\": \"Sure thing! I'll dive into ",
