mp\": \"2026-07-10T10:02:00\", \"text\": \"That's possible, George. We should also consider operational factors, like insufficient partnerships or collaborations with CRM providers.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260704-4-d4e95\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260704-4-d4e95\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_32ff39b2\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-10T10:06:00\", \"text\": \"I think we should start by reviewing the existing API documentation to see where the gaps are. @eid_469598db, do we have access to that?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260704-5-54fb5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260704-5-54fb5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_469598db\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-10T10:09:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, Charlie, we do. I'll share the link to the documentation after this meeting.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260704-6-919e2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260704-6-919e2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_66d09012\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-10T10:14:00\", \"text\": \"Great. Once we identify the gaps, we can prioritize which CRM systems to focus on for better integration.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260704-7-18cee\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260704-7-18cee\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_df39cc9e\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-10T10:18:00\", \"text\": \"Let's make sure to document these customer issues in our planning documents for the next release of pAIX.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260704-8-113f0\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260704-8-113f0\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d9f42fd7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-10T10:21:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, Emma. This will help us ensure that we address these integration issues effectively.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260704-9-b5999\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260704-9-b5999\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_59bbe6f6\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-11T21:40:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, QA team found some issues in the last release of pAIX. The report came from QA Specialist eid_7b85a749.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260716-0-fbf67\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260716-0-fbf67\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_888411ab\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-11T21:43:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Charlie. What kind of issues are we looking at?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260716-1-71791\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260716-1-71791\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_59bbe6f6\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-11T21:44:00\", \"text\": \"Users are experiencing occasional slowdowns during peak usage times, which is affecting performance.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260716-2-6bee1\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260716-2-6bee1\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ee9ca887\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-11T21:48:00\", \"text\": \"Could it be a technical issue like insufficient server capacity or resource allocation?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260716-3-642a9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260716-3-642a9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_50da4819\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-11T21:53:00\", \"text\": \"That's possible, George. We should check the server logs during those peak times.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260716-4-86d20\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260716-4-86d20\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8df92d08\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-11T21:54:00\", \"text\": \"Another angle could be operational. Maybe we lack proper load balancing or scaling strategies.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260716-5-614c9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260716-5-614c9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_85a4de81\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-11T21:57:00\", \"text\": \"Good point, Julia. We should review our current load balancing setup.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260716-6-88bec\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260716-6-88bec\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_888411ab\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-11T21:58:00\", \"text\": \"Also, inefficient backend processes or algorithms might be causing bottlenecks.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260716-7-9e382\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260716-7-9e382\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_59bbe6f6\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-11T22:02:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, Hannah. We should analyze the backend processes for any inefficiencies.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260716-8-a14ee\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260716-8-a14ee\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_50da4819\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-11T22:06:00\", \"text\": \"Let's document these issues and potential causes in our planning documents for the next release of pAIX.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260716-9-4a37b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260716-9-4a37b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8df92d08\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-11T22:08:00\", \"text\": \"Sounds good. We need to ensure these are addressed before the next release.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260716-10-2d57f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260716-10-2d57f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-12T22:17:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_e37380e3 joined planning-pAIX.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260712-80-215b3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260712-80-215b3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e4d35074\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-07T15:05:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug titled 'Inconsistent Layout Across Mobile Browsers' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/PitchForce/pull/52.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270207-0-f0c07\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270207-0-f0c07\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8df92d08\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-07T15:10:00\", \"text\": \"That's great news, Ian! Can you explain what was causing the inconsistency?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270207-1-d560b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270207-1-d560b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e4d35074\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-07T15:15:00\", \"text\": \"Sure, Julia. The root cause was the use of CSS properties that aren't uniformly supported across all mobile browsers. This led to variations in how elements were displayed.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270207-2-b3d0f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270207-2-b3d0f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_7687dbe6\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-07T15:19:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, Ian. How did you manage to fix it?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270207-3-384d1\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270207-3-384d1\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e4d35074\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-07T15:20:00\", \"text\": \"I replaced the problematic CSS properties with more universally supported ones and added a few media queries to ensure consistent rendering. This should now provide a uniform layout across all mobile browsers.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270207-4-bb36f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270207-4-bb36f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8df92d08\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-07T15:22:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome work, @eid_e4d35074! I'll test it on a few devices to confirm everything looks good.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270207-5-040b7\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270207-5-040b7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_7687dbe6\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-07T15:25:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Ian. Let us know if there's anything else we need to keep an eye on.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270207-6-b09c1\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270207-6-b09c1\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e4d35074\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-07T15:28:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Fiona. I'll keep you posted if anything comes up. Appreciate the support, team!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270207-7-6ffc6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270207-7-6ffc6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8df92d08\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-19T15:13:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with PitchForce that we need to address ASAP. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270219-0-292f5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270219-0-292f5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8df92d08\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-19T15:15:00\", \"text\": \"First up, we have a problem with 'Gesture Recognition Failures'. Mobile users are having trouble with swipe gestures, which is affecting their navigation experience. This is impacting customer CUST-0011. @eid_a041a433, can you take this one? It's in the User Interface & Mobile Compatibility area.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270219-1-fdd8e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270219-1-fdd8e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a041a433\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-19T15:17:00\", \"text\": \"Got it! I'll look into the gesture recognition issue right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270219-2-5426d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270219-2-5426d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8df92d08\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-19T15:19:00\", \"text\": \"Great, thanks! Next, we have an 'Inefficient Caching Strategy' issue. The caching isn't working as expected, causing slower response times and impacting productivity. This is affecting customer CUST-0111. @eid_2e1d6568, could you handle this one? It's related to Backend Infrastructure & Performance.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270219-3-a671b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270219-3-a671b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2e1d6568\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-19T15:23:00\", \"text\": \"Sure thing! I'll dive into the caching strategy and see what's going wrong. Thanks for assigning it to me. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270219-4-fb6d6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270219-4-fb6d6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8df92d08\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-19T15:24:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, @eid_2e1d6568! Lastly, there's an issue with 'Exposed Debug Information in API Responses'. This is a serious security concern as it exposes sensitive data. It's impacting customer CUST-0026. @eid_a041a433, can you also take this one since it's in the API Security & Access Control area?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270219-5-d72cb\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270219-5-d72cb\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a041a433\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-19T15:29:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, I'll prioritize this and ensure we secure the API responses. Thanks for flagging it. 🔒\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270219-6-98658\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270219-6-98658\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8df92d08\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-19T15:32:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome, thanks everyone for jumping on these issues so quickly. Let's keep our customers happy! If you need any more details or run into roadblocks, just shout. 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270219-7-ed3eb\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270219-7-ed3eb\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2e1d6568\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-19T15:34:00\", \"text\": \"Will do! Let's get these sorted out. 💪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270219-8-5fa97\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270219-8-5fa97\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a041a433\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-19T15:37:00\", \"text\": \"On it! Let's make sure PitchForce is running smoothly for everyone. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270219-9-07062\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270219-9-07062\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-09T05:19:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_ee9ca887 created this channel on 2026-12-09 05:19:00. This is the very beginning of the bug-georgemiller-PitchForce channel.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261209-0-66051\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261209-0-66051\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-09T05:19:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_ee9ca887 joined bug-georgemiller-PitchForce. Also, @eid_dd1ff0ca, @eid_022d1fd9, @eid_38700e5f, @eid_e6d2ec9d, @eid_0deececb, @eid_81582c30 joined via invite.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261209-1-c8a01\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261209-1-c8a01\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ee9ca887\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-09T15:59:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with PitchForce that we need to address ASAP. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261209-0-920c5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261209-0-920c5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ee9ca887\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-09T16:04:00\", \"text\": \"First up, we have a 'Database Query Bottleneck' issue. The sales pitch generation is delayed due to inefficient database queries, especially with large customer profiles. This affects our Backend Infrastructure & Performance. Customer CUST-0018 is impacted, and they're facing productivity losses and frustration. @eid_0deececb, can you take this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261209-1-6b092\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261209-1-6b092\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_0deececb\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-09T16:07:00\", \"text\": \"Got it! I'll dive into the database queries and see how we can optimize them. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261209-2-7ad2c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261209-2-7ad2c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ee9ca887\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-09T16:12:00\", \"text\": \"Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Touch Input Lag on Mobile Devices'. Users are experiencing delays with touch elements, which affects the User Interface & Mobile Compatibility. Customer CUST-0053 is having a tough time with this. @eid_e6d2ec9d, can you handle this?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261209-3-df15d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261209-3-df15d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e6d2ec9d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-09T16:16:00\", \"text\": \"Sure thing! I'll look into the touch input lag and see how we can improve the responsiveness. Let's make the mobile experience smooth again! 📱\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261209-4-f857a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261209-4-f857a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ee9ca887\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-09T16:19:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's an 'API Rate Limiting Misconfiguration'. The rate limiting is too restrictive, causing legitimate requests to be throttled. This is impacting Backend Infrastructure & Performance, and Customer CUST-0034 is affected. @eid_81582c30, can you take a look?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261209-5-9a735\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261209-5-9a735\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_81582c30\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-09T16:21:00\", \"text\": \"On it! I'll review the API rate limiting settings and adjust them to better accommodate normal usage patterns. Let's get this sorted out! 🔧\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261209-6-5a007\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261209-6-5a007\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ee9ca887\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-09T16:25:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone! Let's keep communication open and update each other on progress. Feel free to ask questions or share insights as you work through these issues. 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261209-7-64304\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261209-7-64304\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_0deececb\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-09T16:29:00\", \"text\": \"Will do! If anyone has insights on optimizing database queries, feel free to share. 🤓\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261209-8-0c6b3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261209-8-0c6b3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e6d2ec9d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-09T16:34:00\", \"text\": \"Same here, if anyone has tips on improving touch responsiveness, I'm all ears! 👂\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261209-9-89457\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261209-9-89457\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_81582c30\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-09T16:38:00\", \"text\": \"I'll keep you all posted on the API adjustments. Let's get PitchForce running smoothly again! 💪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261209-10-4ef13\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261209-10-4ef13\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d9f42fd7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-25T10:00:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, let's review the Technical Specifications Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We've got some areas to address, particularly around AI-generated pitch nuances, performance during peak times, integration options, UI complexity, and output reliability. Let's dive in! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260723-0-9a2d2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260723-0-9a2d2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8df92d08\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-25T10:01:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_d9f42fd7 George, I think we should start by enhancing the Core AI Engine section. We need to specify improvements in NLP capabilities to better capture context-specific nuances. This could involve expanding our training datasets to include more industry-specific data. Thoughts? 🤔\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260723-1-cb571\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260723-1-cb571\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e37380e3\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-25T10:05:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, @eid_8df92d08. Also, we should mention the need for more personalized content generation in the Template Management System. Over-reliance on generic templates is a design flaw we need to address. Maybe we can add a feature for dynamic template suggestions based on user data? 📈\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260723-2-eda2a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260723-2-eda2a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_66d09012\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-25T10:09:00\", \"text\": \"For the performance issues, we should update the System Architecture section to include strategies for load balancing and scaling. This could help mitigate slowdowns during peak usage. @eid_8df92d08, do you think we need to increase server capacity as well?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260723-3-5c27b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260723-3-5c27b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8df92d08\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-25T10:13:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, @eid_66d09012, increasing server capacity is crucial. We should also consider optimizing backend processes to reduce bottlenecks. I'll draft some changes for that section. 💪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260723-4-a813a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260723-4-a813a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_31ca5b45\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-25T10:17:00\", \"text\": \"On the integration front, we need to expand the Future Enhancements section to include more API support for popular CRM systems. This will address the limited integration options. Maybe we can also mention potential partnerships with CRM providers? 🤝\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260723-5-3aa64\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260723-5-3aa64\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_32ff39b2\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-25T10:22:00\", \"text\": \"For the UI, let's add a subsection under User Interface about improving onboarding and tutorial features. We need to make the interface more intuitive for new users. A step-by-step guide or interactive tutorial could help reduce the learning curve. 📚\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260723-6-9dad5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260723-6-9dad5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_71a4de1d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-25T10:25:00\", \"text\": \"Regarding reliability, we should emphasize the need for more rigorous testing and quality assurance processes. This could be added to the Data Security section, highlighting our commitment to consistent output quality. 🔍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260723-7-2b90c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260723-7-2b90c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d9f42fd7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-25T10:29:00\", \"text\": \"Great suggestions, everyone! To summarize, we'll enhance the AI Engine and Template Management for better personalization, update System Architecture for performance improvements, expand CRM integration options, improve UI onboarding, and emphasize QA processes. I'll compile these changes and circulate a draft for final review. Thanks for the collaboration! 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260723-8-dea32\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260723-8-dea32\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d9f42fd7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-27T19:41:00\", \"text\": \"Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_paix_technical_specifications_document|Technical Specifications Document>, thank you everyone!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260727-0-bb7ac\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260727-0-bb7ac\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8df92d08\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-29T11:24:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, let's review the System Design Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We need to address the AI-generated pitches lacking context-specific nuances, performance slowdowns, limited CRM integration, UI complexity, and reliability issues. Let's dive in! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260728-0-628df\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260728-0-628df\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_df39cc9e\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-29T11:26:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_8df92d08 Julia, for the AI-generated pitches, we should consider expanding the 'Core AI Engine' section to include plans for increasing training data diversity. This could help in capturing more industry-specific nuances. Thoughts?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260728-1-95135\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260728-1-95135\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d9f42fd7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-29T11:27:00\", \"text\": \"I agree with Emma. Additionally, we might want to mention enhancing NLP capabilities to better capture subtle nuances. This could be a key point in the 'Future Enhancements' section.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260728-2-2747b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260728-2-2747b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_71a4de1d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-29T11:29:00\", \"text\": \"For the performance issues, we should add a section on implementing load balancing strategies and optimizing backend processes. This could be part of the 'System Architecture' section to ensure scalability during peak times.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260728-3-0172c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260728-3-0172c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4de5cd7f\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-29T11:30:00\", \"text\": \"Good point, Alice. We should also consider adding more details on server capacity planning and resource allocation strategies to handle high demand efficiently.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260728-4-91d7d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260728-4-91d7d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_1cfce648\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-29T11:32:00\", \"text\": \"Regarding CRM integration, we need to expand the 'System Architecture' section to include more robust API support and compatibility with major CRM platforms. This will address the integration issues users are facing.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260728-5-bd04b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260728-5-bd04b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e37380e3\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-29T11:37:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_1cfce648 Charlie, I think we should also mention potential partnerships with CRM providers in the 'Future Enhancements' section to improve integration options.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260728-6-749c5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260728-6-749c5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_31ca5b45\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-29T11:38:00\", \"text\": \"On the UI front, we should revise the 'User Interface' section to focus on simplifying the layout and adding user-friendly onboarding features. This will help new users get up to speed faster.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260728-7-d4b04\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260728-7-d4b04\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_32ff39b2\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-29T11:39:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, Fiona. We should also incorporate more user feedback into the UI design process to ensure it meets user needs effectively.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260728-8-36da8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260728-8-36da8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_469598db\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-29T11:41:00\", \"text\": \"For reliability issues, we need to emphasize the importance of rigorous testing and quality assurance processes in the 'Core AI Engine' section. This will help ensure consistent output quality across different customer profiles.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260728-9-37192\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260728-9-37192\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_66d09012\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-29T11:44:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, and we should highlight the need for better data quality management to reduce variability in output quality. This could be a part of the 'Data Security' section.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260728-10-8e05f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260728-10-8e05f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c0df5be6\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-29T11:45:00\", \"text\": \"Great suggestions, everyone! Let's make sure these changes are reflected in the document. I'll summarize the key changes and discuss the next steps. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260728-11-93cd5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260728-11-93cd5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_965867b8\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-29T11:47:50\", \"text\": \"@here Read about the future of AI in sales and how tools like pAIX are setting new standards for customer engagement and sales effectiveness. https://www.techcrunch.com/2023/02/10/ai-sales-tools-future/\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260729-139-0ce2e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260729-139-0ce2e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8df92d08\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-29T11:50:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the input, team! Here's a summary of the key changes: 1) Expand AI training data and NLP capabilities, 2) Implement load balancing and optimize backend processes, 3) Enhance CRM integration and explore partnerships, 4) Simplify UI and incorporate user feedback, 5) Strengthen testing and data quality management. Let's aim to update the document by the end of the week. I'll coordinate with each of you for specific sections. 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260728-12-9ea36\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260728-12-9ea36\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_81582c30\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-21T14:37:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug about incorrect API rate limiting has been resolved. 🎉\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270121-0-d9c9d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270121-0-d9c9d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_81582c30\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-21T14:39:00\", \"text\": \"The issue was due to misconfigured rate limiting rules in the API gateway, which were too restrictive and caused legitimate requests to be throttled even during normal usage.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270121-1-bac6d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270121-1-bac6d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_81582c30\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-21T14:40:00\", \"text\": \"I've adjusted the rate limiting thresholds to better align with our typical traffic patterns. This should prevent unnecessary throttling while still protecting against abuse.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270121-2-2545e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270121-2-2545e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_81582c30\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-21T14:44:00\", \"text\": \"You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/PitchForce/pull/47\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270121-3-ac0ef\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270121-3-ac0ef\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_0deececb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-21T14:49:00\", \"text\": \"Great work, Alice! Thanks for jumping on this so quickly.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270121-4-590a3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270121-4-590a3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e6d2ec9d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-21T14:54:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_81582c30 Thanks, Alice! This should improve the user experience significantly.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270121-5-6f7be\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270121-5-6f7be\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ee9ca887\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-21T14:56:00\", \"text\": \"Nice job, Alice. I'll monitor the API performance over the next few days to ensure everything is stable.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270121-6-a87a6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270121-6-a87a6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_81582c30\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-21T14:57:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, George. Let me know if you notice anything unusual. I'm here to help!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270121-7-8803e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270121-7-8803e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e6d2ec9d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-21T14:58:00\", \"text\": \"I'll update the documentation to reflect the new rate limits. Thanks again, Alice!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270121-8-fd065\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270121-8-fd065\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_81582c30\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-21T15:00:00\", \"text\": \"Sounds good, Emma. Appreciate it!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270121-9-6521b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270121-9-6521b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_0deececb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-23T05:16:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug about inconsistent data replication has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/PitchForce/pull/48.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270122-0-834ae\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270122-0-834ae\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_022d1fd9\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-23T05:21:00\", \"text\": \"Great news, George! Can you explain what was causing the issue?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270122-1-ae6a2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270122-1-ae6a2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_0deececb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-23T05:24:00\", \"text\": \"Sure, Emma Smith. The root cause was the replication lag between our primary and secondary database nodes. This lag caused outdated or partial data to be used during pitch generation, leading to discrepancies in customer profiles.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270122-2-5a2c2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270122-2-5a2c2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e6d2ec9d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-23T05:26:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the explanation, @eid_0deececb. How did you manage to fix it?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270122-3-1fa43\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270122-3-1fa43\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_0deececb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-23T05:29:00\", \"text\": \"To resolve the issue, I implemented a more robust synchronization mechanism that ensures data consistency by using a two-phase commit protocol. This guarantees that all nodes have the most up-to-date data before proceeding with pitch generation.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270122-4-b2e57\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270122-4-b2e57\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ee9ca887\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-23T05:33:00\", \"text\": \"Nice work, George Garcia! That sounds like a solid solution. Is there anything else we need to do on our end?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270122-5-8c4b2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270122-5-8c4b2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_0deececb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-23T05:36:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, George Miller. No further action is needed from your side. Just keep an eye on the system and let me know if any similar issues arise.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270122-6-738b6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270122-6-738b6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_022d1fd9\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-23T05:40:00\", \"text\": \"Will do, thanks for the update and the quick fix!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270122-7-20437\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270122-7-20437\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e6d2ec9d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-23T05:45:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, thanks for handling this so efficiently, George!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270122-8-8a1e5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270122-8-8a1e5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e6d2ec9d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-26T16:56:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug titled 'Bias in Training Data' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/PitchForce/pull/49.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270126-0-b1fab\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270126-0-b1fab\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_0deececb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-26T17:01:00\", \"text\": \"Great news, @eid_e6d2ec9d! Can you remind us what the root cause was?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270126-1-ae242\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270126-1-ae242\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e6d2ec9d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-26T17:02:00\", \"text\": \"Sure, George. The root cause was the training dataset we used. It contained inherent biases that skewed the AI model's pitch generation, favoring certain demographics over others.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270126-2-7857b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270126-2-7857b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_022d1fd9\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-26T17:06:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, Emma. How did you manage to fix it?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270126-3-dd725\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270126-3-dd725\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e6d2ec9d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-26T17:09:00\", \"text\": \"To address the issue, we curated a more balanced training dataset that better represents the diverse needs of our target audience. We also implemented a bias detection and mitigation algorithm to ensure future datasets remain unbiased.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270126-4-a97ad\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270126-4-a97ad\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ee9ca887\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-26T17:13:00\", \"text\": \"That's a solid approach, Emma. Thanks for tackling this so efficiently!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270126-5-b1a4f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270126-5-b1a4f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e6d2ec9d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-26T17:15:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, George Miller! If anyone has further questions or notices any issues, feel free to reach out.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270126-6-b9d46\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270126-6-b9d46\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_0deececb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-26T17:18:00\", \"text\": \"Will do, Emma. Thanks again for the quick turnaround!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270126-7-24a27\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270126-7-24a27\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_0deececb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-07T02:19:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug titled 'Database Query Bottleneck' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/PitchForce/pull/45.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270107-0-81e1c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270107-0-81e1c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_0deececb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-07T02:22:00\", \"text\": \"The root cause was poorly optimized SQL queries that weren't effectively using indexing, which led to slow data retrieval times, especially with large customer profiles.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270107-1-7a99d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270107-1-7a99d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_0deececb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-07T02:24:00\", \"text\": \"To fix this, I restructured the SQL queries to make better use of existing indexes and added a few new indexes where necessary. This has significantly improved the query execution time.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270107-2-ce8e2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270107-2-ce8e2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e6d2ec9d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-07T02:28:00\", \"text\": \"Great work, @eid_0deececb! This should really help with the sales pitch generation delays we've been experiencing.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270107-3-f5997\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270107-3-f5997\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ee9ca887\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-07T02:29:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, George Garcia! I was just about to start on a workaround, but it looks like I won't need to now.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270107-4-f3d78\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270107-4-f3d78\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_81582c30\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-07T02:34:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome! Thanks for the quick turnaround, George. I'll test it out with some large profiles and let you know if I encounter any issues.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270107-5-e1a69\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270107-5-e1a69\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_0deececb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-07T02:39:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone! Let me know if you run into any more issues. Happy to help!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270107-6-e6595\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270107-6-e6595\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e6d2ec9d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-19T07:10:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug titled 'Touch Input Lag on Mobile Devices' has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/PitchForce/pull/46.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270118-0-ee34c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270118-0-ee34c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_0deececb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-19T07:14:00\", \"text\": \"Great news, @eid_e6d2ec9d! Can you explain what was causing the lag?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270118-1-bddb7\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270118-1-bddb7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e6d2ec9d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-19T07:18:00\", \"text\": \"Sure thing, George. The lag was due to inefficient event handling in our JavaScript code. Specifically, the touch events weren't optimized for mobile performance, which led to delayed response times.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270118-2-7d2db\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270118-2-7d2db\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ee9ca887\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-19T07:19:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, Emma. How did you manage to fix it?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270118-3-2b3c1\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270118-3-2b3c1\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e6d2ec9d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-19T07:24:00\", \"text\": \"To resolve the issue, I refactored the event handling logic to use passive event listeners. This reduces the delay by allowing the browser to handle touch events more efficiently. Additionally, I optimized the debounce function to ensure smoother interactions with touch elements.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270118-4-918b9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270118-4-918b9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_81582c30\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-19T07:26:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome work, Emma! This should really improve the user experience on mobile devices.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270118-5-dd154\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270118-5-dd154\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_0deececb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-19T07:29:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, @eid_e6d2ec9d. Thanks for tackling this so quickly!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270118-6-c8af9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270118-6-c8af9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-georgemiller-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-87f4a7\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e6d2ec9d\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-19T07:33:00\", \"text\": \"No problem, George. I'm glad we could get this sorted out. Let me know if you notice any other issues!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270118-7-b620b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270118-7-b620b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a041a433\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-25T11:29:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug about incorrect or corrupted data in customer profiles has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/PitchForce/pull/56.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270225-0-972e9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270225-0-972e9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a041a433\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-25T11:31:00\", \"text\": \"The root cause was a synchronization error between the database and the application layer, which was causing data integrity issues.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270225-1-ae6d9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270225-1-ae6d9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a041a433\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-25T11:32:00\", \"text\": \"To fix this, I implemented a more robust data validation and synchronization mechanism that ensures consistency between the database and the application layer. This should prevent any future data corruption.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270225-2-13a9b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270225-2-13a9b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8df92d08\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-25T11:35:00\", \"text\": \"Great work, @eid_a041a433! Thanks for resolving this so quickly. I'll test it out to make sure everything is working smoothly.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270225-3-2fc5c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270225-3-2fc5c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2e1d6568\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-25T11:37:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Hannah! This was a critical issue for our pitch generation. Glad to see it fixed. I'll update the documentation to reflect the changes.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270225-4-a0589\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270225-4-a0589\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e4d35074\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-25T11:41:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome job, Hannah. Let me know if there's anything else you need from the database team to prevent this in the future.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270225-5-b57ec\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270225-5-b57ec\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a041a433\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-25T11:44:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone! @eid_e4d35074, I'll reach out if I need anything. Let's keep an eye on the logs for any anomalies just in case.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270225-6-999fb\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270225-6-999fb\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2e1d6568\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-28T21:21:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug about incorrect API rate limiting has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/PitchForce/pull/57.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270228-0-424b6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270228-0-424b6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8df92d08\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-28T21:22:00\", \"text\": \"That's great news, @eid_2e1d6568! Could you explain what caused the issue?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270228-1-36d59\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270228-1-36d59\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2e1d6568\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-28T21:23:00\", \"text\": \"Sure, Julia. The root cause was an overly aggressive rate limiting configuration on our API gateway. It was set too low, which prevented complete data synchronization from external sources, leading to partial customer profiles.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270228-2-906a4\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270228-2-906a4\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a041a433\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-28T21:25:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the clarification, Fiona. How did you manage to fix it?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270228-3-32b73\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270228-3-32b73\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2e1d6568\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-28T21:29:00\", \"text\": \"To resolve it, I adjusted the rate limiting settings to a more balanced threshold that accommodates our peak data retrieval needs without overwhelming the system. I also added monitoring to alert us if we approach the new limit.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270228-4-55e3c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270228-4-55e3c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e4d35074\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-28T21:30:00\", \"text\": \"Nice work, @eid_2e1d6568! That should help prevent similar issues in the future.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270228-5-56b3c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270228-5-56b3c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2e1d6568\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-28T21:33:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Ian. If anyone notices any further issues or has questions, feel free to reach out.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270228-6-7830e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270228-6-7830e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8df92d08\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-28T21:37:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, Fiona. I'll keep an eye on it and let you know if anything comes up.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270228-7-3790a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270228-7-3790a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_66d09012\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-20T10:29:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, let's review the Product Requirements Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We've got some feedback from the recent release that we need to address. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260719-0-f5d40\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260719-0-f5d40\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_ee9ca887\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-20T10:32:00\", \"text\": \"Hey @eid_66d09012, I think we should start by addressing the AI-generated pitches issue. The document mentions personalization, but it seems like we're not capturing enough industry-specific nuances. We might need to expand our training data and enhance our NLP capabilities.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260719-1-17a28\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260719-1-17a28\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_59bbe6f6\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-20T10:35:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, @eid_ee9ca887. From a UX perspective, we should also look at how we're using templates. Over-reliance on generic templates might be part of the problem. Maybe we can add a section on developing more dynamic, context-aware templates?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260719-2-dfe90\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260719-2-dfe90\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_85a4de81\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-20T10:40:00\", \"text\": \"Good point, @eid_59bbe6f6. We should also consider adding a feature for users to provide feedback on pitch quality directly in the UI. This could help the AI learn and adapt more effectively.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260719-3-5e1a4\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260719-3-5e1a4\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_71a4de1d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-20T10:45:00\", \"text\": \"For the performance issues, it seems like we need to revisit our server capacity and load balancing strategies. The document mentions scalability, but we might need more specific strategies for peak times.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260719-4-5782a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260719-4-5782a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_32ff39b2\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-20T10:46:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, @eid_71a4de1d. We should also look into optimizing backend processes. Maybe we can add a section on performance optimization strategies in the document?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260719-5-719f2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260719-5-719f2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_31ca5b45\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-20T10:49:00\", \"text\": \"Regarding CRM integration, the document talks about seamless integration, but we need more API support and partnerships. We should expand on this in the 'Future Enhancements' section.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260719-6-65b3b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260719-6-65b3b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_1cfce648\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-20T10:53:00\", \"text\": \"And for the UI, we need to simplify it for new users. Adding a user-friendly onboarding process or tutorials could help. Let's include this in the 'User Interface' section.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260719-7-5614b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260719-7-5614b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_66d09012\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-20T10:58:00\", \"text\": \"Great suggestions, everyone! 😊 To summarize, we'll enhance the AI engine with more industry-specific data and NLP capabilities, improve template dynamics, optimize server performance, expand CRM integration, and simplify the UI with better onboarding. I'll update the document with these changes and schedule a follow-up meeting to discuss implementation. Thanks for the input! 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260719-8-3e9e5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260719-8-3e9e5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-pAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch--paix-374b62\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_66d09012\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-21T20:32:00\", \"text\": \"Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_paix_product_requirements_document|Product Requirements Document>, thank you everyone!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260721-0-6a429\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260721-0-6a429\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8df92d08\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-31T15:33:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with PitchForce that we need to address ASAP. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270131-0-7f9aa\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270131-0-7f9aa\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8df92d08\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-31T15:34:00\", \"text\": \"First up, we have a 'Data Corruption in Customer Profiles' issue. Customer profiles are showing incorrect data, which affects the pitch generation. This is impacting Customer ID: CUST-0079. The problem lies in the Database Management & Data Synchronization area. @eid_a041a433, can you take this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270131-1-3514e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270131-1-3514e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a041a433\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-31T15:37:00\", \"text\": \"Got it! I'll dive into the database management and see what's causing the data corruption. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270131-2-e7e8b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270131-2-e7e8b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8df92d08\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-31T15:40:00\", \"text\": \"Great, thanks! Next, we have an 'Insufficient Input Sanitization in API Requests' issue. This is a security concern as it could lead to data breaches. It's affecting Customer ID: CUST-0111. @eid_e4d35074, can you handle this?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270131-3-f0c76\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270131-3-f0c76\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e4d35074\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-31T15:41:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, I'll prioritize tightening up the API security and ensure proper input sanitization. Thanks for assigning this to me! 🔒\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270131-4-d8061\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270131-4-d8061\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8df92d08\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-31T15:46:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's an 'API Rate Limiting Misconfiguration' issue. It's causing incomplete data retrieval, which affects Customer ID: CUST-0007. This also falls under Database Management & Data Synchronization. @eid_2e1d6568, can you take a look?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270131-5-bca1d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270131-5-bca1d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2e1d6568\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-31T15:48:00\", \"text\": \"Sure thing! I'll check the rate limiting settings and make sure we get complete data retrieval. Let's get this sorted! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270131-6-f5994\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270131-6-f5994\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8df92d08\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-31T15:49:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone! Let's keep communication open and update each other on progress. Feel free to ask questions or share insights as you work through these issues. 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270131-7-6e38e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270131-7-6e38e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a041a433\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-31T15:53:00\", \"text\": \"Will do! I'll keep you posted on the data corruption fix. 🛠️\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270131-8-10726\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270131-8-10726\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e4d35074\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-31T15:57:00\", \"text\": \"Same here, I'll update once the API security is tightened. 🔐\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270131-9-537c0\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270131-9-537c0\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-f603c3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2e1d6568\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-3