is definitely relevant. I'll dive into their PR and see if there are any optimization techniques we can leverage for our real-time dashboard. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261205-4-3e186\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261205-4-3e186\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d96fb219\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-05T10:12:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome! Lastly, there's a 'Language Model Bias in Sentiment Analysis' issue in the Hugging Face Transformers project. They're dealing with biased sentiment analysis, similar to our bias issue. Here's the PR: https://github.com/huggingface/transformers/pull/185. Bob, this seems right up your alley.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261205-5-42e36\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261205-5-42e36\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df5d4b7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-05T10:13:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Emma! I'll take a look at their approach to handling bias. It might give us some ideas on how to improve our sentiment analysis engine. 🔍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261205-6-7ea76\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261205-6-7ea76\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d96fb219\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-05T10:18:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone! Let's keep these open-source projects in mind as we work through our issues. Feel free to share any insights or solutions you find. 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261205-7-3a992\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261205-7-3a992\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa6ec727\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-05T10:21:00\", \"text\": \"Will do! If anyone else finds something useful, let me know. 🤔\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261205-8-3c904\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261205-8-3c904\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8658e19c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-05T10:26:00\", \"text\": \"Same here, any tips on optimizing real-time updates are welcome! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261205-9-df5fd\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261205-9-df5fd\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df5d4b7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-05T10:30:00\", \"text\": \"I'll reach out if I find any patterns in the bias issue. Let's get these fixed! 💪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261205-10-fb9c3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261205-10-fb9c3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d96fb219\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T23:56:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that might help us with our current issues. Let's take a look at them! 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261002-0-ee9a1\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261002-0-ee9a1\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d96fb219\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T23:58:00\", \"text\": \"First, there's a bug in TensorFlow titled 'Incorrect Emoji Sentiment Classification'. It seems their sentiment analysis model is also misclassifying emojis, similar to our SentimentForce issue. You can check it out here: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/163. @eid_4df5d4b7, this might give you some insights!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261002-1-852a4\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261002-1-852a4\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df5d4b7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-03T00:03:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Emma! I'll review their approach and see if we can apply any of their fixes to our emoji interpretation logic. It's always good to see how others tackle similar problems. 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261002-2-5fbbd\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261002-2-5fbbd\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d96fb219\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-03T00:06:00\", \"text\": \"Next up, we have a PostgreSQL issue titled 'Suboptimal Query Execution Plans'. Their query planner is generating inefficient execution plans, which sounds a lot like our database issue. Here's the link: https://github.com/postgres/postgres/pull/164. Fiona, this might be useful for you!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261002-3-bfd04\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261002-3-bfd04\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa6ec727\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-03T00:08:00\", \"text\": \"Great find, Emma! I'll dive into their PR and see if there are any optimization strategies we can adopt. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261002-4-7518d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261002-4-7518d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d96fb219\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-03T00:10:00\", \"text\": \"Lastly, there's a security flaw in Keycloak's authentication module, allowing unauthorized access to user data. This is quite similar to our security vulnerability. Check it out here: https://github.com/keycloak/keycloak/pull/165. Fiona, since you're already on the security issue, this might be helpful!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261002-5-9284c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261002-5-9284c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa6ec727\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-03T00:12:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Emma! I'll look into their fix and see if it can guide us in patching our vulnerability. Security is a top priority! 🔒\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261002-6-5a0d4\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261002-6-5a0d4\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d96fb219\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-03T00:14:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome! Let's leverage these insights to improve our solutions. If you need any more info or run into issues, just ping me. Let's keep up the great work, team! 💪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261002-7-66b65\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261002-7-66b65\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df5d4b7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-03T00:15:00\", \"text\": \"Will do, thanks for the resources, Emma! It's always helpful to learn from the open-source community. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261002-8-17fca\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261002-8-17fca\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa6ec727\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-03T00:16:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, thanks for coordinating, Emma! Let's get these issues sorted out. 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261002-9-b432b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261002-9-b432b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa6ec727\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-06T13:40:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug titled 'Inefficient Query Execution Plan' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/39.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261006-0-953d7\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261006-0-953d7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa6ec727\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-06T13:42:00\", \"text\": \"The root cause was due to a lack of updated statistics and missing query optimization hints, which led to the database generating suboptimal execution plans for retrieving sentiment data.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261006-1-6de80\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261006-1-6de80\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa6ec727\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-06T13:47:00\", \"text\": \"To fix this, I updated the statistics on the relevant tables and added specific query optimization hints to guide the database management system towards more efficient execution paths.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261006-2-455fb\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261006-2-455fb\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df5d4b7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-06T13:51:00\", \"text\": \"Great work, @eid_fa6ec727! This should help improve the query processing times significantly.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261006-3-f16c0\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261006-3-f16c0\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d96fb219\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-06T13:53:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Fiona! This was a critical issue, and I'm glad it's resolved. I'll run some tests to ensure everything is working smoothly.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261006-4-ebb1b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261006-4-ebb1b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa6ec727\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-06T13:55:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Bob and Emma! Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing. I'm here to help.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261006-5-f96d0\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261006-5-f96d0\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df5d4b7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-06T13:56:00\", \"text\": \"Will do, Fiona. Thanks again for the quick turnaround on this!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261006-6-c5cec\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261006-6-c5cec\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa6ec727\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-09T01:44:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the security vulnerability in the user authentication module.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261008-0-ffc40\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261008-0-ffc40\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa6ec727\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-09T01:48:00\", \"text\": \"The concern was that a flaw allows unauthorized access to sentiment analysis reports, which could risk data privacy.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261008-1-05881\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261008-1-05881\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa6ec727\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-09T01:51:00\", \"text\": \"After reviewing the details, I found that this is not actually a bug that requires fixing.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261008-2-37440\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261008-2-37440\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df5d4b7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-09T01:52:00\", \"text\": \"Hey Fiona, could you explain why it's not a bug? It sounded serious.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261008-3-e05e9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261008-3-e05e9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa6ec727\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-09T01:56:00\", \"text\": \"Sure, Bob. The issue stems from a misunderstanding of how our authentication tokens are supposed to work.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261008-4-f8949\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261008-4-f8949\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa6ec727\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-09T01:57:00\", \"text\": \"The tokens are indeed validated and encrypted correctly. The unauthorized access was due to a misconfiguration in the user roles on the client side.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261008-5-d5995\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261008-5-d5995\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d96fb219\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-09T02:02:00\", \"text