Force\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa6ec727\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-09T02:18:00\", \"text\": \"No problem, happy to help! Let me know if there's anything else you need from my side.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261008-11-5785f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261008-11-5785f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d96fb219\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-30T16:45:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with SentimentForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260930-0-740a7\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260930-0-740a7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d96fb219\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-30T16:46:00\", \"text\": \"First up, we have an issue titled 'Incorrect Sentiment Analysis Due to Emoji Misinterpretation'. The sentiment analysis engine is misinterpreting certain emojis, like the 'smiling face with smiling eyes', as negative. This affects the Sentiment Analysis Engine and impacts leaders who rely on accurate sentiment reports. Customer ID: CUST-0089. @eid_4df5d4b7, this one's for you.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260930-1-33b52\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260930-1-33b52\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-664c13\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df5d4b7\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-30T16:50:00\", \"text\": \"Got it! I'll dive into the emoji interpretation logic and see what's causing the misinterpretation. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260930-2-c30f5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260930-2-c30f5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-emmamil