    "context": "{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_54905dcb\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-12T16:55:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, please check my PR for the new data retrieval endpoints: https://github.com/salesforce/EF_AIX/pull/15. I've implemented endpoints to fetch data from the local environment, which should help with real-time insights through the API. Let me know your thoughts! 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261114-0-0c120\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261114-0-0c120\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df3bcc2\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-12T16:58:00\", \"text\": \"Hey @eid_54905dcb, thanks for sharing! I'll take a look at it now. Excited to see how these endpoints are shaping up! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261114-1-a74fc\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261114-1-a74fc\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2347b567\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-12T17:00:00\", \"text\": \"Hi @eid_54905dcb, I'll review it too. Looking forward to seeing how you've tackled the data retrieval. 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261114-2-5081c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261114-2-5081c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df3bcc2\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-12T17:02:00\", \"text\": \"Alright, I've gone through the PR. The endpoints are well-documented, and I see you've included examples in the API docs. Great job on that! 📚\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261114-3-96b89\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261114-3-96b89\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2347b567\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-12T17:06:00\", \"text\": \"I agree with Alice. The documentation is clear and concise. I also ran some tests, and the data is being fetched correctly from the local environment. Everything seems to be working smoothly. 🛠️\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261114-4-29a56\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261114-4-29a56\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df3bcc2\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-12T17:08:00\", \"text\": \"Performance-wise, the endpoints are responsive, and I didn't encounter any reliability issues during my testing. Looks solid to me! 💪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261114-5-189be\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261114-5-189be\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2347b567\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-12T17:10:00\", \"text\": \"Same here, no performance hiccups on my end either. The endpoints are reliable and quick. Nice work, @eid_54905dcb! 🎉\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261114-6-ebd18\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261114-6-ebd18\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df3bcc2\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-12T17:13:00\", \"text\": \"LGTM, approved! Great work on this, @eid_54905dcb. This will definitely enhance our API capabilities. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261114-7-0a240\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261114-7-0a240\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2347b567\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-12T17:14:00\", \"text\": \"Approved from me too! Everything meets the acceptance criteria. Well done, @eid_54905dcb! 👏\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261114-8-eef38\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261114-8-eef38\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_54905dcb\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-12T17:19:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Alice and Julia! Appreciate the quick review and feedback. Glad everything's in order. 🎉\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261114-9-0ceb8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261114-9-0ceb8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2347b567\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-14T03:38:00\", \"text\": \"@here check some functionalities of our product here https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/EdgeForce/demo_2\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261113-0-d833e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261113-0-d833e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df3bcc2\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-31T04:06:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, please check my PR for implementing user authentication endpoints: https://github.com/salesforce/EF_AIX/pull/12. It includes login and registration functionalities to secure the API. Let me know your thoughts! 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261030-0-b1eea\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261030-0-b1eea\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4b38019b\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-31T04:10:00\", \"text\": \"Hey @eid_4df3bcc2, just took a look at the PR. The endpoints for login and registration are well-implemented. The code is clean and easy to follow. 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261030-1-31110\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261030-1-31110\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2347b567\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-31T04:15:00\", \"text\": \"Hi @eid_4df3bcc2, I reviewed the PR as well. User data is securely stored, and I see that you're using bcrypt for password hashing, which is great! 🔒\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261030-2-eac64\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261030-2-eac64\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_54905dcb\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-31T04:17:00\", \"text\": \"Nice work, @eid_4df3bcc2! I tested the authentication tokens, and they are generated and validated correctly. Everything seems to be working as expected. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261030-3-a8916\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261030-3-a8916\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4b38019b\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-31T04:18:00\", \"text\": \"LGTM, approved! 🎉\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261030-4-9092a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261030-4-9092a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2347b567\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-31T04:23:00\", \"text\": \"Looks good to me too, approved! 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261030-5-b8f41\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261030-5-b8f41\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_54905dcb\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-31T04:24:00\", \"text\": \"All criteria are met, approved! Great job, @eid_4df3bcc2! 👏\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261030-6-55a93\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261030-6-55a93\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df3bcc2\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-31T04:26:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone! Appreciate the quick review and feedback. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261030-7-6927a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261030-7-6927a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_3e076e53\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-15T23:58:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, please check my PR for updating the access control policies to use JWT authentication: https://github.com/salesforce/EF_AIX/pull/16. This update ensures that user permissions are checked based on the claims within the JWT token. Let me know your thoughts! 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261117-0-a1ff9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261117-0-a1ff9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bac7c6c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-16T00:03:00\", \"text\": \"Hey @eid_3e076e53, thanks for sharing! I'll start reviewing it now. Just to confirm, this includes updates to the tests and documentation as well, right?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261117-1-4dbc8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261117-1-4dbc8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_3e076e53\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-16T00:05:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, @eid_bac7c6c4! The tests have been updated to verify the access control logic with JWT claims, and I've also added documentation to describe how access control is managed with JWT. Let me know if you spot anything that needs tweaking!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261117-2-64074\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261117-2-64074\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_edf6a3fc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-16T00:06:00\", \"text\": \"Jumping in to review as well! 🏃‍♀️ Thanks for the heads-up, @eid_3e076e53. I'll focus on how the JWT claims are interpreted for permissions.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261117-3-efab5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261117-3-efab5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bac7c6c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-16T00:07:00\", \"text\": \"Alright, I've gone through the changes. The access control policies seem to correctly interpret the JWT claims, and the tests look comprehensive. The documentation is clear and concise too. Great job, @eid_3e076e53! LGTM, approved! 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261117-4-9574e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261117-4-9574e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_edf6a3fc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-16T00:10:00\", \"text\": \"Just finished my review. Everything checks out from my end as well. The JWT integration is seamless, and the tests are thorough. Documentation is spot on. Well done, @eid_3e076e53! LGTM, approved! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261117-5-acbab\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261117-5-acbab\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_3e076e53\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-16T00:11:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks so much, @eid_bac7c6c4 and Fiona! Really appreciate the quick turnaround and feedback. 🎉 I'll go ahead and merge it now.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261117-6-063ae\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261117-6-063ae\"}\n{\"title\": \"Integrate JWT Authentication into User Login Flow\", \"summary\": \"This PR integrates JWT authentication into the existing user login flow. It modifies the login endpoint to issue a JWT token upon successful authentication and updates the client-side to handle token storage.\", \"link\": \"https://github.com/salesforce/EF_AIX/pull/10\", \"mergeable\": \"True\", \"merged\": \"True\", \"number\": \"10\", \"state\": \"closed\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_3e076e53\"}, \"created_at\": \"2026-10-22T20:53:00\", \"reviews\": [{\"state\": \"APPROVED\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_edf6a3fc\"}, \"comment\": \"The JWT token issuance looks solid, and the client-side handles token storage securely. I ran the tests, and they all pass. Great job on updating them to verify JWT issuance. LGTM, approved! 🎉\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-10-23T05:04:00\"}, {\"state\": \"COMMENTED\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_bac7c6c4\"}, \"comment\": \"The changes to the login tests are comprehensive, and the updated documentation is appreciated. Everything seems to be in order. LGTM, approved! 🚀\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-10-23T05:03:00\"}], \"id\": \"github_com_salesforce_EF_AIX_pull_10\"}\n{\"title\": \"Implement Hardware Compatibility Check Module\", \"summary\": \"Develop a module to perform hardware compatibility checks, ensuring devices meet the necessary requirements for running EF_AIX. This includes checking for supported sensor types and necessary hardware specifications.\", \"link\": \"https://github.com/salesforce/EF_AIX/pull/8\", \"mergeable\": \"True\", \"merged\": \"True\", \"number\": \"8\", \"state\": \"closed\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_2347b567\"}, \"created_at\": \"2026-10-19T05:56:00\", \"reviews\": [{\"state\": \"APPROVED\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_bac7c6c4\"}, \"comment\": \"The module accurately identifies hardware compatibility based on the criteria we discussed. The user documentation is clear and provides good instructions on using the module. LGTM, approved!\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-10-19T17:58:00\"}, {\"state\": \"COMMENTED\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_4b38019b\"}, \"comment\": \"Integration tests look solid and everything passes across different hardware setups. The documentation is spot on and covers all the bases. LGTM, approved!\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-10-19T17:53:00\"}], \"id\": \"github_com_salesforce_EF_AIX_pull_8\"}\n{\"title\": \"Implement User Authentication Endpoints\", \"summary\": \"Develop endpoints for user authentication, including login and registration functionalities, to secure the API.\", \"link\": \"https://github.com/salesforce/EF_AIX/pull/9\", \"mergeable\": \"True\", \"merged\": \"False\", \"number\": \"9\", \"state\": \"closed\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_54905dcb\"}, \"created_at\": \"2026-10-20T00:12:00\", \"reviews\": [{\"state\": \"CHANGES_REQUESTED\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_4b38019b\"}, \"comment\": \"The endpoints for login and registration look solid, and I appreciate the use of bcrypt for password hashing. However, the token validation logic needs revision as it doesn't handle expired tokens correctly. Please address this issue.\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-10-20T12:16:00\"}, {\"state\": \"COMMENTED\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_2347b567\"}, \"comment\": \"I agree with the feedback on the token validation logic. Additionally, please add more unit tests for the token generation and validation process to ensure everything works as expected. Great job on securing the user data!\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-10-20T12:19:00\"}], \"id\": \"github_com_salesforce_EF_AIX_pull_9\"}\n{\"title\": \"Add Support for New Sensor Protocols\", \"summary\": \"Implement support for additional sensor protocols to enhance device compatibility. This PR focuses on updating the device layer to recognize and process data from newly identified sensor types.\", \"link\": \"https://github.com/salesforce/EF_AIX/pull/1\", \"mergeable\": \"True\", \"merged\": \"False\", \"number\": \"1\", \"state\": \"open\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_2347b567\"}, \"created_at\": \"2026-09-26T08:53:00\", \"reviews\": [{\"state\": \"CHANGES_REQUESTED\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_4df3bcc2\"}, \"comment\": \"The device layer updates look solid and recognize the new protocols well. However, the unit tests don't cover all the new sensor protocols. Please add those tests.\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-09-26T16:15:00\"}, {\"state\": \"PENDING\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_4b38019b\"}, \"comment\": \"Great work on the implementation! The documentation needs more detail on the new protocols supported. Please expand on that section.\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-09-26T16:21:00\"}], \"id\": \"github_com_salesforce_EF_AIX_pull_1\"}\n{\"title\": \"Initialize RESTful API Framework\", \"summary\": \"Set up the foundational structure for the RESTful API framework, including necessary libraries and configurations to support API development.\", \"link\": \"https://github.com/salesforce/EF_AIX/pull/2\", \"mergeable\": \"True\", \"merged\": \"False\", \"number\": \"2\", \"state\": \"closed\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_54905dcb\"}, \"created_at\": \"2026-09-29T03:54:00\", \"reviews\": [{\"state\": \"CHANGES_REQUESTED\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_edf6a3fc\"}, \"comment\": \"The project structure looks solid and the libraries are well-chosen and configured. Nice work on that front! Once you add the basic GET endpoint, it should meet all the acceptance criteria.\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-09-29T08:33:00\"}, {\"state\": \"COMMENTED\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_4df3bcc2\"}, \"comment\": \"The setup is clean and organized. However, the server setup doesn't handle HTTP requests yet. Please include a basic endpoint for testing.\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-09-29T08:30:00\"}], \"id\": \"github_com_salesforce_EF_AIX_pull_2\"}\n{\"title\": \"Implement JWT Token Generation and Validation\", \"summary\": \"This PR introduces the functionality to generate and validate JWT tokens for user authentication. It includes the creation of a utility module for handling JWT operations such as token creation, signing, and verification.\", \"link\": \"https://github.com/salesforce/EF_AIX/pull/3\", \"mergeable\": \"True\", \"merged\": \"False\", \"number\": \"3\", \"state\": \"closed\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_3e076e53\"}, \"created_at\": \"2026-10-01T05:04:00\", \"reviews\": [{\"state\": \"CHANGES_REQUESTED\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_bac7c6c4\"}, \"comment\": \"The JWT token generation and validation look solid. However, please update the documentation with usage instructions for the JWT utility.\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-10-01T11:59:00\"}, {\"state\": \"COMMENTED\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_4b38019b\"}, \"comment\": \"The core functionality is in place, but please add unit tests for edge cases like token expiration and invalid signatures to ensure robustness.\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-10-01T11:58:00\"}], \"id\": \"github_com_salesforce_EF_AIX_pull_3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_3e076e53\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-02T14:25:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, please check my PR for implementing middleware for JWT token verification: https://github.com/salesforce/EF_AIX/pull/13. This adds middleware to verify JWT tokens for protected routes, ensuring only requests with valid tokens can access certain endpoints. Let me know your thoughts! 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261106-0-63b87\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261106-0-63b87\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4b38019b\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-02T14:29:00\", \"text\": \"Hey @eid_3e076e53, thanks for sharing! I'll take a look at it now. 🔍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261106-1-30ba7\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261106-1-30ba7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df3bcc2\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-02T14:34:00\", \"text\": \"Checking it out too! Thanks for the heads-up, @eid_3e076e53. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261106-2-15003\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261106-2-15003\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4b38019b\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-02T14:36:00\", \"text\": \"Alright, I've gone through the code. The middleware correctly identifies and rejects requests with invalid or missing JWT tokens. Nice work on that! 👏\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261106-3-33f6a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261106-3-33f6a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df3bcc2\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-02T14:40:00\", \"text\": \"I agree with Charlie. The protected routes are only accessible with a valid JWT token, which is exactly what we need. 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261106-4-07f32\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261106-4-07f32\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4b38019b\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-02T14:45:00\", \"text\": \"Also, I see you've added unit tests to verify the middleware functionality. They look comprehensive and cover all the edge cases I could think of. Great job! 🧪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261106-5-c307e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261106-5-c307e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_