": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_9db3abf4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-25T18:53:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, I noticed that PR# 10 is approved but not merged yet. I heard there's been a change in product direction. Can someone provide more context on this?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261025-0-65d43\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261025-0-65d43\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_edf6a3fc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-25T18:56:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, the product team decided to go in a different direction that doesn't require JWT authentication for the user login flow. So, this PR might not be necessary anymore.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261025-1-41cc2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261025-1-41cc2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c9c3d8d5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-25T18:58:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update. @eid_3e076e53, could you confirm if the PR has been merged or if it's still open?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261025-2-b2172\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261025-2-b2172\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_3e076e53\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-25T19:02:00\", \"text\": \"Hi all, the PR is still open and hasn't been merged yet.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261025-3-63df2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261025-3-63df2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bac7c6c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-25T19:05:00\", \"text\": \"In that case, should we hold off on merging it? It seems like it won't align with the new product strategy.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261025-4-3139b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261025-4-3139b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_1a7d9807\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-25T19:07:00\", \"text\": \"I agree. If the JWT integration isn't needed anymore, it makes sense not to merge it.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261025-5-67ad9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261025-5-67ad9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a9002ae2\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-25T19:09:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed. @eid_3e076e53, could you please ensure that the PR is not merged?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261025-6-3844e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261025-6-3844e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_3e076e53\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-25T19:13:00\", \"text\": \"Sure, I'll make sure it stays unmerged. I'll take the necessary action soon. Thanks for the heads-up, everyone.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261025-7-f788d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261025-7-f788d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2347b567\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-24T09:18:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug titled 'Weak API Authentication' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/EdgeForce/pull/37.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270124-0-f2ffe\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270124-0-f2ffe\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2347b567\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-24T09:22:00\", \"text\": \"The root cause was that our API relied on outdated authentication protocols, which were vulnerable to brute force attacks and credential stuffing.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270124-1-cc5b7\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270124-1-cc5b7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2347b567\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-24T09:26:00\", \"text\": \"To fix this, we implemented OAuth 2.0 with token-based authentication, which significantly enhances security by requiring valid tokens for access. Additionally, we've added rate limiting to mitigate brute force attempts.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270124-2-b09ba\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270124-2-b09ba\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_91523bad\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-24T09:30:00\", \"text\": \"Great work, Julia Smith! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. The new authentication mechanism should really help secure our API.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270124-3-937bd\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270124-3-937bd\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2347b567\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-24T09:32:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, @eid_91523bad! Let me know if you need any further details or if there are any other issues.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270124-4-f564e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270124-4-f564e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2347b567\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-27T01:12:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug about incorrect hyperparameter settings during model updates has been resolved. 🎉\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270126-0-f9024\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270126-0-f9024\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2347b567\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-27T01:17:00\", \"text\": \"The issue was due to a parsing error in the YAML configuration files, which caused certain hyperparameter values to be misinterpreted. This led to suboptimal model performance and inaccurate predictions.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270126-1-10792\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270126-1-10792\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2347b567\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-27T01:19:00\", \"text\": \"I've fixed the bug by updating the configuration parser to correctly handle edge cases in the YAML files. The parser now properly interprets all hyperparameter values, ensuring accurate model updates.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270126-2-0f9f8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270126-2-0f9f8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2347b567\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-27T01:23:00\", \"text\": \"You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/EdgeForce/pull/38\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270126-3-60ac4\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270126-3-60ac4\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_91523bad\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-27T01:25:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, Julia Smith! Great job on resolving this quickly. I'll review the changes in the PR.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270126-4-4baa6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270126-4-4baa6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2347b567\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-27T01:26:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Julia Martinez! Let me know if you have any questions or need further clarification on the changes.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270126-5-21d02\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270126-5-21d02\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_91523bad\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-27T01:30:00\", \"text\": \"Will do. Appreciate the swift resolution. This should help improve our model's performance significantly.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270126-6-ebc34\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270126-6-ebc34\"}\n{\"title\": \"Initialize RESTful API Framework\", \"summary\": \"Set up the foundational structure for the RESTful API framework, including necessary libraries and configurations to support API development.\", \"link\": \"https://github.com/salesforce/EF_AIX/pull/5\", \"mergeable\": \"True\", \"merged\": \"True\", \"number\": \"5\", \"state\": \"closed\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_2347b567\"}, \"created_at\": \"2026-10-09T14:01:00\", \"reviews\": [{\"state\": \"APPROVED\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_edf6a3fc\"}, \"comment\": \"I've reviewed the PR, and everything seems to be in place. The libraries are correctly installed and configured. The server setup is clean and handles HTTP requests as expected. LGTM, approved! 👍\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-10-09T20:47:00\"}, {\"state\": \"COMMENTED\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_4df3bcc2\"}, \"comment\": \"Just finished my review. The setup meets all the acceptance criteria. Great job on the configurations, @eid_2347b567! Approved from my side too! ✅\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-10-09T20:49:00\"}, {\"state\": \"PENDING\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_54905dcb\"}, \"comment\": \"All looks good to me as well. The foundational structure is well thought out, and the server setup is spot on. LGTM, approved! 🎉\", \"submitted_at\": \"2026-10-09T20:53:00\"}], \"id\": \"github_com_salesforce_EF_AIX_pull_5\"}\n{\"title\": \"Enhance API Authentication with Modern Security Protocols\", \"summary\": \"### Summary of the Issue\\nThe API responsible for managing AI models on devices was found to have weak authentication mechanisms, making it vulnerable to unauthorized access through brute force attacks and credential stuffing.\\n\\n### Changes Made\\n- Implemented OAuth 2.0 for secure authentication.\\n- Added rate limiting to prevent brute force attacks.\\n- Integrated multi-factor authentication (MFA) for an additional layer of security.\\n- Updated documentation to reflect the new authentication process.\\n\\n### Testing\\n- Conducted unit tests to ensure the new authentication flow works as expected.\\n- Performed integration tests to verify compatibility with existing systems.\\n- Simulated attack scenarios to confirm the robustness of the new security measures.\", \"link\": \"https://github.com/salesforce/EdgeForce/pull/37\", \"mergeable\": \"True\", \"merged\": \"True\", \"number\": \"37\", \"state\": \"closed\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_2347b567\"}, \"created_at\": \"2027-01-23T23:50:00\", \"reviews\": [{\"state\": \"APPROVED\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"eid_91523bad\"}, \"comment\": \"The changes look great! The implementation of OAuth 2.0 and additional security measures significantly enhance the API's authentication process. All tests have passed, and the documentation is clear. Approved for merge.\", \"submitted_at\": \"2027-01-23T23:04:00\"}], \"id\": \"github_com_salesforce_EdgeForce_pull_37\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_3e076e53\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-01T11:48:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, please check my PR for implementing JWT Token Generation and Validation: https://github.com/salesforce/EF_AIX/pull/3. This includes generating and validating JWT tokens for user authentication, along with a utility module for handling JWT operations. Let me know your thoughts! 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261005-0-24450\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261005-0-24450\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bac7c6c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-01T11:51:00\", \"text\": \"Hey @eid_3e076e53, thanks for sharing! I'll take a look at it now. 🔍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261005-1-7a34b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261005-1-7a34b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4b38019b\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-01T11:52:00\", \"text\": \"Checking it out too! Thanks for the heads-up, @eid_3e076e53. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261005-2-d0098\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261005-2-d0098\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bac7c6c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-01T11:57:00\", \"text\": \"Alright, I've gone through the PR. The JWT token generation with a secret key looks solid, and the validation part is working well too. Great job on that! 👏\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261005-3-d32b1\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261005-3-d32b1\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4b38019b\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-01T11:58:00\", \"text\": \"I agree with Julia, the core functionality seems to be in place. However, I noticed that the unit tests don't cover the edge cases for token expiration and invalid signatures. We might want to add those to ensure robustness. 🛠️\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261005-4-640ab\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261005-4-640ab\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bac7c6c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-01T11:59:00\", \"text\": \"Good catch, Charlie! Also, @eid_3e076e53, I couldn't find any updates in the documentation regarding how to use the JWT utility. It would be helpful to include some instructions for future reference. 📚\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261005-5-4d03a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261005-5-4d03a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_3e076e53\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-01T12:04:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the feedback, @eid_bac7c6c4 and Charlie! I'll work on adding more unit tests for those edge cases and update the documentation with usage instructions. Appreciate the insights! 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261005-6-f11b1\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261005-6-f11b1\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4b38019b\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-01T12:05:00\", \"text\": \"No worries, happy to help! Let us know once you've made the changes, and we'll give it another look. 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261005-7-c42b6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261005-7-c42b6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bac7c6c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-01T12:10:00\", \"text\": \"Sounds good! Looking forward to the updates, @eid_3e076e53. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261005-8-3a998\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261005-8-3a998\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_edf6a3fc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-03T01:38:00\", \"text\": \"@here here’s a quick video showcasing the updates in our last release https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/EdProX/demo_3\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260914-0-cde4b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260914-0-cde4b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-a13a7a\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4b38019b\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-03T04:33:00\", \"text\": \"@here check our product demo here https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/EdgeForce/demo_1\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261003-0-ab051\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261003-0-ab051\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_91523bad\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-18T20:23:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with EdgeForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270118-0-db28c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270118-0-db28c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_91523bad\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-18T20:25:00\", \"text\": \"First up, we have an issue titled 'Inconsistent Model Visualization Updates'. The problem is that model visualizations aren't updating consistently when new data is processed. This affects the User Interface & Visualization Module and is causing frustration for users like CUST-0041. @eid_4df3bcc2, can you take this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270118-1-3c041\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270118-1-3c041\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df3bcc2\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-18T20:29:00\", \"text\": \"Got it! I'll look into the visualization updates and see what's causing the discrepancies. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270118-2-16cd9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270118-2-16cd9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_91523bad\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-18T20:34:00\", \"text\": \"Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Faulty Edge Device Firmware Update' issue. The recent update is disrupting the AI Processing Engine's ability to handle concurrent tasks efficiently, impacting real-time data processing for customers like CUST-0012. @eid_bac7c6c4, can you handle this?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270118-3-1913b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270118-3-1913b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bac7c6c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-18T20:35:00\", \"text\": \"Sure thing! I'll dive into the firmware update and see what's causing the disruption. Real-time processing is crucial, so I'll prioritize this. 🔍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270118-4-3ca5e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270118-4-3ca5e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_91523bad\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-18T20:38:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, @eid_bac7c6c4! Lastly, there's an 'Unresponsive UI During Data Synchronization' issue. The UI becomes unresponsive during data sync, affecting the User Interface & Visualization Module and causing workflow interruptions for users like CUST-0021. @eid_2347b567, can you take a look?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270118-5-c8155\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270118-5-c8155\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2347b567\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-18T20:39:00\", \"text\": \"On it! I'll investigate why the UI is freezing during data sync and work on a fix. Thanks for assigning this to me! 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270118-6-09288\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270118-6-09288\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_91523bad\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-18T20:40:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome, thanks everyone for jumping on these issues so quickly! Let's keep the impacted customers in the loop with updates as we make progress. Feel free to reach out if you need any more info or help. 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270118-7-33441\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270118-7-33441\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df3bcc2\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-18T20:44:00\", \"text\": \"Will do! I'll keep you posted on the visualization updates. 🖼️\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270118-8-54757\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270118-8-54757\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bac7c6c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-18T20:49:00\", \"text\": \"Same here, I'll update once I have more info on the firmware issue. 🔧\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270118-9-7f29a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270118-9-7f29a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\