X is performance degradation with large datasets. This was reported by Customer ID: CUST-0074.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260924-0-04f6d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260924-0-04f6d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-extAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-xtaix-274901\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c7622c8e\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-09T11:43:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for bringing this up, Ian. Since the product was developed by a different team, we might need to dig into their documentation.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260924-1-86283\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260924-1-86283\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-extAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-xtaix-274901\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_7c6dd6a6\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-09T11:45:00\", \"text\": \"Could it be due to inefficient data processing algorithms? If they don't scale well, that could explain the slowdown.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260924-2-cf647\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260924-2-cf647\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-extAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-xtaix-274901\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_3f2087c9\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-09T11:48:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_7c6dd6a6 Good point, Fiona. We should review the algorithms used and see if there's room for optimization.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260924-3-1c3e0\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260924-3-1c3e0\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-extAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-xtaix-274901\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_798684b4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-09T11:51:00\", \"text\": \"Another angle could be insufficient computational resources. Maybe the system isn't allocating enough resources for large datasets.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260924-4-cef7b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260924-4-cef7b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-extAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-xtaix-274901\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_36319f22\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-09T11:55:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, David. We should check the resource allocation settings and see if they can be adjusted for better performance.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260924-5-1d7b5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260924-5-1d7b5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-extAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-xtaix-274901\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-09T11:59:00\", \"text\": \"Also, let's not forget about the data storage and retrieval processes. Lack of optimization there could be a factor too.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260924-6-25f21\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260924-6-25f21\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-extAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-xtaix-274901\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c7622c8e\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-09T12:00:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, Ian. We should look into optimizing those processes as well. It might help improve response times.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260924-7-37fca\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260924-7-37fca\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-extAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-xtaix-274901\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_62db8640\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-09T12:00:15\", \"text\": \"@here Stay updated with this article on how Salesforce is leveraging AI to enhance customer insights and drive business growth. https://www.forbes.com/sites/salesforce-ai-insights\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260909-85-e68e0\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260909-85-e68e0\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-extAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-xtaix-274901\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_7c6dd6a6\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-09T12:05:00\", \"text\": \"Sounds like we have a few areas to investigate. Let's make sure these issues are documented in the planning documents for the next release of extAIX.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260924-8-2a037\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260924-8-2a037\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-extAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-xtaix-274901\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_3f2087c9\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-09T12:09:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, Fiona. I'll start drafting the documentation and share it with the team for input.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260924-9-3c45e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260924-9-3c45e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-extAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-xtaix-274901\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-10T13:38:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_62db8640 joined planning-extAIX.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260910-85-1bdb7\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260910-85-1bdb7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-extAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-xtaix-274901\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd4d2940\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-11T19:52:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, let's review the Market Research Report and update it based on the latest issues reported. We need to address the AI misinterpretation, integration inconsistencies, UI complexity, performance issues, and lack of customization. Thoughts? 🤔\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260910-0-a6dab\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260910-0-a6dab\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-extAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-xtaix-274901\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa16fefb\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-11T19:57:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_bd4d2940 Julia Davis, I think we should add a section on improving AI training data. The current report doesn't mention the diversity of user behavior, which is crucial for accurate insights. We could also highlight plans for enhancing NLP capabilities. What do you think, @eid_82e9fcef?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260910-1-2688f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260910-1-2688f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-extAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-xtaix-274901\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-11T20:02:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, Julia Taylor. We should also include a feedback loop mechanism for continuous learning. This could be a new subsection under 'Future Developments'. It would show our commitment to improving AI models over time. 📈\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260910-2-ac52b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260910-2-ac52b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-extAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-xtaix-274901\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_62db8640\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-11T20:05:00\", \"text\": \"For the integration issues, we might want to emphasize our strategy for comprehensive testing across third-party applications. Maybe add a paragraph under 'Integration' about our approach to handling API variability and improving modularity. Thoughts, @eid_7f69c513?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260910-3-330e9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260910-3-330e9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-extAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-xtaix-274901\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_7f69c513\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-11T20:06:00\", \"text\": \"Great point, George. We should also consider adding user feedback on integration experiences to ensure we're addressing real-world issues. This could be part of the 'Operational' improvements in the report. 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260910-4-2343c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260910-4-2343c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-extAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-xtaix-274901\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd4d2940\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-11T20:07:00\", \"text\": \"Good suggestions, everyone! For the UI complexity, I propose we add a section on simplifying the layout and improving navigation. We could also mention plans for better onboarding resources. @eid_7f69c513, any thoughts on the UX side?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260910-5-30778\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260910-5-30778\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-extAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-xtaix-274901\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_7f69c513\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-11T20:07:14\", \"text\": \"@here Discover how machine learning models can be trained to understand user preferences in this comprehensive blog post. https://machinelearningmastery.com/understanding-user-preferences-with-ml\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260911-94-e7f65\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260911-94-e7f65\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-extAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-xtaix-274901\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_7f69c513\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-11T20:09:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, Julia Davis. We should highlight our efforts to create more intuitive user guidance and possibly a new user training program. This could be a key selling point in the 'Key Features' section. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260910-6-f2ed1\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260910-6-f2ed1\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-extAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-xtaix-274901\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-11T20:13:00\", \"text\": \"Regarding performance, we need to address data processing inefficiencies. Perhaps we can add a technical roadmap for optimizing algorithms and resource allocation. This could fit under 'Architecture'.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260910-7-b0ad8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260910-7-b0ad8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-extAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-xtaix-274901\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_fa16fefb\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-11T20:15:00\", \"text\": \"And for customization, let's include a plan to gather more user feedback to tailor features better. This could be part of 'Future Developments'. It shows we're listening to our users and adapting accordingly. 🎯\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260910-8-4c87c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260910-8-4c87c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-extAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-xtaix-274901\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd4d2940\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-11T20:17:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the input, team! Here's a summary of the changes: \\n1. Add sections on AI training data diversity and NLP improvements.\\n2. Include a feedback loop mechanism for AI models.\\n3. Emphasize comprehensive testing and modularity in integration.\\n4. Simplify UI layout and improve onboarding resources.\\n5. Address data processing inefficiencies and customization feedback.\\nI'll draft these updates and share them for review. Let's aim to finalize by next week. Any other thoughts? 🤝\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260910-9-74f1c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260910-9-74f1c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-05T15:24:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ContextForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270105-0-8f665\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270105-0-8f665\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-05T15:27:00\", \"text\": \"First up, we have an issue titled 'Incorrect Scope Assignment'. Third-party applications are unable to access certain insights due to incorrect scope assignments during the authentication process. This affects the API Authentication Module and is impacting customer CUST-0017. @eid_5782059f, can you take this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270105-1-0c741\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270105-1-0c741\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5782059f\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-05T15:32:00\", \"text\": \"Got it, I'll look into the 'Incorrect Scope Assignment' issue. I'll start by reviewing the authentication process and see where the scope assignments are going wrong. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270105-2-59de9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270105-2-59de9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-05T15:34:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, @eid_5782059f! Next, we have a security concern: 'Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) in Data Insights'. Malicious scripts can be injected into the contextual insights, which could lead to unauthorized access to user data. This affects the Data Transmission & Security Layer and is impacting customer CUST-0108. @eid_b4d260c1, can you handle this?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270105-3-dec25\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270105-3-dec25\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b4d260c1\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-05T15:36:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, I'll prioritize the XSS issue. I'll start by reviewing our data transmission protocols and security measures. Thanks for assigning this to me! 🔍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270105-4-82133\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270105-4-82133\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-05T15:40:00\", \"text\": \"Great, thanks! Lastly, we have 'Incorrect Feature Weighting'. The AI is assigning incorrect weights to user behavior features, which is skewing the analysis and resulting in non-personalized insights. This affects the AI Analysis Engine and is impacting customer CUST-0016. @eid_b4d260c1, since you're already familiar with the AI engine, could you also take this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270105-5-131e3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270105-5-131e3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b4d260c1\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-05T15:45:00\", \"text\": \"Sure thing, I'll dive into the AI Analysis Engine and check the feature weighting logic. I'll make sure to address both issues promptly. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270105-6-159f1\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270105-6-159f1\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-05T15:48:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone, for jumping on these issues so quickly! Let me know if you need any more details or support. Let's keep our customers happy! 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270105-7-a9c14\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270105-7-a9c14\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_5782059f\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-05T15:53:00\", \"text\": \"Will do! I'll keep you posted on the progress. 🛠️\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270105-8-b511c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270105-8-b511c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-iansmith-ContextForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-5ff1be\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b4d260c1\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-05T15:55:00\", \"text\": \"Same here, I'll update as I make progress on both issues. Thanks for coordinating, @eid_82e9fcef! 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270105-9-6779a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270105-9-6779a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-extAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-xtaix-274901\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-26T01:09:00\", \"text\": \"@'eid_36319f22' created this channel on 2026-08-26 01:09:00. This is the very beginning of the planning-extAIX channel.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260826-0-457a3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260826-0-457a3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-extAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-xtaix-274901\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-26T01:09:00\", \"text\": \"@'eid_36319f22' joined planning-extAIX. Also, @eid_36319f22, @eid_0f6b0aea, @eid_82e9fcef, @eid_5782059f, @eid_01942cf0, @eid_3f2087c9, @eid_92c62291, @eid_792330e0, @eid_fa16fefb, @eid_b4d260c1 joined via invite.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260826-1-50ce5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260826-1-50ce5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-extAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-xtaix-274901\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_36319f22\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-26T07:22:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, I just wanted to kick off our discussion about the extAIX product. Let's start by reviewing the documents from the last release. Here are the <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/extprox_market_research_report_final|extprox_market_research_report_final> and <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/latest_extaix_market_research_report|latest_extaix_market_research_report>.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260826-0-f34e9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260826-0-f34e9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-extAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-xtaix-274901\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_82e9fcef\",