o position Einstein Edge AI as the leading solution for real-time edge AI processing, highlighting its ability to transform industries through efficient and secure data processing at the edge.\n\nUser Experience: Einstein Edge AI prioritizes user experience by offering intuitive interfaces and easy setup processes. The system is designed to be user-friendly, allowing users to manage and configure solutions without requiring extensive technical expertise. Enhanced user guidance documentation now includes a step-by-step setup guide with visuals to assist users. A UI redesign focuses on simplicity and customization options for non-technical users, ensuring that organizations can quickly deploy and benefit from the system's capabilities.\nDevelopment Roadmap: The development roadmap for Einstein Edge AI focuses on enhancing core functionalities, expanding device support, and integrating advanced AI capabilities. Future developments will also include the implementation of enhanced security features to further protect user data. The roadmap is designed to ensure that Einstein Edge AI remains at the forefront of edge AI technology, continuously evolving to meet the needs of its users.\nMarketing Strategy: The marketing strategy for Einstein Edge AI targets key industry decision-makers, emphasizing the solution's scalability, security, and ease of integration. The strategy aims to position Einstein Edge AI as the leading solution for real-time edge AI processing, highlighting its ability to transform industries through efficient and secure data processing at the edge.\nSetup Automation Tools: To reduce the technical expertise required for setup, comprehensive setup automation tools are being developed. These tools aim to streamline the installation and configuration process, allowing users to deploy Einstein Edge AI solutions with minimal manual intervention.\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a13234f2\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-04T15:49:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, let's review the Market Research Report and update it based on the latest issues reported. 🚀 Here are the main issues we need to address: complex setup process, inconsistent performance with large datasets, limited integration options, non-intuitive UI, and service disruptions during updates. Let's dive in! 💡\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260904-0-80878\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260904-0-80878\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_91523bad\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-04T15:53:00\", \"text\": \"@Hannah Smith, thanks for kicking this off! For the setup process, I think we should add a section on developing comprehensive setup automation tools. This could include scripts or a guided setup wizard to simplify the process. Thoughts? 🤔\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260904-1-6ca3c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260904-1-6ca3c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b6a30126\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-04T15:58:00\", \"text\": \"I agree with Julia. Also, we should emphasize improving user guidance in the documentation. Maybe a step-by-step video tutorial could help non-technical users. 🎥\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260904-2-1d8c5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260904-2-1d8c5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_df282afb\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-04T16:02:00\", \"text\": \"Good points, Julia and Charlie. For the inconsistent performance issue, I suggest we highlight the need for optimizing data processing algorithms and enhancing resource management. This should be a priority in our development roadmap. 📈\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260904-3-4daa8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260904-3-4daa8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e51b439b\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-04T16:05:00\", \"text\": \"Regarding the UI, we should definitely incorporate more user feedback into the design process. Perhaps adding a section on planned usability testing and iterative design improvements could be beneficial. 🖌️\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260904-4-5554a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260904-4-5554a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a13234f2\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-04T16:07:00\", \"text\": \"Great suggestions, everyone! For the integration options, let's propose expanding our API offerings and exploring partnerships for third-party integrations. This could be a key differentiator in our marketing strategy. 🤝\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260904-5-1b2e9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260904-5-1b2e9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_91523bad\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-04T16:09:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, Hannah. And for the update disruptions, we should include a plan for more rigorous testing and better rollback procedures to ensure reliability. 🔄\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260904-6-b2fe6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260904-6-b2fe6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_df282afb\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-04T16:14:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, Julia. We should also mention the importance of maintaining backward compatibility in our updates to prevent service disruptions. 🔧\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260904-7-08567\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260904-7-08567\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a13234f2\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-04T16:18:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the input, team! Here's a quick summary of the key changes: \\n1. Add automation tools and user guidance for setup.\\n2. Optimize data processing and resource management.\\n3. Expand API offerings and third-party integrations.\\n4. Incorporate user feedback for UI improvements.\\n5. Enhance update testing and rollback procedures.\\n\\nNext steps: I'll draft these changes and share them for final review. Let's aim to finalize by the end of the week. 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260904-8-8d01e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260904-8-8d01e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e51b439b\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-04T16:21:00\", \"text\": \"Sounds like a solid plan, Hannah! Looking forward to seeing the updated draft. Let me know if you need any help with the UX sections. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260904-9-158ef\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260904-9-158ef\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b6a30126\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-04T16:25:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Hannah! I'll be ready to review the technical sections once you've made the updates. 💻\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260904-10-bdd18\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260904-10-bdd18\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a13234f2\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-06T03:02:00\", \"text\": \"Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_ef_aix_market_research_report|Market Research Report>, thank you everyone!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260905-0-b67c2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260905-0-b67c2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-07T03:17:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_bf6c7f21 joined planning-EF_AIX.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260907-92-70b2c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260907-92-70b2c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_caa2e58d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-08T09:58:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, let's review the Product Vision Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. 🚀 We need to address the setup complexity, performance inconsistencies, limited integrations, UI challenges, and update disruptions. Thoughts? @eid_b6a30126 @eid_91523bad @eid_bf6c7f21 @eid_e51b439b\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260908-0-48082\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260908-0-48082\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b6a30126\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-08T09:59:00\", \"text\": \"Hey Bob, for the setup complexity, I think we should add a section in the document about developing comprehensive setup automation tools. This could significantly reduce the technical expertise required. Thoughts, @eid_91523bad?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260908-1-b3b4f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260908-1-b3b4f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_91523bad\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-08T10:01:00\", \"text\": \"I agree, Charlie. We should also enhance the user guidance documentation. Maybe include a step-by-step setup guide with visuals? This could be added under the 'User Experience' section.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260908-2-005f3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260908-2-005f3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bf6c7f21\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-08T10:04:00\", \"text\": \"Good points, both of you. For performance inconsistencies, we might need to revisit the 'Edge Processing Layer' section. Let's consider optimizing our data processing algorithms and resource management strategies. What do you think, @eid_e51b439b?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260908-3-a140e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260908-3-a140e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_e51b439b\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-08T10:07:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, Alice. We should also look into the architecture design to better handle large-scale data. Maybe add a subsection on scalability improvements in the 'System Architecture' part?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260908-4-0b68f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260908-4-0b68f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_caa2e58d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-08T10:12:00\", \"text\": \"Great suggestions! For integration options, should we expand the 'Integration Layer' to include more APIs and connectors? This could help with third-party app compatibility.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260908-5-9cfaa\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260908-5-9cfaa\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b6a30126\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-08T10:17:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, Bob. We need to shift from a closed ecosystem to a more open one. Adding more APIs could be a game-changer for flexibility.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260908-6-e9c9b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260908-6-e9c9b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_91523bad\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-08T10:20:00\", \"text\": \"On the UI front, let's make the interface more intuitive for non-technical users. We could add a section on UI redesign focusing on simplicity and customization options.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260908-7-2ec03\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260908-7-2ec03\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bf6c7f21\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-08T10:25:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, Julia. And for the update disruptions, we should enhance our testing protocols and rollback procedures. Maybe add a 'Reliability and Update Management' section?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260908-8-54a2b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260908-8-54a2b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_caa2e58d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-08T10:27:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone! To summarize, we'll add sections on setup automation, performance optimization, expanded integrations, UI redesign, and update management. Let's draft these changes and reconvene next week to finalize. 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260908-9-a384f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260908-9-a384f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a253c65a\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-22T11:03:00\", \"text\": \"@here here's a short demo highlighting the main features of our last release https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/EdProX/demo_4\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260928-0-c5616\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260928-0-c5616\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-22T11:58:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_a13234f2 joined planning-EF_AIX.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260822-12-43e0d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260822-12-43e0d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-25T12:49:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_9db3abf4, @eid_c9c3d8d5, @eid_1a7d9807 joined planning-EF_AIX.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260825-13-c5a64\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260825-13-c5a64\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_1a7d9807\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-26T15:42:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, one of the common issues reported for EF_AIX is occasional software updates causing temporary service disruptions. This was reported by Customer ID: CUST-0028.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260917-0-f5044\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260917-0-f5044\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_9db3abf4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-26T15:43:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for bringing this up, David. Since the product was developed by a different team, we might need to dig into their update process.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260917-1-0facb\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260917-1-0facb\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c9c3d8d5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-26T15:46:00\", \"text\": \"Could it be that the updates weren't adequately tested before deployment? That might explain the disruptions.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260917-2-b9746\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260917-2-b9746\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a253c65a\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-26T15:50:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_c9c3d8d5 That's a good point, Julia. We should check if there were any gaps in the testing phase.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260917-3-c03cd\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260917-3-c03cd\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c9c3d8d5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-26T15:50:08\", \"text\": \"@here Discover how edge AI is revolutionizing IoT applications in this comprehensive blog post. https://www.iotforall.com/edge-ai-revolutionizing-iot\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260826-18-97666\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260826-18-97666\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2d8eff4d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-26T15:51:00\", \"text\": \"Another angle could be operational. Maybe the update management and rollback procedures weren't robust enough.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260917-4-4c898\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260917-4-4c898\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_caa2e58d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-26T15:53:00\", \"text\": \"Bob here. I think we should also consider design issues, like lack of backward compatibility in the updates.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260917-5-d0ad5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260917-5-d0ad5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_1a7d9807\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-26T15:58:00\", \"text\": \"Great insights, everyone. Let's make sure we document these issues and potential causes in the planning documents for the next release of EF_AIX.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260917-6-467a6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260917-6-467a6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-26T16:38:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_a9002ae2 joined planning-EF_AIX.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260826-21-fab14\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260826-21-fab14\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2d8eff4d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-27T04:07:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers have reported positive things about EF_AIX. It's great to see such feedback!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261123-0-cfbaa\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261123-0-cfbaa\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a9002ae2\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-27T04:10:00\", \"text\": \"That's awesome! What did they say, David?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261123-1-4307e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261123-1-4307e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2d8eff4d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-27T04:13:00\", \"text\": \"Customer CUST-0066 mentioned that EF_AIX's ability to operate in local environments makes it highly reliable, even in areas with unstable internet connectivity.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261123-2-2ddd6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261123-2-2ddd6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b6a30126\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-27T04:15:00\", \"text\": \"That's a huge plus! Especially for remote areas. Any other feedback?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261123-3-ba314\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261123-3-ba314\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_91523bad\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-27T04:18:24\", \"text\": \"@here Check out this insightful blog post on the benefits of edge AI for real-time data processing. It dives deep into how edge computing can enhance AI capabilities on local devices. https://towardsdatascience.com/edge-ai-the-future-of-artificial-intelligence-5f4f8b8e5f5b\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260827-28-95adf\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260827-28-95adf\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2d8eff4d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-27T04:19:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, @eid_caa2e58d, Customer CUST-0046 highlighted EF_AIX's capability to handle AI processing on-device, which allows for greater scalability and flexibility.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261123-4-95641\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261123-4-95641\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_caa2e58d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-27T04:20:00\", \"text\": \"Impressive! The previous team did a fantastic job with these features.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261123-5-e0045\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261123-5-e0045\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_91523bad\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-27T04:25:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, Bob. It's great to see the product being appreciated for its strengths.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261123-6-66199\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261123-6-66199\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c9c3d8d5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-27T04:29:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, Julia. We should definitely build on these strengths in our future updates.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261123-7-ba543\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261123-7-ba543\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b6a30126\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-27T04:33:00\", \"text\": \"Yes, let's make sure we maintain and enhance these capabilities. It's a solid foundation to work from.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261123-8-84e55\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261123-8-84e55\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a9002ae2\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-27T04:34:00\", \"text\": \"Looking forward to our next steps with EF_AIX. Let's keep the momentum going!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261123-9-e7612\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261123-9-e7612\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b6a30126\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-18T20:26:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, let's review the System Design Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We've got some feedback from the latest release of EF_AIX that we need to address. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260918-0-defa9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260918-0-defa9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a253c65a\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-18T20:30:00\", \"text\": \"Hey Charlie, I think we should start by enhancing the 'User Experience' section. The setup process is currently too complex. We could add a subsection on 'Setup Automation' and detail scripts or tools that could simplify this process. Thoughts? 🤔\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260918-1-1d2ec\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260918-1-1d2ec\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_a9002ae2\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-18T20:34:00\", \"text\": \"@Hannah Brown, I agree. Also, we should expand the 'User Experience' section to include more detailed user guidance. Maybe a step-by-step guide or a video tutorial link? This could help non-technical users a lot. 📚\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260918-2-c2bf8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260918-2-c2bf8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c9c3d8d5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-18T20:35:00\", \"text\": \"Good point, Bob. We should also consider adding a 'Support Resources' section under 'Operational' to outline available support channels and resources. This could address the lack of support during setup. 📞\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260918-3-c9ddd\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260918-3-c9ddd\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_9db3abf4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-18T20:39:00\", \"text\": \"For the performance issues, we might need to revisit the 'Edge Processing Layer' section. We should specify improvements in data processing algorithms and resource management. Maybe add a note on optimizing for large datasets? 📈\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260918-4-e5750\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260918-4-e5750\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_1a7d9807\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-18T20:42:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, Alice. We should also mention the need for hardware compatibility checks in the 'Device Layer' section to ensure consistent performance across different devices. 🔍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260918-5-40cb8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260918-5-40cb8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_caa2e58d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-18T20:43:00\", \"text\": \"Regarding integration, the 'Integration Layer' should include a plan for developing more APIs and connectors. This will help with third-party application integration. Let's make it a priority in the development roadmap. 🔗\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260918-6-35b70\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260918-6-35b70\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2d8eff4d\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-18T20:44:00\", \"text\": \"And for the UI issues, we should add a 'User Feedback Loop' section in the 'User Experience' part. This can help us continuously improve the UI based on user input. 🖥️\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260918-7-35619\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260918-7-35619\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-EF_AIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-f_aix-30c6d3\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b6a30126\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-18T20:46:00\", \"text\": \"Great suggestions, everyone! To summarize: we'll add setup automation details, enhance user guidance, outline support resources, optimize data processing, ensure hardware compatibility, expand integration options, and incorporate user feedback. Let's update the document accordingly and schedule a follow-up meeting to review the changes. Thanks for the input! 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260918-8-f1ae0\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260918-8-f1ae0\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\