eplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260821-8-02a2d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2347b567\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-27T01:12:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug about incorrect hyperparameter settings during model updates has been resolved. 🎉\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270126-0-f9024\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270126-0-f9024\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2347b567\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-27T01:17:00\", \"text\": \"The issue was due to a parsing error in the YAML configuration files, which caused certain hyperparameter values to be misinterpreted. This led to suboptimal model performance and inaccurate predictions.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270126-1-10792\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270126-1-10792\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2347b567\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-27T01:19:00\", \"text\": \"I've fixed the bug by updating the configuration parser to correctly handle edge cases in the YAML files. The parser now properly interprets all hyperparameter values, ensuring accurate model updates.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270126-2-0f9f8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270126-2-0f9f8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2347b567\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-27T01:23:00\", \"text\": \"You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/EdgeForce/pull/38\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270126-3-60ac4\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270126-3-60ac4\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_91523bad\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-27T01:25:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, Julia Smith! Great job on resolving this quickly. I'll review the changes in the PR.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270126-4-4baa6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270126-4-4baa6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2347b567\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-27T01:26:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Julia Martinez! Let me know if you have any questions or need further clarification on the changes.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270126-5-21d02\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270126-5-21d02\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_91523bad\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-27T01:30:00\", \"text\": \"Will do. Appreciate the swift resolution. This should help improve our model's performance significantly.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270126-6-ebc34\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270126-6-ebc34\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_91523bad\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-29T13:32:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with EdgeForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270129-0-78c77\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270129-0-78c77\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_91523bad\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-29T13:35:00\", \"text\": \"First up, we have a 'Memory Leak in Visualization Rendering'. This is affecting the User Interface & Visualization Module, causing slow performance and crashes. Customer CUST-0076 is impacted. @eid_4df3bcc2, this one's for you.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270129-1-78766\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270129-1-78766\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df3bcc2\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-29T13:36:00\", \"text\": \"Got it! I'll start looking into the memory leak issue right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270129-2-329b6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270129-2-329b6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_91523bad\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-29T13:38:00\", \"text\": \"Great, thanks! Next, there's a 'Version Mismatch in Model Deployment'. This is causing discrepancies in predictions, affecting Customer CUST-0088. It's in the Model Management & Update Module. @eid_4df3bcc2, you're also on this one.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270129-3-06832\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270129-3-06832\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df3bcc2\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-29T13:43:00\", \"text\": \"Understood. I'll make sure to address the version mismatch issue as well. If anyone has insights on recent deployments, let me know! 🤔\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270129-4-80962\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270129-4-80962\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_91523bad\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-29T13:44:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, @eid_4df3bcc2! Lastly, we have a 'Cache Invalidation Failure' in the API Layer. This is leading to stale data being served, impacting Customer CUST-0101. @eid_edf6a3fc, can you take this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270129-5-0708d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270129-5-0708d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_edf6a3fc\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-29T13:48:00\", \"text\": \"Sure thing! I'll dive into the cache invalidation issue and see what's causing the stale data. If anyone has logs or recent changes to the API, please share! 📊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270129-6-83917\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270129-6-83917\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_91523bad\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-29T13:53:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome, thanks everyone for jumping on these so quickly! Let's keep the communication open and update each other as we make progress. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270129-7-000b3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270129-7-000b3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df3bcc2\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-29T13:55:00\", \"text\": \"Will do! I'll keep you all posted on the visualization and model deployment issues. 🛠️\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270129-8-fac61\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270129-8-fac61\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_edf6a3fc\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-29T13:56:00\", \"text\": \"Same here, I'll update once I have more info on the cache issue. Thanks for coordinating, @eid_91523bad! 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270129-9-e583f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270129-9-e583f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df3bcc2\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-04T06:16:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug about inconsistent model visualization updates has been resolved. 🎉\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270203-0-db28d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270203-0-db28d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df3bcc2\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-04T06:20:00\", \"text\": \"The issue was due to a race condition in the event handling system. Updates to the visualization were not synchronized with the data processing pipeline, leading to discrepancies.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270203-1-ff3ae\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270203-1-ff3ae\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df3bcc2\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-04T06:22:00\", \"text\": \"I've implemented a fix by introducing a locking mechanism that ensures the visualization updates only after the data processing is complete. This should prevent any out-of-sync issues.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270203-2-ab4f4\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270203-2-ab4f4\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df3bcc2\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-04T06:26:00\", \"text\": \"You can check out the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/EdgeForce/pull/39\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270203-3-1ac96\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270203-3-1ac96\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2347b567\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-04T06:31:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, @eid_4df3bcc2! This should make our visualizations much more reliable.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270203-4-970e8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270203-4-970e8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bac7c6c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-04T06:33:00\", \"text\": \"Great work, Alice! I'll test this out with some new data sets to ensure everything is working smoothly.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270203-5-7cf13\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270203-5-7cf13\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_91523bad\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-04T06:36:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Alice. This was a tricky one. Let me know if you need any help with further testing.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270203-6-67aa4\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270203-6-67aa4\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4df3bcc2\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-04T06:38:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Julia Smith, Julia Jones, and Julia Martinez! Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270203-7-ed555\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270203-7-ed555\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_91523bad\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-05T10:41:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with EdgeForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270205-0-cecaa\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270205-0-cecaa\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_91523bad\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-05T10:46:00\", \"text\": \"First up, we have an issue titled 'Inconsistent API Responses Under High Load'. The API layer is returning inconsistent responses when under high request loads, impacting developers and applications relying on it. This is affecting Customer CUST-0094. @eid_2347b567, can you take this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270205-1-6942f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270205-1-6942f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2347b567\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-05T10:51:00\", \"text\": \"Got it! I'll look into the API layer and see what's causing the inconsistency under load. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270205-2-2a7fa\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270205-2-2a7fa\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_91523bad\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-05T10:55:00\", \"text\": \"Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Insufficient Model Access Logging'. The security & access control area lacks comprehensive logging, which is a risk for unauthorized access. This is impacting Customer CUST-0071. @eid_edf6a3fc, can you handle this?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270205-3-97c3b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270205-3-97c3b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_edf6a3fc\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-05T10:58:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, I'll dive into the logging mechanisms and enhance them to ensure better security. Thanks for assigning this to me! 🔍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270205-4-d4bed\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270205-4-d4bed\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_91523bad\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-05T11:02:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's 'Inefficient Data Pipeline Synchronization'. The AI Processing Engine is experiencing bottlenecks, affecting real-time data processing for Customer CUST-0101. @eid_4b38019b, can you take a look?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270205-5-78f65\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270205-5-78f65\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4b38019b\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-05T11:06:00\", \"text\": \"Sure thing! I'll investigate the data pipeline synchronization issues and work on optimizing it. Thanks for the update! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270205-6-90458\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270205-6-90458\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_91523bad\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-05T11:11:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone! Let's keep the impacted customers in the loop with our progress. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or additional resources. Let's get these resolved! 💪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270205-7-8c078\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270205-7-8c078\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_2347b567\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-05T11:13:00\", \"text\": \"Will do! I'll keep you posted on the API issue. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270205-8-f2039\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270205-8-f2039\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_edf6a3fc\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-05T11:16:00\", \"text\": \"Same here, I'll update once I have more info on the logging improvements. 🔒\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270205-9-26a54\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270205-9-26a54\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-7bfbef\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4b38019b\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-02-05T11:18:00\", \"text\": \"I'll make sure to provide updates on the data pipeline as well. Thanks, team! 🤝\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270205-10-de094\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270205-10-de094\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-28f51f\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-06T11:31:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_b6a30126 created this channel on 2027-01-06 11:31:00. This is the very beginning of the bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce channel.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270106-0-94d0f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270106-0-94d0f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-28f51f\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-06T11:31:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_b6a30126 joined bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce. Also, @eid_a0fe567d, @eid_5058fefc, @eid_4555ba9c, @eid_3e076e53, @eid_54905dcb joined via invite.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270106-1-10f24\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270106-1-10f24\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-28f51f\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b6a30126\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-06T13:02:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with EdgeForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270106-0-3d920\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270106-0-3d920\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-28f51f\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b6a30126\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-06T13:05:00\", \"text\": \"First up, we have an issue titled 'Insecure Model Serialization'. The problem is that AI models are being serialized and stored in an unencrypted format. This affects the Security & Access Control area and poses a significant risk, especially for environments handling confidential data. Impacted customer is CUST-0095. @eid_3e076e53, this one's for you.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270106-1-22057\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270106-1-22057\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-28f51f\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_3e076e53\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-06T13:09:00\", \"text\": \"Got it, thanks for the heads-up! I'll start looking into securing the serialization process to prevent unauthorized access. 🔒\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270106-2-2e52a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270106-2-2e52a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-28f51f\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b6a30126\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-06T13:12:00\", \"text\": \"Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Rate Limiting Misconfiguration'. API requests are being throttled unexpectedly due to incorrect settings, impacting the API Layer. This is causing issues for developers and applications relying on consistent data retrieval. Customer affected is CUST-0078. @eid_54905dcb, can you take this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270106-3-e7691\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270106-3-e7691\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-28f51f\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_54905dcb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-06T13:16:00\", \"text\": \"Sure thing! I'll review the rate limiting configurations and make the necessary adjustments to ensure smooth API operations. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270106-4-ce99a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270106-4-ce99a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-28f51f\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b6a30126\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-06T13:21:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome, thanks! Lastly, we have 'Delayed Response in Interactive Dashboards'. Users are experiencing significant delays when interacting with data visualizations in the UI. This affects the User Interface & Visualization Module and is causing frustration for CUST-0077. @eid_4555ba9c, can you handle this?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270106-5-de034\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270106-5-de034\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-28f51f\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4555ba9c\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-06T13:23:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, I'll dive into the dashboard performance issues and work on optimizing the response times. 🛠️\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270106-6-44df2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270106-6-44df2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-28f51f\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b6a30126\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-06T13:28:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone! Let's keep the impacted customers updated on our progress. Feel free to reach out if you need any additional resources or support. 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270106-7-dc915\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270106-7-dc915\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-28f51f\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_3e076e53\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-06T13:30:00\", \"text\": \"Will do! Thanks for coordinating, @eid_b6a30126. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270106-8-96492\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270106-8-96492\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-28f51f\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_54905dcb\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-06T13:34:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, @eid_b6a30126! Let's get these issues sorted out. 💪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270106-9-08200\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270106-9-08200\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-28f51f\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_4555ba9c\", \"timestamp\": \"2027-01-06T13:38:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the info, @eid_b6a30126. Let's make it happen! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20270106-10-f5984\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20270106-10-f5984\"}\n\nUser Experience: Einstein Edge AI prioritizes user experience by offering intuitive interfaces and easy setup processes. The system is designed to be user-friendly, allowing users to manage and configure solutions without requiring extensive technical expertise. A subsection on incorporating user feedback into the UI design has been added, focusing on intuitive design for non-technical users and offering more user-friendly features or customization options. This focus on usability ensures that organizations can quickly deploy and benefit from the system's capabilities.\nDevelopment Roadmap: The development roadmap for Einstein Edge AI focuses on enhancing core functionalities, expanding device support, and integrating advanced AI capabilities. Future developments will also include the implementation of enhanced security features to further protect user data. The roadmap is designed to ensure that Einstein Edge AI remains at the forefront of edge AI technology, continuously evolving to meet the needs of its users.\nMarketing Strategy: The marketing strategy for Einstein Edge AI targets key industry decision-makers, emphasizing 